window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3501,"title":"Chapter 3501 - Going to Make A Fortune (6)","paragraphs":["Moreover, the safe path that Huang Yueli led them through just now has also become unsafe.","The four guards were attacked by evil qi and they fell to the ground on their knees, trying their best to suppress the evil qi.","Huang Yueli quickly shouted out to them: “Brother Tianyi! You guys have to hurry up and enter the ball of light, quick! It’s safer inside than outside! Besides, the ball of light is about to start teleporting! If you don’t come in again, you all will die outside!”","Li Tianyi and the others were already rushing towards the ball of light. When they heard this, their hearts trembled. They immediately used all their strength and rushed in with all their might.","Six people squeezed into the small ball of light, which was actually very crowded.","Moreover, Li Tianyi and the others obviously did not have the strength of Li Moying. Under the oppression of the pressure inside the ball of light, their faces were all pale, but they could only support themselves with all their strength.","Fortunately, the time for the entrance to open will soon arrive.","After persisting for more than ten breaths, the ball of light suddenly began to spin rapidly.","The people in the ball of light were all dizzy and nauseated. Only Huang Yueli felt a little better because she was protected in Li Moying’s embrace.","They didn’t know how long it took before the ball of light stopped spinning, and at the same time, the coercion gradually dissipated.","Everyone opened their eyes and found that they were already in a completely unfamiliar land.","“This is the abode of Saint Iniquitous Shadow...”","As Huang Yueli spoke, she looked at the surrounding environment thoughtfully.","Just now, when she encountered such a sudden change when she entered the secret realm, she thought that the interior of this secret realm would also be full of dangers.","But, in fact, the abode of this astonishingly powerful senior cultivator was...completely different from what they imagined.","“This looks a little too ordinary!” Li Tianer exclaimed out loud.","Although the other guards didn’t speak, they all had expressions of surprise on their faces.","This secret realm looks very small, with a radius of only a dozen miles, and the end could be seen at a glance.","The centre of the secret realm was an exquisite and beautiful hut surrounded by many rockeries and ponds.","The surrounding area was a reclaimed farmland, where many rare medicinal herbs were planted and some spirit beasts were raised.","Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up when she saw those herbs.","These medicinal herbs themselves were rare high-level materials, and they have been sealed in this secret realm for tens of thousands of years, and yet they still look so lush.","These were ten thousand year old medicinal materials!","Any one of them was a priceless treasure!","The refined elixir would be more than a hundred times more effective than ordinary elixirs!","However, after a short period of excitement, Huang Yueli frowned slightly.","Because, this secret realm looks too ordinary. For ordinary cultivators in the God Realm, this size was a very spacious residence. Moreover, the environment was so good, and the profound energy was so rich, it was simply a treasure trove with good feng shui.","However, for a top exponent who was proficient in both the Divine and Sky Devil wayslike the Saint Iniquitous Shadow, it seems too shabby!","Although Huang Yueli has never seen the cave abodes of other exponents of the Fate Profound Realm, even if she thinks about it with her toes, she knows that it was absolutely impossible to be so ordinary!","At least a grand palace must be built, surrounded by countless arrays and traps, a magnificent world with a large number of servants to serve him, right?","But these, the Saint Iniquitous Shadows didn’t seem to have them here.","“Young Master, Madame, what should we do now...?”","The guards didn’t dare to move rashly, they all turned their eyes to Li Moying and Huang Yueli, waiting for their instruction."]},{"number":3502,"title":"Chapter 3502 - Qilin Meat is Delicious (1)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli frowned and thought for a while, before saying: “The map only shows the location of the secret realm, but not the situation inside the secret realm. There is no other way now, we can only go ahead and have a look.”","Everyone was already eager to explore. After hearing Huang Yueli’s words, they all looked in the direction of the hut.","In the entire secret realm, there was only one house. According to common sense, most of the most valuable things should be in the hut.","Huang Yueli hurriedly added, “Although I don’t feel any danger now, everyone should proceed with caution. I always feel that the abode of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow is not such a simple place...”","When they entered just now, they had narrowly escaped unscathed.","!!","This was enough to prove that Saint Iniquitous Shadow had arrangements inside and outside the secret realm, and it was impossible for people to take away his life’s collection so easily.","The guards hurriedly nodded in agreement, followed Huang Yueli’s instructions, and walked towards the hut along the path in the medicine field.","Li Moying was not in a hurry, and slowly followed Huang Yueli.","At the beginning, Huang Yueli put up all her energy and was always observing and sensing the surrounding situation, ready to deal with all kinds of emergencies emerging at any time.","However, nothing unusual happened until everyone reached the door of the hut.","Li Tianyi and the others subconsciously stopped and turned to look at Huang Yueli, not daring to open the door.","Huang Yueli studied the door of the hut as she slowly looked up and down, looked around, and finally said in a low voice: “There seems to be nothing unusual... There is not even a defensive array! Could it be that we just went in like this?”","If things were so easy and simple, it would be unbelievable!","Having lived two lives, she had explored quite a few secret realms, and she had never encountered such a situation.","Could it be that the secret realm of the God Realm is different from the Lower Realm, that’s why it was so different?","This situation was so weird that even Huang Yueli was a little uncertain, so she looked back at Li Moying.","Li Moying contemplated for a while before he said,”There shouldn’t be any traps here, everyone just go in!”","Huang Yueli did not expect that his tone would be so full of confidence, so she couldn’t help being startled.","“Are you sure?”","Li Moying nodded, “Yes!”","After Li Moying said that, Huang Yueli naturally chose to trust him. She raised her hand and waved at the four guards, “Let’s go in and have a look then!”","“Yes!”","Li Tianyi and the others immediately stepped forward, first tentatively pushing the door open.","The door creaked and trembled a bit, and a lot of dust fell when they pushed it open—as expected, there was no trap!","Watching Li Tianyi and the others enter the hut, Huang Yueli did not rush to follow, but turned around and gave Li Moying a strange look, “Moying, how do you know that there is no danger in this hut?”","Li Moying met her doubtful bright eyes, and said softly, “I don’t know why? However, the evil qi pervading here makes me feel very comfortable, and it is even easier to absorb than the profound energy of heaven and earth. I inhaled it unintentionally. A trace of evil qi in my body turned into the cultivation base in my body... The surrounding environment also gave me a familiar and close feeling...”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment, “What? How is it possible?”","She subconsciously mobilized the profound energy in her body, and immediately after, a look of astonishment appeared on her face!"]},{"number":3503,"title":"Chapter 3503 - Qilin Meat is Delicious (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3503: Qilin Meat is Delicious (2)","Because, she found that, like Li Moying, her profound strength in the body has also been significantly improved!","Aware of this, Huang Yueli almost exclaimed: “What’s going on? Why can these evil qi be absorbed by ordinary cultivators like us? We have never practiced the evil way!”","Huang Yueli had never thought of such a situation before!","Because, judging from the rumors about evil cultivators circulating in the God Realm, the cultivation methods of evil cultivators should be completely different from ordinary cultivators, especially the way of absorbing energy and enhancing their own strength.","As an ordinary cultivator, when one comes into contact with evil qi, one should only feel discomfort. How could it make them feel very comfortable instead?","“What kind of techniques does this Saint Iniquitous Shadow practice? Why is it so strange??”","Huang Yueli suddenly became nervous!","When things go wrong, there’s a bad reason behind it!","The evil qi here was so strange, it may not be a good thing! Maybe they feel good when they absorb it now, and they can enhance their own strength. When the amount of absorption reaches a certain level, they suffer a backlash instead!","Li Moying didn’t seem so worried, he shook his head and said, “I think it’s not the Saint Iniquitous Shadow that is strange, but... us!”","Huang Yueli was stunned, “What do you mean?”","Li Moying said: “I deliberately walked at the end just now and observed Tianyi and the others’ reactions. After they entered the secret realm, they were obviously affected by evil qi. Although the concentration of evil qi here is not high, it also caused them a lot of damage. With a certain amount of damage, the speed and intensity of their attacks have weakened a lot compared to when they were outside...”","“However, I think my speed has improved a lot! Why are Big Brother Tianyi and the others like this?” Huang Yueli raised her hands and put them in front of her eyes, her face full of doubts.","But soon, a flash of light suddenly flashed in her mind!","“Could it be because...because...”","She looked at Li Moying in disbelief, “Is it because of the technique of splitting the soul? We have used the technique of splitting the soul before, so we already have the foundation of the evil way in our body, so we can absorb these evil qi?”","Li Moying nodded and said, “I guessed the same way, this is the only explanation. Moreover, before I entered the secret realm, I guessed that such a situation would occur. Because, in order to cast the soul-splitting technique , I did cultivate the practices left by the Saint Iniquitous Shadows, and these were used to enhance the strength of the primordial spirit, so even if I was reincarnated later, I was still affected by these practices. But... ...”","He paused, his eyes fell on Huang Yueli, and he frowned slightly, “However, I didn’t expect you to be so sensitive to these evil qi! According to common sense, after my primordial spirit was unified, those practices should not affect you anymore.”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes, quickly analyzing the situation in front of her mind.","“I’m guessing that although I have given you back the part of the primordial spirit that you gave me, but because of the past ten years, my consciousness has been influenced by you, and it was also cultivating these practices under subtle influence. Therefore, although I don’t feel it myself, I can be considered to have cultivated these as well!”","“It can only be explained like this now.” Li Moying nodded slightly."]},{"number":3504,"title":"Chapter 3504 - Qilin Meat is Delicious (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3504: Qilin Meat is Delicious (3)","The two of them looked at each other, and they both saw a trace of worry in each other’s eyes.","Although these evil qi seem to be very helpful to their cultivation, and for the time being, they don’t seem to have any negative effects on their bodies.","But, this was evil qi after all!","According to the legends, evil cultivators transformed the energy absorbed from living people and devil stones into evil qi!","What would the result be if such evil power enters the meridians? If it was rejected and countered, it will cause serious consequences and they might even experience a qi deviation and go crazy!","Moreover, there have always been legends in the God Realm that cultivators who practice evil methods will gradually become bloodthirsty and brutal, losing their humanity. They don’t want to become like this!","Seeing that Huang Yueli was a little uneasy, Li Moying reached out and grabbed her little hand, “Little Li’er, don’t worry, it seems that these evil qi are only good for us. Let’s try not to absorb them, just the little bit we inhaled earlier, it shouldn’t have much impact.”","Huang Yueli glanced at him, and slightly curled her lips, “I’m alright! It’s just a little bit of evil qi! Now that we’re ready, it’s enough to keep these evil qi out!”","Li Moying smiled, and held her hand, “I don’t know what good things they found but they’re actually yelling inside, come on, let’s go in and have a look!”","Huang Yueli nodded with a smile, and followed him forward.","However, the moment Li Moying turned his head, the smile on Huang Yueli’s face disappeared, and her eyes were full of worry.","What she said just now was actually just to comfort him.","In fact, although she wasn’t worried about her situation, she was secretly worried for Li Moying.","If she simply inhaled a little bit of evil qi, Huang Yueli didn’t believe that there would be much trouble, so she could just find a way to refine it in the future.","However, Li Moying actually cultivated evil practices from so many years ago!","Back then, Li Moying used the soul splitting technique to protect her last bit of consciousness, so he made such a bad move! Although Li Moying said it lightly, as if he had only cultivated for a few days, Huang Yueli actually had some memories of Li Moying’s previous life. He has worked hard on those practices, and with his amazing talent and comprehension, he has gained quite a deep attainment...","It’s just that, when they were in the lower realm, Huang Yueli and the others had limited knowledge and didn’t know what evil practices meant.","Thinking about it now, Li Moying planted a ticking time bomb in his body by doing so.","As if sensing that Huang Yueli was distracted, Li Moying suddenly turned his head, “Little Li’er, what’s wrong with you? Why haven’t you spoken and why are you walking so slowly?”","Huang Yueli suddenly came back to her senses, “Ah? I...I was thinking...”","“What are you thinking?” Li Moying’s starry eyes flickered slightly, staring closely at her delicate face.","Huang Yueli was at a loss for words for a moment.","What she was thinking was that she must carefully search for the treasures left by the Saint Iniquitous Shadow. It would be best to get a few more sets of evil practices and study them carefully to find out what effect these practices have on the cultivators.","However, this could not be said to Li Moying.","Just when she was in a dilemma, she suddenly felt a burst of noisy voices coming from her Sky Phoenix Ring.","“Big Female Devil, I want to go out! Let me out quickly!” Little Wang Cai yelled."]},{"number":3505,"title":"Chapter 3505 - Qilin Meat is Delicious (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3505: Qilin Meat is Delicious (4)","Huang Yueli was taken aback by the sound that suddenly sounded in her mind, and hurriedly relaxed the restraint.","The next moment, a young phoenix appeared beside them.","Little Wang Cai has grown quite large now, the size of a white crane and with its wings fully stretched out, its wingspan could reach a length of more than one metre.","However, compared with the real adult big phoenix, it was still a very small one.","Seeing Wang Cai suddenly appear, Li Moying was immediately distracted and looked at it in astonishment, “How did this little thing come out?”","Before Huang Yueli could speak, Li Moying suddenly frowned, “Why are you...?”","“What?” Huang Yueli was confused by his words.","But the next moment, Li Moying’s little purple Qilin also appeared on the grass.","The Little Qilin was obviously bigger than Wang Cai!","Because it stayed with Li Moying in the Cloudy Qilin Clan for a whole year. Although the Cloudy Qilin Clan had the experience of raising Qilins millions of years ago and Qilins were rare now, there were still a lot of breeding secrets left by senior masters.","The prodigal Little Qilin was fed a lot of thunder-type materials every day, and with training, it’s strength improved greatly.","Originally, when it was in the lower realm, it was much smaller than Little Wang Cai and was always bullied by Little Wang Cai, but now, Little Wang Cai can no longer bully it. On the contrary, he was often beaten...","Seeing the appearance of the Little Qilin, Little Wang Cai immediately fluttered his wings and flew to high ground.","And Little Qilin’s first reaction was to jump up and pounce towards the flaming red phoenix in the sky!","“Chirp chirp chirp!!”","Little Wang Cai suddenly shot up!","However, Little Qilin’s jumping ability was also very good. When one paw went down, Little Wang Cai escaped from under its paw, but two of the beautiful tail feathers on the tail were plucked.","Li Moying quickly raised his hand and held down his divine beast.","“Lilac Jadeite, come back, don’t mess around!”","The Little Qilin was obviously afraid of it’s master. After hearing his scolding, it immediately lowered it’s head obediently and fell at Li Moying’s feet.","Huang Yueli also said to Little Phoenix, “Wang Cai, come here too. Lilac Jadeite won’t hurt you anymore.”","However, Little Wang Cai did not buy it, fluttered its wings and screamed: “I won’t come! This Qilin is too bad, it bullies this Young Lord every day! Female Devil, you should bake it and eat it! The Qilin Meat is delicious, I won’t lie to you!”","Hearing Little Wang Cai’s words, Little Qilin immediately raised it’s head, glared at him fiercely, and stretched out it’s paws threateningly.","However, when Li Moying looked towards it, the Little Qilin lowered its head again, looking like a good baby.","Little Wang Cai was so angry that it only hated why its strength improved so slowly and still couldn’t beat Little Qilin!","At this moment, it felt extremely regretful. Before, it didn’t cultivate well and only knew how to eat...","“Wang Cai, come here!” Huang Yueli urged.","However, Little Wang Cai flew farther and refused to come.","Huang Yueli’s face turned dark, and she suddenly felt very embarrassed!","Look at Li Moying’s divine beast, how well-behaved, how obedient and how cute it was!","This phoenix she raised doesn’t respect its master at all! And it was lazy in cultivation!","Just when Huang Yueli was about to rush over to catch Little Phoenix, Li Moying suddenly snorted and gave Little Phoenix a cold look.","Wang Cai’s wings swayed and it almost hit the ground."]},{"number":3506,"title":"Chapter 3506 - Qilin Meat is Delicious (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3506: Qilin Meat is Delicious (5)","Under the heavens, what was more terrifying than the Female Devil?","That was the husband of the Female Devil...","Boo hoo, he’s really scary!","Left with no other choice, Little Wang Cai could only stop obediently, and landed on Huang Yueli’s shoulder.","Huang Yueli saw that it was finally obedient, but her mood became even worse.","What’s going on? Why was her divine beast so afraid of Li Moying instead of listening to her, the true Master? She had really failed too much as a Master! Was it because she had been too kind to this little guy?","It seems that in the future, this little guy must not be so pampered, and it must be trained more!","Huang Yueli pouted in dissatisfaction. Li Moying was at the side, and had already seen all the changes in her expression.","He laughed softly and said, “You... In the future when we have a baby, you must let me educate the child, otherwise you will spoil the child!”","Huang Yueli rolled her eyes at him and said, “I call this the education of love, do you understand?”","After finishing speaking, she ignored Li Moying and grabbed the Little Phoenix’s wings, raised it in front of her eyes, and asked, “Why did you and Lilac Jadeite come out suddenly? Did you find something?”","Little Wang Cai kicked hard, trying to break free from her grasp, but Huang Yueli was in a bad mood right now, so of course she wouldn’t let it fly away casually.","Little Phoenix tried a lot, but found it was futile, so it lowered its head and replied obediently: “I sensed the energy around me... There should be a lot of fire-type spirit beast crystal core here! There are also a lot of ores of the fire attribute! If I can absorb the energy inside, my strength will be greatly improved!”","“Oh? Really?” Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up! “Where? You two lead the way!”","As soon as Huang Yueli let go, the Little Phoenix was like a shooting star as a streak of flames trailed behind him when he flew out!","The Little Qilin also jumped lightly and followed.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying followed the two divine beast cubs, bypassed the hut, continued forward, and stopped at a place that looked like a haystack.","“Where is this... crystal core?”","Huang Yueli looked left and right, but she didn’t see half a crystal core, only piles of haystacks, and they were piled up extremely high!","Little Wang Cai excitedly exclaimed, “It’s here!”","With that said, it rushed towards one of the haystacks!","However, the next moment, it seemed to hit a wall and a loud “bang” resounded! The whole phoenix was limply attached to the surface of the haystack, and slid down.","Huang Yueli was startled suddenly, and hastily rushed up to catch Little Phoenix.","“Wang Cai, Wang Cai! How are you?!”","Huang Yueli put her hands on Little Phoenix’s head, and imbued the fire attribute profound energy into its body. After a while, Little Wang Cai woke up.","It looked around in a daze, finally focusing its gaze at the haystack suspiciously.","“The core is inside this pile of hay, it’s obviously hay, why is it so hard...”","“Idiot! It’s not hay at all, it’s created by the Saint Iniquitous Shadow with a special array! You’re the only idiot who dares to hit it! And you’re really stupid enough to hit it so hard! Hmm, hitting your head so hard, would you become more stupid?” A cute girl’s voice sounded beside her.","This voice sounded childish, but the words she said were so rude!","Huang Yueli was startled, and hurriedly looked around."]},{"number":3507,"title":"Chapter 3507 - Qilin Meat is Delicious (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3507: Qilin Meat is Delicious (6)","She realised that the position where she heard that voice was at her feet.","And lying there was Li Moying’s Little Qilin, Lilac Jadeite!","Huang Yueli’s was wide agape before she found her voice and said in surprise, “Moying, you... your Qilin is actually a female!”","Although she had not seen this divine beast of Li Moying’s, but Lilac Jadeite doesn’t like to talk very much, and spends most of the time lying silently at Li Moying’s feet, so this was the first time she has heard Lilac Jadeite speak!","Li Moying walked behind her and hugged her slim waist, taking advantage of the fact that she was not paying attention, and secretly pecked her pink cheeks.","“Little Li’er, don’t be angry, if you don’t like the female animal around me, I’ll throw it away!”","The Little Qilin’s body suddenly trembled!","Boo hoo, he wouldn’t...would he? She was locked in a secret realm for tens of thousands of years, and only after waiting for such a powerful and good looking master, it didn’t want to become an abandoned baby without even growing its scales!","Little Phoenix was instantly complacent, flapping its wings and saying gloatingly: “Female Devil, I support you! Hurry up and throw this ugly girl out! This is the most correct decision you have ever made in your life!”","“Who do you say is ugly?? You are ugly!!”","Little Qilin was immediately angry, hmph! This little brat actually dared to call her ugly, she was a peerless beauty among Qilins, alright?","She couldn’t hold back her anger and immediately forgot Li Moying’s warning, rushed towards Little Phoenix again, and slapped him with one paw!","Little Phoenix quickly escaped!","The two divine beasts were quiet for less than a quarter of an hour before they started fighting again.","Huang Yueli held her forehead helplessly, remembering that when they were home, while they were intimate, in order to avoid Little Phoenix hiding in her consciousness, she would throw the two mythical beasts into the backyard and let them play by themselves.","Originally, she thought that the two little ones were both cubs of divine beasts, and their attributes were not mutually exclusive, so they should be able to play together.","Unexpectedly, the truth of the matter was actually like this!","Doesn’t it mean that two tigers cannot be tolerated in one mountain, unless there was one male and one female?","These two were obviously a male and a female? What’s wrong? ?","(Obviously the race was wrong...)","Li Moying suddenly coughed heavily, and the two little ones were suddenly startled and quieted down.","Huang Yueli also reacted and said, “It seems that there are many arrays arranged outside these haystacks, so the energy emitted by a large number of spirit beast crystal cores can be hidden, even we didn’t find it, only the ancient beasts can sense it. If it weren’t for these two little ones, we would have passed so many spirit beast crystal cores!”","Li Moying frowned and asked, “Little Li’er, do you have any way to crack these arrays?”","Huang Yueli’s face was full of regret, “This... At present, I can’t think of any way. I don’t know much about the arrays of the gods. I couldn’t see it for a while.”","“What? Then can’t we eat these core?”","“Dear Sister, think of a way!”","The two little ones also looked anxious!","The food was delivered to their mouth, but suddenly was told that they couldn’t eat it! It had never been so frustrating before!","When Huang Yueli heard the words “Miss”, she couldn’t help but turn her head to look at the Little Qilin.","“Tsk tsk, the little one’s mouth is so sweet! It’s much stronger than the one in my family! Husband, can I exchange with you my divine beast?”"]},{"number":3508,"title":"Chapter 3508 - Isn’t This Courting Death? (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3508: Isn’t This Courting Death? (1)","Huang Yueli looked at Li Moying expectantly.","Before Li Moying could speak, Little Phoenix almost jumped!","“Female Devil!! How could you treat me like this!! I’m so handsome, so talented, and most importantly, I’ve been with you for so many years! How could you abandon me!!”","Li Moying glanced at him coldly, “Shut up, who allowed you to talk to your master like this?”","Little Wang Cai was stared at by him, and he was instantly silenced...","Huang Yueli laughed, shook her head, and said: “I just said that there is no way to crack these arrays now, but if we have time to deduce carefully, we may not be unable to find a way. I think we should go to the hut first. Let’s see, if we can find the collections left by Saint Iniquitous Shadow, maybe there will be some way to crack it.”","“What Madame said is true!” Li Moying nodded, and led her and the two little ones towards the direction of the hut.","...","At the same time, in the inn in Forest Shade Town.","Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao rushed to the inn, and as soon as they entered Huang Sanbai’s room, they collapsed on the chair, looking exhausted.","“You two have worked hard. How is the situation? Have you found Li Moying?” Huang Sanbai asked knowingly.","Huang Fuzhao picked up the teapot on the table, poured it into his mouth, and drank a whole pot of water before he recovered.","“Who did you find? Elder Sanbai, are you sure that Li Moying really came to Forest Shade Town? Elder Shuangyu and I have traveled all over the place in the past two days! I have basically seen everything in the range of a hundred miles, but I haven’t found even a ghost!”","“Isn’t it? It’s really not easy to find someone in this wild place!” Huang Shuangyu also looked worried.","Huang Sanbai’s eyes flickered slightly, and while personally handing out snacks to the two of them, he said, “Have you really traveled all over the area within a radius of a hundred miles? Then... the area due to the west of Forest Shade Town is also Have you seen it all? I heard that that area is not safe!”","Huang Shuangyu immediately sat up straight when she heard the words, and asked in surprise: “Third Brother, how do you know that there is a problem with the area west of Forest Shade Town? I was about to tell you about it! There is a long and narrow area in the west, surrounded by corpses, and countless cultivators died there! Elder Zhao and I originally wanted to go in to find out what happened, relying on our own strength in the Dao Profound Realm, but we got lost inside. I’m on my way, and I almost can’t come back!”","Huang Fuzhao also said: “Elder Sanbai, look at the wounds on our bodies, we are in such a mess! Ordinary spirit beasts in the barren land are not our opponents at all, and they are all caused by that ghost. Made it somewhere!”","Hearing what they said, Huang Sanbai sighed exaggeratedly.","“That’s no wonder! I was looking for news in this small town today, and I heard people say that there is a very evil sect in the west of Forest Shade Town. It has always been the place where one would be placed in danger! From this point of view, Li Moying should have entered this area!”","“They entered that ghostly place?” Huang Shuangyu frowned, obviously not believing it, “But, Li Moying and his guards are only at the Heart Profound Realm! The two of us who are in the Dao Profound Realm almost fell in it, and he is such a brat, how dare he break into it? Isn’t this courting death?”"]},{"number":3509,"title":"Chapter 3509 - Isn’t This Courting Death? (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3509: Isn’t This Courting Death? (2)","Huang Sanbai said slowly: “I don’t know if he is courting death, but it is a fact that you can’t find him in other places. Since there is no other possibility, then he can only go to the West!”","When Huang Fuzhao heard the words, he fell into deep contemplation.","After a long while, he said: “Elder Sanbai, your analysis is indeed reasonable. Now that I think about it, generally such an evil place will have a mystery, whether it is an ancient secret realm, or a place where a treasure is born. After all, chances are indispensable. It seems , Li Moying really came here for that place!”","Huang Sanbai nodded and said: “This old man thinks so too! Li Moying, the majestic Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, stopped at such a small place, it is impossible just for some jade quartz mines! If it is for the secret realm and treasure, then that’s understandable!”","Huang Shuangyu ws not a fool, after listening to the analysis of the two, she had to admit that they are right.","However, she still had a sneer on her face, “If he really came here for the treasure in that place, then we can save trouble. I think Li Moying has probably died in it! Third brother, did you I don’t know if I’ve been to that ghostly place! It’s full of evil qi, and there are all kinds of weird arrays. I see that among the corpses on the ground, there are many cultivators with higher cultivation levels than us! Just based on Li Moying and the others... ... hmph!”","When Huang Sanbai heard the words, he felt stifled in his heart.","Of course he knows how dangerous that area is!","When he followed Li Moying and the others yesterday, he had already experienced it personally! He almost lost his life there! In the end, he didn’t dare to continue to follow him. Knowing that the target person was nearby, he could only run back in a desperate manner, trying to find another way...","However, fortunately, he still found a way!","Thinking of his plan, Huang Sanbai restrained his expressions and movements, for fear of revealing his true thoughts.","He nodded and said: “Second Sister is right! I also think that it is very difficult for Li Moying and the others to get out of such a dangerous place! Speaking of which, this kid from the Cloudy Qilin Clan is really stupid. The Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan doesn’t want to do it, and the resources of the family are not needed, so he insists on marrying a woman from the lower realm, and even goes outside to find resources for her... Tsk tsk, it really died for a woman!”","Huang Sanbai said along with Huang Shuangyu, but he knew very well in his heart that Li Moying’s ability was much stronger than what Huang Shuangyu and the others had imagined!","People who haven’t seen it personally can’t imagine it!","What’s more, there was Huang Yueli beside him!","That little girl was also an unreasonably strong existence!","What’s more, Huang Sanbai saw Huang Yueli break the array technique with his own eyes yesterday. That little girl has a map in her hand, and she has such a superb array technique attainment!","Coupled with Li Moying’s superb ability to control profound energy...","It might be possible for them to pass through that dangerous area and enter the secret realm!","However, Huang Sanbai thought so in his heart, but said: “It seems that our task has become much easier now! Li Moying died, not only did we not need to do it, but also, we can’t blame our saints afterwards.” On the head of the Phoenix Clan! However, there is one last question...”","“What’s the problem?” Huang Fuzhao asked.","Huang Sanbai lowered his head slightly, and brought the teacup in front of him to cover up the coldness in his eyes.","“We only speculate that Li Moying is dead, but we haven’t seen his body with our own eyes.”"]},{"number":3510,"title":"Chapter 3510 - Isn’t This Courting Death? (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3510: Isn’t This Courting Death? (3)","Huang Fuzhao was startled, “That’s right, but... Li Moying and the others entered such a dangerous place, can they still come out intact?”","Huang Sanbai said: “Of course it is impossible to be intact. However, Li Moying is a god-level genius of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. How could the old guys from the Cloudy Qilin Clan not give him a life-saving artifact? Therefore, if he’s lucky, he can still come out alive.”","Hearing this, Huang Shuangyu also contemplated for a moment before she nodded slowly in agreement: “Third Brother is right! I think it is impossible for Li Moying to die here like this! Besides, even if he really did, we still have to confirm this news first, so that we can report back to the Patriarch, right?”","When Huang Sanbai heard the words, he nodded again and again, “Second Sister still understands me! Even if Li Moying is likely to fold here, we have to confirm this. Therefore, in my humble opinion, we have to be near that dangerous area. Monitor the situation inside. If Li Moying and the others do not show up after a month or two, there is a high possibility that he will die inside. If he suddenly appears...”","Speaking of which, Huang Sanbai paused.","Huang Shuangyu frowned, “What if that kid comes out alive?”","Huang Fuzhao slapped his thigh sharply, “Elder Shuangyu, does that need to be said? If that kid comes out alive, we just take advantage of him and kill him on the spot! Think about it, even if he can save his life, he will be injured. It won’t be light, we can easily kill him with a shot!”","The corners of Huang Sanbai’s mouth rose slightly, indescribably satisfied.","These two elders have been cultivating in the family all the year round. They don’t have enough experience. They don’t know that people’s hearts are sinister.","Huang Fuzhao also took the initiative to say what he didn’t say!","Now, Huang Fuzhao came up with this idea, and if the family investigates it in the future, he will be able to clear the relationship.","Huang Sanbai was proud in his heart, but his face did not show, he said indifferently: “As Elder Zhao said, we will kill Li Moying in the jungle, there is another advantage, no one can tell that Li Moying died in our hands! He died in the process of searching for the secret realm, in short, it has nothing to do with our Sacred Phoenix Clan!”","Both Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao’s eyes lit up, and they repeatedly praised Huang Sanbai for being thoughtful.","Huang Sanbai cupped her hands and said humble words, but she was already thinking about the next step after killing Li Moying and Huang Yueli.","Finally, he opened his mouth and proposed: “I am afraid that the task of monitoring in the dangerous area will be handed over to the Second Sister and the Elder Zhao. I have other things here. In order to avoid accidents in the process of killing Li Moying, I plan to contact the branch of the ‘Dark Lord’ and borrow a few experts to help.”","When Huang Sanbai said these words, Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao were both stunned.","There was a station of the killer organization “Dark Lord” in Forest Shade Town, which they discovered when they first came.","However, a few of them didn’t take it to heart, let alone ask each other for help.","Although Li Moying was a god-level genius born every 10,000 years, but with a few guards who are not top powerhouses, Huang Shuangyu and the others believe that they are enough to deal with it.","“Elder Sanbai, you must be thinking too much, right? Isn’t it just a matter of dealing with a few cultivators in the Heart Profound Realm, making such a fuss? Hiring a Dark Lord killer is not a small expense?” Huang Shuangyu frowned."]},{"number":3511,"title":"Chapter 3511 - Isn’t This Courting Death? (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3511: Isn’t This Courting Death? (4)","The No. 1 killer organization in the God Realm claims to be able to kill any kind of expert, so the fee was naturally No. 1 in the God Realm!","Even for experts in the Dao Profound Realm like Huang Shuangyu and the others, this was not a small sum!","Huang Sanbai shook his head, “This mission is very important to the clan, there is nothing wrong with being careful! God knows if Li Moying will have any treasures that’s heaven defying! You two should also be careful, once you see Li Moying and the others coming out, immediately send me a message, and I will rush over with the Dark Lord’s people!”","Huang Shuangyu didn’t really approve of hiring external help but seeing that Huang Sanbai insisted so much, they couldn’t say anything more.","“Alright then, Third Brother, let’s go there and watch. You just wait for our good news!”","After Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao left, Huang Sanbai’s face suddenly turned gloomy.","“Second Sister, Elder Zhao, I didn’t want to hurt you, but it’s a pity... Who made you so unlucky to have to take on such a task?”","He glanced coldly outside the door and made sure that there was no one in the corridor, so he immediately put on a black cloak and stepped out!","He went straight to the location of the emblem of the Dark Lord branch.","What he said to Huang Shuangyu and the others just now was not entirely a lie.","From the outside, the branch of Dark Lord looks like a dilapidated and dangerous building. It seems that it will collapse anytime and anywhere. The gate was even covered with spider webs, making people afraid to approach.","Only a master with extensive knowledge can recognize the emblem of “Dark Lord”, and recognize that this was one of the top forces in the God Realm!","Huang Sanbai walked straight to the door, the window beside the door suddenly opened, and a cold voice came out: “Who? We don’t welcome outsiders, hurry up and leave!”","Huang Sanbai’s expression did not change, “This old man is here to discuss a business with you...”","“We only do big business here, and ordinary people can’t afford to pay!”","“What this old man wants to buy is the life of the only god-level genius in the God Realm! Is this deal... big enough?” Huang Sanbai said slowly with a cold face.","When the people inside the window heard this, they seemed to be a little stunned, and didn’t speak for a long time.","Huang Sanbai did not rush to speak again, but waited quietly.","After a while, the dilapidated door creaked open...","Huang Sanbai sneered and walked in.","...","Inside the secret realm of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying didn’t know anything about the impending crisis.","The two walked hand in hand to the hut in the middle of the secret realm, followed by the two cubs of divine beasts bouncing noisily behind them.","They were still some distance away from the door of the hut when they heard the noise coming from inside.","The two hurriedly pushed the door and entered. As soon as they entered, they were blinded by the scene in the room!","From the outside, this room doesn’t look very big, but in fact, it has been transformed with an array method, and it was very spacious.","And in such a large space, all kinds of treasures were piled up everywhere.","In the whole row of cabinets on the left, there were all kinds of small bottles densely arranged, with the names of medicines written in red on them, and they all looked like medicinal pills.","In the cabinet on the right, book after book were neatly lined up, Huang Yueli glanced at it quickly, and found that among these books, there was no shortage of various attributes.","What made her heart speed up was that on the last cabinet, there were still things she needed most!"]},{"number":3512,"title":"Chapter 3512 - Bringing Home Tons of Stuff (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3512: Bringing Home Tons of Stuff (1)","Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up and she immediately let go of Li Moying’s hand, and rushed to the front of the cabinet in the corner at the end of the room.","She opened the cabinet door and reached in excitedly.","“Ouch!” Huang Yueli exclaimed in surprise!","Her hand didn’t touch what she wanted to take, but was bounced back by the protective array outside the cabinet. Fortunately, she reacted fast enough and retreated in time, otherwise, she might have suffered serious internal injuries!","“Little Li’er, how are you?”","Hearing Huang Yueli’s cry, Li Moying immediately appeared behind her, and took her into his arms.","He squeezed Huang Yueli’s little hand and checked it carefully, his brows also wrinkled, “What the hell did you do? Can’t you be more careful? There are many dangers in the secret realm, and this is not the first time you have entered the secret realm, don’t you even know this? How dare you reach out and go in!”","Li Moying scolded his beloved woman who was in his arms angrily, but the movements of checking her little hands were very gentle.","Knowing that she was wrong, Huang Yueli stuck out her tongue, blinked her big eyes, and tried to use her cuteness to get out of trouble, “I saw that... I was so excited all of a sudden... I’m sorry, I’ll pay attention next time!”","“You mean that there’s a next time?!” Li Moying glared at her.","Huang Yueli immediately shrank her neck again.","Oh, no, I said the wrong thing again!","She quickly pretended that nothing happened, turned to look at the contents in the cabinet, stretched out her uninjured hand, and pointed to the middle of the cabinet.","“Moying, look at it! This is the conception illustration of the fire attribute! Judging from the aura escaping from the outside, it is not bad at all compared to our Sacred Phoenix Clan’s <Mystic Nine Skies Phoenix Painting>! I didn’t expect that Saint Iniquitous Shadow actually collects so many conception illustrations! Look at that, the thunder attribute! Wow, there are all the attributes! As expected of a powerhouse in the Life Profound Realm, he is really rich and powerful!”","Huang Yueli stared at the fire attribute conception illustration, the more she looked at it, the more satisfied she became.","She didn’t return to the clan, so she couldn’t comprehend the conception illustration, which led to the slow progress of the cultivation realm. For Huang Yueli, it was extremely suffocating!","Unfortunately, she hasn’t found a chance to solve it.","Unexpectedly, this time coming to the secret realm of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow, she had actually gotten hold of a fire attribute conception illustration!","This was truly a surprise!","To comprehend the conception illustration at the clan or allied armies headquarters, one must also contribute points in exchange for qualifications. There will also be strict regulations on the time for loaning it. It can be said that it was not free at all.","However, it’s completely different when you have your own conception illustration!","You can comprehend it wherever you want, whenever you want.","As long as you want to comprehend, you can comprehend as long as you want!","It doesn’t get any better than this!","Huang Yueli was excited for a while, and almost forgot that she was in the abode of Saint Iniquitous Shadow, so she stretched out her hand, which caused the accident just now.","Li Moying saw her excited glint in her eyes, and couldn’t help but sigh, his little fox wants to be strong, but he likes this about her!","He grabbed Huang Yueli’s outstretched little hand, tightened the arm resting on her waist, and whispered in her ear: “I see, isn’t it a conception illustration? Since the thing is here, think slowly. The way to break the array is to take it out, why are you so excited?”","“Uh, aren’t you excited?” Huang Yueli blinked in surprise.","After she calmed down for a moment, she noticed that not only Li Moying, but even the four guards were not very excited."]},{"number":3513,"title":"Chapter 3513 - Bringing Home Tons of Stuff (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3513 Bringing Home Tons of Stuff (2)","Huang Yueli thought about it and understood.","Well, she was the only one here in the Profound Realm!","Although there was also a conception illustration of the thunder attribute, it was completely useless for Li Moying and the others, and they can only be used to sell money or exchange the contribution value of the family and the coalition...","Thinking that she was actually the one with the worst cultivation in this group of people, Huang Yueli felt a little depressed.","At the same time, she has also strengthened her determination to get hold of this conception illustration and cultivate well!","She looked up and down the cabinet, her eyes wandered repeatedly on the pattern engraved around the cabinet, looking for a way to crack it.","After a while, she took out the array plate from her space to help her calculate and deduce.","Li Moying watched from the side for a while, and saw that Huang Yueli was fascinated, so he didn’t bother her anymore, but turned to the other side to look at other things in the room.","He looked for the four guards, and at this time, they were surrounding a box and discussing.","Li Moying walked over, “What are you talking about here?”","As soon as Li Moying appeared, several guards hurriedly got up, lowered their heads, and replied respectfully.","“Young Master, this box is placed on the top shelf. It looks quite precious from the outside, so subordinate wanted to open it to see what was inside, but none of us can find a way.”","Li Moying lowered his head, looked at the large box on the ground and frowned slightly.","This box itself was made of Profound Star Stone, and the material of the box was already very valuable. It made one think that the value of the treasures inside would be even more valuable.","However, the structure of this box was very simple, it was nothing more than a padlock, and there was only a simple pattern around it.","This array pattern was too simple, even an ordinary cultivator in the God Realm could easily recognize it, but it was only the most basic sealing array.","Generally speaking, as long as a cultivator’s profound strength was strong enough to reach a certain level, it could be broken with brute force.","To open such a lock, it was easy yet... also difficult!","Because, the upper limit of profound energy required to open the box was determined by the sealer’s own strength!","The Saint Iniquitous Shadow was a powerhouse in the Fate Profound Realm, so this box...","Li Moying glanced at a few guards and asked, “Have you tried opening the box just now? How do you feel?”","Li Tianyi replied: “The subordinate came in and tried it. However, when the subordinate entered profound energy, the pattern did not change at all! Later, the four subordinates tried it together again, and the result was still the same, nothing has changed...”","Li Tianyi and the four of them mastered a set of combined strike techniques, and when they used them, they could reach the sum of the profound strengths of the four of them. When added up, they were equivalent to the profound strength of a cultivator at the peak of the Heart Profound Realm!","Even if it was compared with the cultivators in the early stages of the Dao Profound Realm, there was not much difference.","With such a huge amount of profound energy imbued, there was actually no change at all?","Li Tianer also said in a low voice: “Subordinate think that this box probably needs the strength of the Fate Profound Realm to open it! It seems that we can only move the box away first and bring it back to the clan, then ask the elders to help... ...”","Li Tiansan and Li Tiansi also nodded in agreement.","Li Moying frowned and did not immediately agree with this opinion.","According to common sense, the Saint Iniquitous Shadow himself was in the Fate Profound Realm, and the box used to hold important treasures can only be opened by those who are strong in the Fate Profound Realm. This was a more reasonable thing.","But for some odd reason, Li Moying always felt that something was wrong."]},{"number":3514,"title":"Chapter 3514 - Bringing Home Tons of Stuff (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3514: Bringing Home Tons of Stuff (3)","Besides, he didn’t intend to go back to the clan and bow down his head to seek the help of the Elders for the sake of a box.","Before the Cloudy Qilin Clan admitted his relationship with Huang Yueli, he didn’t plan to go back to the Amethyst Paramount Palace at all.","Li Moying’s eyes were cold, he stared at the box while contemplating when he suddenly said, “You guys get out of the way, let me try!”","Li Tianyi and the others were stunned. They obviously didn’t expect that they had already explained the situation clearly just now yet Li Moying would want to try again!","!!","However, they didn’t dare to stop him and they all stepped back.","Li Moying stepped forward, placed his hand lightly on the top of the lid, and began to imbue profound energy into it.","The four guards stared at the box without blinking, for fear of missing any detail.","Li Moying stood in place while he carefully imbued his profound energy bit by bit, following the inscription on it and as they were channelled along the lines and soon, all the intricate lines were filled with his profound energy.","However, there was no change at all, let alone open.","Li Moying frowned slightly, running the profound energy in his body, increasing his input even more.","Time passed little by little, and Li Moying imbued more and more profound energy, but the box still stood steadily on the ground, steady like a rock.","Not knowing how long it took, when suddenly, the box shook abruptly and made a light sound.","A few guards were all startled and quickly gathered around.","“Young Master, it takes too much profound energy to open this box! You...don’t force it!”","“Yes, Young Master, this box is particularly evil, and it will absorb a part of the profound energy imbued into it. If you input too much energy, you may be attacked! That would be too dangerous!”","“Young Master, this box won’t run away anyway! We can move it first and then open it...”","The few of them each added some words nervously, trying their best to persuade him.","They were all worried that Li Moying would take risk into his own hands and use up all his profound strength. If there were other traps in the box, it would be troublesome!","If Li Moying was injured because of this, these guards would not be able to shoulder such a responsibility!","Several guards were full of anxiety, all nervous about Li Moying’s safety.","However, Li Moying didn’t seem to hear their words. He still put his hand on the lid of the box and didn’t move at all. Although the furrow between his brows deepend and beads of cold sweat began to appear on his forehead. Obviously, a lot of profound energy has been consumed, and his body could no longer support it!","However, he was still imbuing profound energy!","Several guards were so anxious that they could not wait to go up and pull him away in person!","But at this moment...","A loud bang came!","The inscription engraved on the outside of the box suddenly lit up at the same time!","With the sound, the lid of the box popped up.","Li Moying slowly withdrew his hand, said nothing, and squatted down to look at the contents of the box.","Several guards stared at this scene in amazement, unable to even utter a word!","“This... Young Master, how did you do this??”","“How is that possible? This is a box that only the experts in the Life Profound Realm can open!”","Although Li Moying’s guards adored him and believed in his strength and talent, the scene in front of him was too incredible!"]},{"number":3515,"title":"Chapter 3515 - Bringing Home Tons of Stuff (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3515: Bringing Home Tons of Stuff (4)","How could it be possible for someone in the mid-stage of the Heart Profound Realm to have as strong a strength as a peerless powerhouse in the Life Profound Realm?","This spanned across two great realms!","How could there be such an outrageous thing in the world? ?","When the few people were looking at each other, suddenly, a crisp voice came from behind them: “What happened just now? What are you all watching here with your mouths wide open?”","!!","The four of them suddenly turned their heads and saw Huang Yueli’s incomparably charming little face appearing behind them.","She walked over slowly from not far away, blinking her big eyes, her face full of curiosity!","The sound emitted when the box was opened just now interrupted her thoughts and made her notice the situation here.","She was afraid that Li Moying would be in danger, so she hurried over. However, after getting closer, she found that there didn’t seem to be any danger here, but it looked like a scene of opening treasures?","Several guards quickly made way for her.","Li Tianyi explained in a low voice: “Madame, Young Master, he actually...opened the seal and restriction set by an exponent in the Life Profound Realm! This...is simply too terrifying!”","“The seal of an exponent in the Life Profound Realm?” Hearing this, even Huang Yueli was taken aback!","She knows Li Moying’s strength best.","To say that Li Moying was stronger than some weak Dao Profound Realm experts, she will not have any doubts, but to say that he could actually compare with the Life Profound Realm experts...","This...she didn’t believe it was true either.","Huang Yueli quickly glanced at the box on the ground.","She was more familiar with these array inscriptions than Li Moying, and she recognized it at a glance. This was indeed the basic sealing array.","When Li Moying heard the voice of his little fox, he quickly urged her over: “Little Li’er, come and have a look, there are many good things here! Look at this sky crystal spirit jade, didn’t you mention it last time, saying that you can raise the grade of the armament, but is it extremely rare? There is such a big piece in it!”","“What.... What did you say?! Sky crystal spirit jade!!”","When Huang Yueli heard this, she was elated and rushed to Li Moying’s side in excitement.","The two of them squatted together, getting very close, and rummaged through the contents of the box together.","This was indeed a treasure chest specially collected by the Saint Iniquitous Shadow. There were indeed a lot of treasures in it. In addition to rare materials, there were also several unique profound techniques written by the Saint Iniquitous Shadow himself!","The value of this was much higher than the piles of cheat books of various attributes outside!","The unique profound skills of every Life Profound Realm expert cannot be copied, and some cultivators won’t even teach them easily to their disciples.","They haven’t heard of any personal disciples left behind by the Saint Iniquitous Shadow. Maybe these mysterious skills have long been lost in the current God Realm!","The two rummaged through the treasures in the box.","Huang Yueli raised her hand to wipe the sweat off her forehead, then turned her head to look at Li Moying’s deep and handsome side face, her heart moved, and she suddenly remembered what Li Tianyi said just now.","She asked curiously: “Husband, do you really have...ahem, do you have the profound strength of someone at the Life Profound Realm?”","Li Moying paused, glanced at her lightly, and said with a half-smile: “You actually believe the stupid things those brats said?!”","“Uh!” Huang Yueli froze!","What did Li Moying mean by this?","If she also believed the stupid things others say, doesn’t that mean that she was also stupid?","She pouted immediately and threw Li Moying a disgruntled frown."]},{"number":3516,"title":"Chapter 3516 - Bringing Home Tons of Stuff (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3516: Bringing Home Tons of Stuff (5)","It seems that men don’t appreciate it when they get it!","In the past, this man always praised her for being smart, how could he say she was stupid!","However, listening to Li Moying’s words, it should not really be like Li Tianyi and the others guessed, relying on absolute strength to open the ban left by Saint Iniquitous Shadow, but using a clever method...","What would that be?","Li Moying looked at the bulging cheeks of the girl beside him, and secretly laughed in his heart. The angry look of his little fox was actually the cutest, causing him to keep teasing her whenever he found an opportunity.","Huang Yueli’s eyes fell on the inscription outside the box again, and after thinking for a moment, a light flashed in her mind.","“Ah! I understand!” After she let out a low voice, she lowered her voice abruptly, “Is it your profound strength... is it similar to that of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow...”","She used her profound strength to transmit sound, and no one else could hear it.","A glint flashed by Li Moying’s eyes and there was a hint of approval in them.","His family’s Little Li’er has always been so smart, she’s always the one who knows him best and understands him!","“Not bad!” Li Moying nodded.","Huang Yueli supported her chin with her hand, and said thoughtfully: “Speaking of which, we really have a fate with this Saint Iniquitous Shadow! If he has left behind any inheritance, with your talent and special profound energy, it is not impossible to obtain this inheritance!”","Li Moying’s lips raised into a smile, and said, “You said that my profound strength and special profound energy are special, aren’t you the same? If I can get the inheritance, you must be able to do so too!”","Huang Yueli said: “That’s right, but, I’ve walked around the hut just now, and I can’t see where there is a possibility of inheritance... With the experience and strength of Saint Iniquitous Shadow, what he left behind, the most precious thing will definitely not be some foreign objects such as spirit crystal cores, but the inheritance of his lifelong cultivation base! Not necessarily, only these mysterious techniques, right?”","Huang Yueli pointed to the few books of unique profound skills in the box.","These were indeed very precious, but what could be recorded in words was only a small part of the most obvious inheritance.","The real inheritance itself could not be described in words at all.","It’s like what Huang Yueli got from the Holy Phoenix Inheritance Tower in Soaring Heavens Continent!","As long as you have experienced inheritance, your strength will immediately increase rapidly!","Li Moying also looked very disappointed, “Yes, I believe that there should be more things left here, we must look for it! After the disappearance of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow, the whereabouts of the saint have remained a mystery, and people in the God Realm don’t even know where he died. If he has an inheritance, the biggest possibility is in this abode.”","Huang Yueli nodded, “Alright, let’s look carefully!”","After they packed up the things in the box, Li Moying instructed the few guards to search outside the hut separately.","Huang Yueli took the two divine beast cubs out and stayed in the hut to open the restrictions on the cabinets by the wall one by one.","These restrictions were not the same as those in the previous box, and they could not be broken open only by brute force.","However, Huang Yueli also learned from Li Moying’s experience and knew that her profound strength was compatible with the attributes of Saint Iniquitous Shadow. Using this advantage, she could break these restrictions faster.","After a few hours, Huang Yueli finally broke all the restrictions on the cabinets."]},{"number":3517,"title":"Chapter 3517 - Bringing Home Tons of Stuff (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3517: Bringing Home Tons of Stuff (6)","She also attained the conception illustration that she had been thinking about for the longest time!","As soon as Huang Yueli put away the conception illustration, the two divine beast cubs who were waiting impatiently jumped up.","One hugged her thigh, the other tugged at her collar, eager to drag her to the backyard, and take out all the spirit beast crystal cores hidden in the haystack for them!","“Female Devil, hurry up, hurry up! I’m getting impatient!”","!!","“Lil’ Big Sister, after eating the crystal core of the thunder attribute, I can become a cute girl~”","Under the cute attack of the two little things, Huang Yueli was defeated.","“Alright... well, I didn’t say I won’t help you guys!”","She also didn’t bother to look for Li Moying, and was directly dragged by the two little ones to get the crystal cores for them.","After finally cracking the traps and arrays outside the haystacks, it was already dark when Huang Yueli returned to the hut.","Li Moying and the four guards had already rested in the room.","Seeing Huang Yueli coming in, everyone spread the things they found today on the ground and began to count them.","“This secret realm is not big. Apart from this hut and the backyard, there is a large medicine field in front of it. There are a total of forty kinds of high-level spirit herbs planted on it. We picked most of them, however, we kept the roots and did not dig out all of them. After tens of thousands of years, if descendants find this secret realm again, they should be able to pick new herbs...”","“In front of the medicine field, there is a meadow and a small lake, which should have been specially created by Saint Iniquitous Shadow by filling it with spirit water drawn from the outside. There are a lot of aquatic plants in this lake, and there are a lot of spirit beasts on the grass, but these spirit beasts are very powerful, and some of them can’t even be dealt with by the Young Master. Fortunately, there are restrictions outside the lake, so they don’t seem to be able to get close to the hut, otherwise things wouldn’t be so smooth today...”","“Further to the west...”","Listening to Li Tianyi and Li Tianer’s report, Huang Yueli pursed her lips and thought quickly.","As expected of them, they were from a big family and had a rich experience. They also knew that these high-level spirit herbs were treasures of heaven and earth, and it was not easy to grow them alive in the secret realm, so they didn’t dig out the roots along with it.","Huang Yueli immediately thought of her Sky Phoenix Ring.","By the time tomorrow dawns, she can just dig out one or two roots of each of those herbs and plant them in the medicine field in her space.","As for those spirit beasts...","She also knows that the spirit beasts captured by the strong in the Life Profound Realm must be very powerful! If you can tame a few, it will definitely be a big help in the future!","If she can’t tame the big ones, what if she could get a few cubs to raise...","Li Moying’s thoughts were obviously the same as hers, and he said: “I have been observing the grassland for a long time, although those spirit beasts are fierce, but it is not impossible to tame them, it’s just that it’s late today and it’s not convenient to do it. Wait until tomorrow to try again!”","Several guards were shocked, “Young Master, you have already figured out a way to tame the beast?”","In their eyes, Li Moying is usually amazing enough, but now after entering a secret realm for experience, they realised that Li Moying was much more powerful than they had ever imagined!","Not to mention just casually opening the seal of an exponent in the Life Profound Realm, now, even such a ferocious spirit beast could be tamed? ?","Li Moying smiled slightly, and glanced at Huang Yueli."]},{"number":3518,"title":"Chapter 3518 - I’ve Said It Before, You Can’t Do It! (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3518: I’ve Said It Before, You Can’t Do It! (1)","Huang Yueli met his gaze and was slightly taken aback.","Immediately afterwards, she realized that Li Moying was not actually looking at her, but at...the two divine beast cubs at her feet.","The two little guys were lying at Huang Yueli’s feet, one on the left and the other on the right. It was rare that they didn’t quarrel, but one was holding a pile of spirit beast crystal cores, and they were trying hard to gnaw. There was a rattling sound.","Huang Yueli followed his line of sight and understood.","“Moying, do you want these two little guys to help tame the spirit beast?”","Li Moying nodded, “The unique bloodline of ancient beasts can make ordinary spirit beasts submit. Of course, these two are still a little small and real high-level spirit beasts may not be afraid of them, but it should not be a problem to take in a few cubs.”","Huang Yueli hooked the corners of her mouth and was about to speak.","Little Wang Cai, whose mouth was full of crumbs, suddenly raised his head, and said inarticulately, “No, I don’t want to be a coolie! It’s hard work to release coercion, alright?”","Before Huang Yueli said anything, Lilac Jadeite had already slapped Little Wang Cai unceremoniously!","“You are such a waste! As a divine beast, you even feel tired to just release a little coercion! If the Phoenix family knows that there is a phoenix as useless as you, they will probably cry!”","“You... Who are you calling useless!” Little Phoenix rushed in front of little Qilin with a whoosh!","“Anyone who doesn’t listen to Lil’ Big Sister is a waste! You eat so much and yet you’re useless!”","Little Phoenix raised his head angrily, “Who says that I don’t listen to Female Devil? I treat the Female Devil best, alright? And... and I’m also very useful! Hmph!”","“Really?”","Sensing the look of contempt in the Little Qilin’s eyes, Little Phoenix suddenly felt insulted.","He flapped his wings and said angrily: “Alright, then let’s compete tomorrow to see who can tame more spirit beasts!”","“Let’s compare then! Just look at your figure that looks like a stumpy winter melon, I know you can’t do it!”","“You...you actually said I can’t do it!!”","Little Phoenix ??almost fainted in anger!","Although it was a phoenix beast, it is also a true male! Even in the bottom of his heart, he felt that he was already a man!","In the end, she was actually told that he could not do it by a girl! Still being told none other than by a super pretty girl!","Although Lilac Jadeite usually maintains the appearance of a Qilin beast, when she transforms into human form, she’s a super cute little girl. The human forms of ancient beasts were all handsome and beautiful.","Little Phoenix was extremely angry, but compared with Little Qilin, his strength was indeed much worse, which made him start to feel depressed...","Huang Yueli was shocked at the beginning when she heard the two little guys’ quarrel, but after hearing it, she found it more and more funny, and in the end she almost couldn’t straighten up from laughing.","Seeing Little Wang Cai’s dejected look, it was rare for her to persuade him kindly: “Forget it, if you can’t do it, you can’t do it. Maybe you can grow up! Now you are still young...”","Still small...still small...still small...","When Little Phoenix heard these two words, he fell to the ground and couldn’t get up for a long time. He felt that his heart had been severely hit! Or a blow from his closest master!","Huang Yueli didn’t know what was wrong with him. Seeing that he was sleeping on the ground and couldn’t get up, she curiously stretched out her finger and poked his belly."]},{"number":3519,"title":"Chapter 3519 - I’ve Said It Before, You Can’t Do It! (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3519: I’ve Said It Before, You Can’t Do It! (2)","“Hey, Wang Cai, what are you doing lying down? Have you stopped eating these crystal cores?”","Little Phoenix snorted and turned his head away arrogantly!","Hmph! Phoenix also has dignity, don’t try to bribe him with just a few crystal cores! The trauma he suffered just now was very serious!","“Wang Cai?” Huang Yueli poked him again, only to find that her little phoenix was still lying on his back on the ground with her limbs spread out, pretending to be dead...","Huang Yueli immediately became worried, and raised her head to look at her husband, “Moying, what’s wrong with Wang Cai? Could he be ill?”","Li Moying’s eyes flickered slightly. He was a man, so his reaction to what Huang Yueli said just now was much more direct.","He was very clear about the reason why that little thing played dead.","However, his gaze circled around Little Phoenix coldly, and he didn’t speak right away.","Little Phoenix was so stared at by him that his whole body turned cold. He originally pretended to be dead, but now, he felt that he was really going to be scared to death!","Boo hoo, the big devil is so scary. I don’t know why the female devil would fall in love with such a scary man? Wouldn’t she have nightmares sleeping with him at night?","Li Moying said slowly: “It’s nothing, I think it may be underdeveloped, so you can’t let him eat so many crystal cores at one go, what if he eats too much and has diarrhoea? Give him a little less in the future, and he will be fine!”","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes suspiciously.","However, Li Moying’s knowledge in raising beasts was obviously better than hers. One could tell from the fact that his Qilin was raised so well!","Therefore, Huang Yueli still chose to believe him, “Well, well, it seems that I did not take care of him properly and I have to control his diet in the future...”","When Little Phoenix heard this, he jumped up in fright, “No...don’t, Female Devil, I...”","However, before he finished speaking, Li Moying gently clasped Huang Yueli’s slender waist and brought her into his arms, “Alright, it’s getting late, we should go to rest, let the two little ones go play by themselves!”","Huang Yueli said worriedly: “But, it’s not good to put the two of them together like this?” She suddenly remembered something, and grabbed the clothes on Li Moying’s chest, “Moying, I only found out this afternoon. It turns out that these two will fight when they are together! I’m worried...”","“It’s alright.” Li Moying interrupted her again, and said in a serious manner: “The cubs of the beasts can only improve their strength in battle, and it’s normal for the cubs to fight each other. It’s a way to express friendship, you don’t want to interfere when others cultivate their feelings...”","“Ah, so that’s how it is...”","Huang Yueli was relieved, and was obediently led away by Li Moying.","Little Phoenix looked at the backs of the two of them wanting to cry.","What a way to express friendship!","Although they were divine beasts expressing their friendship, it was still the usual manner in which others would! Who would scratch someone’s face with their claws!","Who wants to develop a relationship with that vicious stinky girl!","Female Devil, come back quickly! You can’t just fall into the beauty trap!","...","It’s a pity that Little Phoenix’s wail did not attract Huang Yueli’s attention.","In the abode of Saint Iniquitous Shadow, besides the storage room, there were also several rooms for staying in.","Li Moying and Huang Yueli occupied the master bedroom, a few guards lived in the guest room, and the two little beasts were placed in the backyard to “cultivate their relationship”."]},{"number":3520,"title":"Chapter 3520 I’ve Said It Before, You Can’t Do It! (3)","paragraphs":["3520 I’ve Said It Before, You Can’t Do It! (3)","One night passed, and the disheartened Little Phoenix did not see his Master again until late in the morning.","“Female Devil!!”","As soon as Little Phoenix saw his master, he excitedly went up to her and couldn’t wait to file a complaint.","However, Huang Yueli just patted him on the head, then turned to Li Moying, “Alright, let’s go to the grassland you mentioned yesterday, and see how many spirit beasts we can tame?”","!!","When Little Phoenix heard this, he was shocked!","By the way, their mission today was to tame spirit beasts, and he even made a bet with that stinky Qilin!","Thinking of this, he suddenly felt an ominous premonition.","To be honest, his strength was actually inferior to that of the Little Qilin. Today... he won’t really lose, right?","Ugh, he’ll just face whatever comes at him then! As soon as he thought of this, he heard Lilac Jadeite’s voice: “Don’t forget the bet we made yesterday! If anyone loses, the loser will respect the winner as the boss in the future! Whether it is to eat crystal core, drink water or eat the chicken legs roasted by Lil’ Big Sister, the boss must be given priority!”","Little Phoenix was shocked!","How can this work! If he loses, even the Female Devil’s grilled chicken legs will be given to this stinky girl?","“No, you... What are you talking about? We didn’t say what the bet was at all yesterday!” Little Phoenix quickly retorted.","The Little Qilin wagged her tail slowly, “I didn’t say the bet yesterday, so it’s not too late to say it today? What? Could it be that you don’t dare to gamble because you know you will lose? If you don’t dare, forget it, anyway. I’ve said it before, you can’t~~”","“Who do you say can’t do it!!” Little Phoenix ran away again like a cat whose tail had been stepped on! “Just bet! I want to see who can tame more spirit beasts!”","As soon as the words came out, Little Phoenix regretted it!","Heavens! What did he just say?! He will definitely lose...lose...lose","Was this the end? Does he have to say goodbye to the Female Devil’s grilled chicken legs from now on? He can’t bear it!","There were also braised chicken drumsticks, scallion chicken drumsticks, crispy fried chicken drumsticks...","When the two little ones said these words, they always huddled together and said them furtively.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying walked very fast, and they didn’t hear what they were muttering at all. It was not until they reached the edge of the grassland that they realized that the two divine beast cubs were walking very slowly, and they were both far behind them. .","The two had no choice but to stop and wait for them to catch up.","Huang Yueli felt deeply relieved when she saw the two cubs talking together!","“Seeing that you two have such a good relationship, I feel relieved!”","Little Phoenix froze all over, couldn’t even move his wings and almost fell to the ground again!","Female Devil, which eye of yours actually sees that our relationship is good?!","Huang Yueli looked at the situation in front of her before she turned to Li Moying and said, “Husband, I’m going to have a look at the medicine fields over there to see if the spirit herbs dug out by Big Brother Tianyi and the others yesterday can be planted in my space. If so, we won’t have to worry about the lack of medicinal materials!”","Li Moying nodded, “Alright, let’s go.”","“Then I’ll leave it all to you!”","Huang Yueli smiled sweetly at her husband, stood on tiptoe and kissed his cheek.","Li Moying was startled, and was about to pull him into his arms for a good kiss, but Huang Yueli turned to the side and slipped out of his arms.","“Alright, then I’ll go now, help me catch a few more spirit beasts, I like the fluffy ones!”"]},{"number":3521,"title":"Chapter 3521 I’ve Said It Before, You Can’t Do It!(4)","paragraphs":["3521 I’ve Said It Before, You Can’t Do It!(4)","After Huang Yueli spoke, she completely ignored Little Phoenix’s aggrieved eyes as she turned around and walked towards the medicine field not far away.","Yesterday, when they entered the secret realm in the morning, these medicine fields were all green, lush, and covered with various medicinal herbs. Some of them even grew a little too lush because of the age, blocking the roads in the fields.","But now, most of the branches and leaves growing on the ground have been taken away by Li Tianyi and the others, leaving only a layer close to the ground.","Huang Yueli crouched down and began to carefully examine the roots of these herbs.","!!","It turned out that although Li Tianyi and the others had acted as carefully as possible, they were not professional pharmacists after all, and they were also inexperienced. Many medicinal herbs had their roots damaged to varying degrees.","Huang Yueli took a lot of effort to find the most complete one from the remaining branches and leaves and transplanted them into her space.","Huang Yueli’s Sky Phoenix Ring, after several upgrades, has an area of ??four or five miles. However, after she entered the tenth level, the area no longer increased, but the profound energy of heaven and earth inside became more dense.","Huang Yueli planted a medicinal herb carefully, and then took a bucket of spirit water from the saint spring which was not too far away and gently watered it around the medicinal herb.","“Well, that should be fine!”","Huang Yueli looked at the trembling plants on the ground, touched her chin, and tried her best to recall her previous experience of taking care of herbs in the Alchemist Guild, confirming that she should have done nothing wrong.","However, the medicinal herbs in the God Realm were different from those in the Lower Realm and the cultivation methods were not necessarily the same. Moreover, the higher-level medicinal herbs have a lower survival rate. Whether they can finally take root and sprout in space can only be said to be unknown.","However, just as Huang Yueli was about to leave, she suddenly felt a slight fluctuation of profound energy by her side.","“Eh? What happened?”","Huang Yueli hurriedly looked left and right, and was surprised to find that the small herb that she had just planted had already started to sprout!","At the top of the original withered branch, a cluster of tender green leaves grew at a speed visible to the naked eye!","“Oh my goodness! I... I’m not mistaken, right?? This is a high-level medicinal herb, and Moying told me yesterday that it takes a hundred years to bear fruit when planting this kind of medicinal herb. It takes a year to get a branch! But now it’s... this is too fast??”","Huang Yueli couldn’t believe her eyes!","She stared at the tender sprout in front of her for a while, then suddenly thought of something, and she dodged and left her space.","She returned to the secret realm, and immediately dug a herb on the ground, and returned to the Sky Phoenix Ring again.","Huang Yueli hurriedly planted the herbs, stood up straight, and waited by the side for a while.","This herb didn’t respond, and it still didn’t look very energetic.","Seeing this, Huang Yueli frowned slightly, “What’s going on? Why did the same species of herb sprout so fast just now?”","Suddenly, she patted her head, “By the way, I forgot to water it!”","She hurried to the edge of the saint spring, took the water, ran back to her original position, and started watering the second herb.","The moment she poured the water out, very soon after, the second herb also began to sprout new shoots!","“This spirit spring is actually so useful!” Huang Yueli almost jumped up with excitement."]},{"number":3522,"title":"Chapter 3522 I’ve Said It Before, You Can’t Do It! (5)","paragraphs":["3522 I’ve Said It Before, You Can’t Do It! (5)","Knowing that these medicinal herbs could survive in space, Huang Yueli naturally would not waste them, and simply transplanted all the medicinal herb plants that were in good condition from the secret realm.","Although she had the spirit spring water to assist, growing medicinal herbs was still a physical effort.","Huang Yueli was busy until the evening, and only half of the transplanting was completed.","Seeing that the sky was getting dark, she straightened her back and wiped the sweat from her forehead, “Forget it, I’ll just transplant some of them and let the remaining half stay in the secret realm.”","After she finished her work, she remembered that Li Moying took the two little ones to catch spirit beasts in the morning, and she didn’t know what to expect.","Just as she was thinking about this, she heard footsteps in the distance.","She turned her head to look over, and saw Li Moying walking towards her from afar.","With his back facing the setting sun in the west, the shadows and golden light accentuated his figure and made her look longer. He walked slowly and leisurely, and he had the powerful aura of a superior, which made others hold their breath.","Huang Yueli stared at her husband with wide eyes, and forgot to speak for a while.","Li Moying walked closer, seeing her slightly dazed, his lips curled up into a little smile.","“Little Li’er...”","A deep and sexy voice rang in her ears, and Huang Yueli suddenly came back to her senses, only to realize that Li Moying had already walked to her side.","“Husband, you’re back. I was just about to go... Mmph!”","Halfway through her words, a man suddenly approached her and took her breath away.","“Hey, you... Let go of me! Don’t lead the children astray!” Huang Yueli quickly pushed him.","Li Moying was still intoxicated and said casually: “Leave them alone...”","“No! “Huang Yueli became anxious, pushed him away with all her strength, and then hurriedly turned to look for Wang Cai and the others.","When she turned around, she saw that the two little ones had turned into humans, squatting side by side not far away. Both of them were staring at them with big round eyes.","Huang Yueli was suddenly embarrassed, and a blush appeared on her face.","Although these two were still young, they were ancient divine beasts with extremely high intelligence! She always had a sense of guilt for leading the children astray.","Li Moying wasn’t guilty at all, his eyes swept across the two divine beast cubs, and cast a warning gaze on them.","Lilac Jadeite’s figure was a seven or eight-year-old little girl, with a chubby little face that looked soft and cute.","She looked at Huang Yueli innocently, “Lil’ Big Sister, don’t be nervous, we didn’t see anything!”","“Cough, cough, cough...” Huang Yueli almost choked!","This was simply trying to cover up! Who did this little girl learn from? Was it on purpose?","To cover it up, she quickly coughed twice and changed the subject forcibly, “By the way, husband, you came back so late, did you tame a lot of spirit beasts today? Wang Cai and Lilac Jadeite had a bet yesterday, right? Who actually won?”","Hearing this, Wang Cai’s face froze and he almost fell to the ground.","This... was really a pot’s lid that could not be opened and lifted!","Finally, the black-bellied and cunning little girl next to it saw the two masters kissing each other, and forgot about it, but Huang Yueli brought it up again!","Li Moying saw that Huang Yueli’s back was sore, so he walked over, put his arms around her slender waist, and said with a low laugh: “It is true that many spirit beasts have been tamed today, but I don’t know who caught more.”"]},{"number":3523,"title":"Chapter 3523 I’ve Said It Before, You Can’t Do It! (6)","paragraphs":["3523 I’ve Said It Before, You Can’t Do It! (6)","Although Li Moying said so, Huang Yueli knew who was the loser when she saw Little Phoenix’s dejected expression.","“Well, Wang Cai, haven’t you always boasted about yourself so much? Didn’t you lose to the girl this time?”","Little Phoenix raised his head unconvinced, “It’s just because...there are too few flying spirit beasts in this secret realm! It affects my performance! Otherwise...otherwise I won’t lose!”","“Tch, you don’t admit you lost, you’re so shameless!” Lilac Jadeite unceremoniously followed up with complaints, and even stuck out her tongue.","“You...!”","Little Phoenix was very angry, but he couldn’t say anything to refute. He could only blush with his cheeks puffed up.","Seeing Little Wang Cai’s aggrieved look, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but feel a little guilty.","Speaking of which, Little Phoenix awakened a year earlier than Lilac Jadeite, and he followed her through life and death several times. However, because she failed to return to the Sacred Phoenix Clan and could not obtain the resources of the clan, Little Phoenix’s growth was severely affected, and now he was no match for Little Qilin...","In the final analysis, it was her, his master, who didn’t do a good job...","Huang Yueli sighed secretly, raised her hand to touch Little Wang Cai’s head, and comforted him: “It’s alright, even if you lose this time, as long as you practice hard, you might win in the future! Being able to tame so many spirit beast is already very powerful! Go back tonight and I’ll add chicken legs for you!”","Only then did Little Phoenix’s complexion look a little better.","Huang Yueli said again: “Which spirit beasts did you tame? I’ll transfer them into my space first!”","Hearing this, the two little ones couldn’t wait to jump out and offer her their spoils.","They quickly changed back to their beast form.","Little Phoenix waved his wings in mid-air and called out, while the Little Qilin also waved her little hoof and roared up to the sky.","Not long after, a large group of spirit beasts appeared in front of Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli stared dumbfounded at the scene in front of her, and said with her fingers, “One, two, three... ten, twenty, thirty... one hundred... Oh my god, how many spirit beasts have you tamed?”","She couldn’t believe her eyes!","Of course, she knew long ago that even if the two little ones were just cubs, as long as they were divine beasts, they could definitely tame many spirit beasts, and it was impossible to return empty-handed.","However, she never expected that she would see such a large group!","Li Moying stood behind her, with a hint of a smile in her voice, “Because of the bet, the two little guys did their best! I didn’t expect that the potential of the cubs of the beast is so great!”","“Female Devil, Young Master, am I very powerful?!”","“There’s me, there’s me! Lil’ Big Sister, I’m even better! You’ve lost, go away!”","Hearing two immature voices, Huang Yueli lowered her head, and saw two little cubs standing in front of the group of spirit beasts. They raised their heads at the same time, their eyes were shining brightly at her, and their expressions were clearly asking for praise.","“Awesome, you are all very powerful!”","Seeing the cute expressions of the two little ones, Huang Yueli was immediately struck by the cuteness.","Usually when they are together, these two brats only know how to quarrel, but when they are obedient, they are actually quite cute!","She couldn’t help squatting down, and kissed each of the two small, fat faces.","“Female... female devil, you are so nasty!” Little Wang Cai’s face suddenly turned red!","Lilac Jadeite was not polite, she hugged Huang Yueli’s neck and was about to kiss her back."]},{"number":3524,"title":"Chapter 3524 Why Is It So Strong! (1)","paragraphs":["3524 Why Is It So Strong! (1)","However, the moment before her pink lips touched Huang Yueli’s face, Lilac Jadeite suddenly found herself in mid air.","Huang Yueli didn’t feel the expected touch. When she opened her eyes, she saw Li Moying’s face darkened, and he tossed the little girl in his hand onto the grass next to her.","Immediately, Huang Yueli’s body tilted, and she was hooked into his arms, her lips were sealed again.","Moreover, this time, Li Moying kissed her very seriously. After kissing for a while, Huang Yueli almost felt that she could not breathe, so he let her go.","“Little Li’er, what are you going to do with these spirit beasts?” Li Moying said nonchalantly.","Huang Yueli glared at him several times, but the expression on her face didn’t change at all, she was still very calm, it seemed that the person who did that to the little girl and kissed her forcibly just now was not him at all.","Huang Yueli couldn’t laugh or cry.","This man was really...","Such a cute little girl, what’s wrong with a kiss? Besides, those two little ones were just divine beasts, not human beings!","However, Li Moying didn’t think so in his heart, no matter how small or cute she was, she couldn’t kiss his woman!","Looking at his arrogant side face, Huang Yueli felt helpless, so she could only say: “This... I didn’t expect that they’d have tamed so many spirit beasts! If all of these were to be raised in my space, it would cost a lot of money. There are too many resources here... How about this, I think there are several high-level spirit beasts here, maybe Big Brother Tianyi and the others will be interested, let them each contract one, and the rest of the middle-level spirit beasts can be eaten. There are relatively few, so I will keep them here.”","Li Moying nodded without any objection.","The two of them went back with a group of spirit beasts. When Li Tianyi and the others knew that they could contract a high-level spirit beast, they were almost crazy with joy!","You know, the high-level spirit beasts in the God Realm were very powerful and have a very arrogant temperament.","It was already very difficult to kill these spirit beasts, but it was ten times harder to domesticate them. Most spirit beasts would rather die than become slaves.","Those of the Cloudy Qilin Clan who are able to tame high-level spirit beasts were all elders of the Dao Profound Realm. The younger generation like them have no ability at all, nor are they qualified to contract high-level spirit beasts.","“Thank you, Young Master, thank you,Madame!”","The excitement on the faces of the four of them was hard to hide.","It was really worth it for them to follow Huang Yueli and Li Moying along on this expedition!","They didn’t encounter too many dangers along the way, and got so many benefits, whether it was the whole set of mid-level Spirit Armaments given to them by Huang Yueli, the manual that Li Moying gave them yesterday, or the high-level spirit beast contracted today, these were all things they couldn’t get by themselves!","Huang Yueli originally wanted to teach them how to contract spirit beasts.","However, the four guards were from the ancient god clans and the contract technique was much better than hers.","She could only watch from the sidelines.","The six of them stayed in the secret realm for another three days. Since the secret realm was not big, this time was enough for them to search the entire area several times carefully, turning over every corner.","This time, their harvest was not small. The secret realm of Saint Iniquitous Shadow has not been visited by others and almost all the treasures have fallen into their hands.","“It seems that my premonition at the beginning was wrong...” Huang Yueli was thoughtful."]},{"number":3525,"title":"Chapter 3525 How Can It Be So Strong! (2)","paragraphs":["3525 How Can It Be So Strong! (2)","When she met the person following them, she thought that this experience would not go well, but in the end, things were completely different from what she thought, and everything went unbelievably smoothly!","“Everything here is almost packed. It doesn’t make much sense for us to stay here any longer. We can prepare to leave tomorrow.” Huang Yueli said.","In the secret realm of Saint Iniquitous Shadow, evil qi was pretty heavy.","Although these evil qi weren’t a burden to her and Li Moying, they still do great damage to Li Tianyi’s meridians, so they could not stay for a long time.","After she finished speaking, she turned her head to look, only to find that Li Moying frowned slightly, as if he was a little unhappy.","She asked strangely: “Moying, what’s wrong with you?”","Li Moying shook his head, “It’s nothing, it’s just that I thought there was...but I didn’t find it, maybe it’s just a rumor, forget it!”","He spoke a few words very softly, even Huang Yueli who was standing in front of him couldn’t hear them clearly.","Subconsciously, she approached him and asked, “What did you just say? What are you looking for?”","Seeing the beautiful girl approaching actively, Li Moying’s eyes flickered, and he grabbed her slender waist, and his deep and magnetic voice whispered in her ear: “What I’m looking for is... the name of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s Double Cultivation manuals!”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment, then suddenly raised her head, her big eyes revealed an expression of disbelief!","“You, you, you... what are you thinking about!”","Li Moying had an innocent expression on his face, “What I’m thinking is how can we quickly improve the cultivation of the two of us? With such a serious and upright thought, why do you look at me like this?”","“Serious... Honest... I think you are shameless!”","Huang Yueli was about to vomit blood!","Where did that cold and noble Sect Master Li go when he was in Soaring Heavens Continent? ? She still remembers when the two of them got married, she thought there was something wrong with Li Moying! Because he didn’t consummate with her!","But now...","When she arrived in the God Realm, she realized that Li Moying was completely different from what she had imagined!","He was simply... a beast!","She stepped on Li Moying’s foot hard, and jumped out of his arms while Li Moying was crying out in pain.","“Alright, it’s getting late! Let’s get some rest! Tomorrow we’ll go back to Forest Shade Town!”","Li Moying looked at her fleeing figure, shook his head, and did not chase after her.","However, he was still thinking about this important question in his mind: “Speaking of which, the most famous exercise of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow was the secret book of double cultivation that he and his wife cultivated This secret realm contains almost all of his famous skills back then. But only that one is missing... Is it really not here, or is there something we haven’t thought of?”","Li Moying was a little reconciled, and he didn’t care to climb into bed to harass Huang Yueli, so he seized the time of the last night and checked the suspicious places again.","Because of this, Huang Yueli had a rare good sleep. No one disturbed her throughout the night, and she slept until dawn.","When she woke up, there was no one in the room.","Huang Yueli ran to the door and saw that Li Moying was already ready, standing at the entrance of the secret realm, waiting for her.","“Let’s go!”","...","In the dense forest to the west of Forest Shade Town, on the edge of the array of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow...","“Elder Shuangyu, we’ve been waiting here for four or five days, and we haven’t even seen a ghost. Tell me, did that kid Li Moying really go in?”"]},{"number":3526,"title":"Chapter 3526 How Can It Be So Strong! (3)","paragraphs":["3526 How Can It Be So Strong! (3)","Huang Fuzhao was leaning on the trunk of a big tree with a rather impatient expression.","“In my opinion, they either didn’t go in or they died inside! How long are we going to stay in this ghostly place? Staring at such an empty forest every day like a fool!”","At first, he thought that this monitoring task was not too difficult, but after staying in this desolate woods for a few days, Huang Fuzhao began to feel uncomfortable all over.","Even though they would sometimes come to the wilderness when they were practicing in seclusion or going out for training on weekdays, they all had a purpose and had something to do.","Now, asking him to wait for people here day after day, and he has to keep his ears open to pay attention to the surrounding situation even while cultivating. There was really nothing worse than this!","Huang Shuangyu was two hundred years older than him, so her patience was naturally much better.","She glanced at Huang Fuzhao, and said unhurriedly: “That’s something we can’t help. Judging from my experience, Li Moying must have entered this forest, otherwise, he must have returned to the Forest Shade Town. When my Third Brother sees him, he will definitely send someone to notify us.”","Huang Fuzhao also understood this truth, but after hearing this, he became even more irritable.","“Then there’s no need for us to really stay here for a full month, right? Even if it’s us, two exponents at the Dao Profound Realm were to enter that ghostly place, wouldn’t we almost lose our lives in it? Li Moying and the rest of his little entourage who are merely in the Heart Profound Realm will definitely die in less than an hour! I have been here for four or five days, and I can be sure that Li Moying is dead, can we go back?”","Huang Shuangyu shook her head, and said slowly: “Elder Zhao, please be more calm and don’t be impatient. My Third Brother made it very clear. This matter was personally explained by the Patriarch. We have to go back and reply, and we must have reliable news. You can’t tell the Patriarch that Li Moying might be dead inside, right?”","Huang Fuzhao was originally full of resentment, but usually his disciples and concubines would go along with him and comfort him, but now the old woman beside him is not polite at all!","He couldn’t express his resentment, and became more and more anxious, and couldn’t help pacing back and forth in the forest.","“Elder Sanbai is really lazy. He only knows that he sent the two of us to this ghostly place, but he stays in the inn in Forest Shade Town, eating and drinking every day! If we had known, we should have discussed the timing with him and we can change shifts every day!”","Thinking of this, his eyes lit up, “Yes, that’s how it should be! The shift should be changed! Why didn’t I think of it earlier? I’ll send him a message!”","As Huang Fuzhao said, he took out a pen and paper from the interspatial ring.","But just as he was about to write, Huang Shuangyu suddenly shouted in a low voice: “Wait!”","“What are you waiting for? Elder Shuangyu, are you willing to stay here for a month?” Huang Fuzhao said disapprovingly.","Huang Shuangyu frowned suddenly, made a silent gesture, and then lowered her voice and said: “It seems that we don’t need to stay here for a month!”","“What?” Huang Shuangyu was shocked suddenly!","He hurriedly turned his head and looked in the direction Huang Shuangyu pointed.","In the dense forest, a team of six young people was slowly coming out from the depths of the shadows.","The young man in the lead was tall and handsome, not to mention, the aura of a strong man was apparent!"]},{"number":3527,"title":"Chapter 3527 How Can It Be So Strong! (4)","paragraphs":["3527 How Can It Be So Strong! (4)","Although it had been proven that Li Moying was a god-level genius, it was not a rumor, but Huang Shuangyu did not think that a young man in his twenties could cause any harm to a 400-year-old senior exponent like her.","Not sending a message to Huang Sanbai, she didn’t want one more person to share the spoils.","She also wants to know how Li Moying was able to leave such a dangerous place safely, and he must have a lot of treasures on his body. Moreover, if they ventured into some ancient secret realm, then the gains in the secret realm must also be brought out along with them too!!","In Huang Shuangyu’s eyes, this team was simply a moving treasure house!","Huang Fuzhao was also a sensible person, and immediately reacted.","The two exchanged a glance of tacit understanding and leaned behind the tree, waiting for Li Moying and the others to approach.","However, to their surprise, when Li Moying and the others walked halfway and were still thousands of meters away from them, they suddenly stopped moving.","What’s more, several people stopped in place and started talking, as if they were discussing something.","Huang Fuzhao waited for a while, but he didn’t see any movement from them, so he suddenly felt uneasy.","What happened? Had they been discovered?","...","On the other side, Li Moying and Huang Yueli left the secret realm in the morning with four guards, and the process went smoothly.","However, when Huang Yueli was trying to restore the arrays around the secret realm, a little accident happened.","“The devil stones have all been placed back in the order before we entered the secret realm.”"]},{"number":3528,"title":"Chapter 3528 How Can It Be So Strong! (5)","paragraphs":["3528 How Can It Be So Strong! (5)","Huang Yueli stared at the large black mist in front of her, with a confused look on her face.","“It stands to reason that the evil qi gathered at the entrance of the secret realm should all dissipate and restore the previous situation! Why do these evil qi still surround the entrance and never dissipate? Could it be that I did something wrong?”","Seeing her staring at the entrance so intently, Li Moying contemplated for a moment. He stepped forward, took her little hand, and said, “At least we have left safely, and these evil qi have not affected us. That’s enough! What happens to the secret realm in the future has nothing to do with us.”","“Well... that’s true.” Huang Yueli nodded, no longer dwelling on this issue.","However, her thoughts still drifted far away.","The array could not be restored to its original state, which means that the evil qi in the array with a radius of more than ten miles will condense at the entrance of the secret realm, and all other arrays will fail.","Originally, this area was a restricted area. For tens of thousands of years, countless cultivators were buried in the dense forest.","However, after the array failed, many people could easily reach their current positions, and the abode might no longer be a secret.","It’s just that it’s easy to come here, but it’s difficult to break the evil seal and enter the secret realm!","Moreover, there were not many things left in the secret realm as they had basically taken away everything that could be taken away!","“I can only wish the latecomers good luck!” Huang Yueli shrugged.","Li Moying pinched her cheek in amusement, “You still have the mood to meddle in other people’s business! Well, we can go back and try to find a place to rest before dark.”","Huang Yueli nodded and followed Li Moying’s footsteps.","The entire return trip became very smooth due to the absence of barriers from arrays.","Coming here took two full days of walking but it only took one day to get back.","Seeing that she was about to walk out of the restricted area, Li Moying’s expression suddenly changed, and her steps also slowed down.","When he walked to this area, he felt a familiar feeling of someone staring at them, which made him feel very uncomfortable.","He immediately raised his hand to make everyone stop.","“Moying? What’s the matter? Is someone following us again?” Huang Yueli subconsciously looked around.","Li Moying nodded, “There are indeed people here!”","The four guards were all shocked when they heard this.","Huang Yueli frowned, “What’s going on? We’ve just come out, and we’re being followed?”","She quickly remembered something again, “Could it be that the person who followed us when we came is the same? Moying, can you determine the location?”","Li Moying frowned slightly, and didn’t speak immediately, as if he was concentrating on something.","After a while, he said in a low voice: “I can feel that the other party is not far to the southeast, but there are too many trees there, and the sky is getting dark, so I can’t judge the exact location.”","Huang Yueli said: “Why don’t we go over and have a look and dig someone out at the same time? Last time, that person just ran away like this, so there will be hidden dangers. This time, we can’t let anyone slip away again!”","Li Moying shook his head and said, “The opponent seems to be very strong, stronger than the enemy we encountered last time! You must be careful!”","This situation was beyond Huang Yueli’s expectation.","However, she didn’t have any fear. Instead, she put on a defensive stance with a serious expression."]},{"number":3529,"title":"Chapter 3529 How Can It Be So Strong! (6)","paragraphs":["3529 How Can It Be So Strong! (6)","Huang Yueli also released her divine sense to carefully investigate the situation.","However, the other party’s cultivation was obviously much higher than hers, and she couldn’t find anything more than Li Moying.","Huang Yueli turned her head to look at her husband, and said, “If you can’t determine the location of the other party, I have a way.”","“Oh, you do? What is it?” Li Moying raised his eyebrows.","“Your Little Qilin is still running outside, isn’t it? Call her back and see if you can find anything unusual with the divine sense of a divine beast.”","Huang Yueli’s Little Phoenix was ??a spirit body and could not leave too far away from her side. However, Li Moying’s Little Qilin was a living creature, and its strength should be stronger, so it was perfect for investigation work.","Hearing this, Li Moying nodded, and quickly communicated with the Little Qilin with his spiritual sense.","The four guards stood in place very vigilantly, ready to protect their Young Master and Madame at any time.","At this moment, Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao, who were hiding behind the big tree, had lost their patience.","“They really stopped moving! It seems that they have really discovered that we’re here!”","“There’s no point in waiting any longer, why don’t we just take action?”","“This...” Huang Shuangyu still hesitated.","However, Huang Fuzhao couldn’t wait any longer. “It’s just a few brats in the Heart Profound Realm. Even if we don’t rely on sneak attacks, don’t tell me we still can’t kill them? I really don’t know what it’s like to hide here!”","Huang Shuangyu thought about it, and immediately nodded.","The two of them leaped out together and were about to jump out from behind the tree.","Suddenly, a blueish purple lightning flashed across their heads!","Immediately after, a huge momentum struck from behind them!","Caught off guard, the two were immediately knocked out of balance by that force, and fell straight out from behind the tree!","“Damn it! What happened??”","Although the strength of the two were there, and their adaptability was not too slow, they quickly adjusted their postures and stabilized their bodies, but their positions have been completely exposed to Li Moying and others.","Li Moying’s eyes flickered slightly, and without any hesitation, he summoned the energy of the thunder attribute and flew towards the two of them!","Li Tianyi and the others formed a sword array, and they attacked together. The speed was a little slower than Li Moying’s, but the reaction was extremely fast.","Several sword intent swept towards the positions of Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao!","The two elders nearly fell, and before they recovered, they sensed several powerful energies approaching, so they quickly tried to find a way to defend themselves!","However, they were still one step too late after all!","Li Moying’s ball of light reached them and immediately split into dozens of electric lights, intertwined with each other, forming a cage-like spherical body, wrapping them inside.","After the sphere was formed, it became smaller at a speed visible to the naked eye. As the volume shrank, the energy in the light sphere became stronger and stronger. The crackling sound of lightning made people feel chills!","The complexions of Huang Fuzhao and Huang Shuangyu both changed!","“Lightning Cage!! This is actually the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s secret Lightning Cage!!”","“Damn it! How is it possible?? Isn’t this something only cultivators in the DaoProfound Realm can do?”","Seeing the lightning cage so suddenly, both of them were stunned.","However, the two still reacted in time, and they shot with all their strength. Flames flashed from their bodies, fighting against the ever-shrinking ball of light."]},{"number":3530,"title":"Chapter 3530 Can’t Help But Say (1)","paragraphs":["3530 Can’t Help But Say (1)","Under the scorching flames, Li Moying’s lightning cage didn’t last long and it completely collapsed after a few seconds.","Although there was no danger, Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao were still covered in cold sweat from the fright as they looked at Li Moying in horror.","They never thought that Li Moying would be so strong! He actually trapped them as soon as he made a move!","Even if it was only for a few breaths, it was still shocking.","There was a qualitative difference in strength between an exponent of the Heart Profound Realm and an exponent of the Dao Profound Realm. Although they already knew that Li Moying was a god-level genius, and would definitely be several times stronger than cultivators of the same level, they never expected that as soon as they met each other, they would suffer a disadvantage under Li Moying’s hands!","Moreover, Li Moying still trapped the two of them, it was one against two!","For a moment, the two of them couldn’t even utter a word.","However, after glancing at the two of them, Li Moying said coldly, “You... are members of the Sacred Phoenix Clan?”","Just now, in desperation in order to resist such a powerful secret technique as the Lightning Cage, the two of them didn’t care about other things, and directly used the unique fire-type secret technique of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","Thi, however, had completely exposed their identities.","However, the two of them had no intention of hiding their identities.","Therefore, after being recognised by Li Moying, Huang Shuangyu immediately came back to her senses as she sneered, and said: “Li Moying, the legendary genius of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! You are indeed very strong!” Strong, beyond what I expected. God is really short-sighted, to let such a ruthless bastard like you get such a talent!”","Li Moying heard the words, the expression on his face didn’t change, but there was a trace of doubt in his heart.","It was true that the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan have always been at odds. However, in the last ten thousand years, the two sides have at least not been visibly hostile to each other. Although they occasionally meet and cause fights, they will not come to the door deliberately.","Now, these two Dao Profound Realm experts from the Sacred Phoenix Clan called out his name at once, and they were obviously targeting him.","Thinking back on the person they had failed to catch before entering the secret realm... The Sacred Phoenix Clan had been following him for so long!","Wasn’t this too unusual?","Could it be...they already knew about Huang Yueli’s marriage to him?","Not only Li Moying, but Huang Yueli also thought of this involuntarily.","However, she did not speak rashly, but exchanged a look with Li Moying.","Li Moying understood, and asked tentatively: “Looking at the strength of the two of you, you must be the elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. As seniors, it’s too irresponsible for the two of you to speak such words! Li believes that he has not offended But you, on the contrary, you secretly followed us! What qualifications do you have to say that Li is ruthless?”","“You still have the face to say that!” Huang Fuzhao was irritable and couldn’t bear it now, pointing directly at Li Moying and yelling!","“You are not only ruthless, but also a despicable and shameless villain! Our Sacred Phoenix Clan has a sworn hatred against you! Stop talking nonsense, it is useless to say anything, we must kill you here today! Die! !”","“Wait....”","Huang Yueli heard that the words were not right and wanted to ask clearly.","However, Huang Fuzhao had already lost his patience, and directly shot at Li Moying!"]},{"number":3531,"title":"Chapter 3531 Can’t Help But Say (2)","paragraphs":["3531 Can’t Help But Say (2)","During the short exchange that just happened, Huang Fuzhao already understood that Li Moying’s strength was much stronger than they had imagined.","Therefore, he didn’t dare to neglect this time. Not only did he attack with all his strength, but he also sent a sound transmission to Huang Shuangyu, asking her to cooperate with him and attack together!","The two Dao Profound Realm powerhouses shot at the same time, and both used their famous moves!","A blast of fire profound energy burst out suddenly, covering the entire area.","Countless fire dragons descended from the sky, and even the giant trees in the dense forest began to burn.","In everyone’s eyes, there were patches of golden flames.","Li Moying unsheathed his long sword as he went up to meet the attack directly. Lightning bolts descended from the sky, fighting head-on with the fire profound energy that had been unleashed!","Li Moying’s speed and strength could not be matched by cultivators of the same level. However, facing the strong exponents in the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm, he could only be at a disadvantage. If he was not killed immediately, he was already considered a genius amongst geniuses!","What’s more, there were still two Dao Profound Realm powerhouses attacking him at the same time!","The two sides exchanged a few blows and Li Moying almost vomited blood.","Huang Yueli hurriedly chased after them, and followed closely, trying to protect Li Moying.","However, Li Tianyi and the others were faster than her!","These guards in the Heart Profound Realm couldn’t bear the huge profound force.","However, they still kept their responsibilities firmly in mind, and determination flashed in their eyes!","They took a few steps forward at the same time, protected Li Moying and Huang Yueli behind them, and simultaneously drew their swords together!","The cold and stern sword intent shot out from their hands, cutting through the encircling circle of flames in an instant!","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but look at them a few more times, because Li Tianyi’s move caught her by surprise.","During this period of time spent together, she has already gained a deep understanding of the strength of these people. With their individual strength, they may not be able to last a while in front of the Dao Profound Realm powerhouse. However, when the four of them formed a sword array, he was able to explode with such strength!","Huang Fuzhao was also surprised, “This is...the legendary sword array of the Cloudy Qilin Clan? It really deserves its reputation!”","However, a sneer soon appeared on the corner of his mouth, “However, with just a few of you little bastards in the Heart Profound Realm, what’s the use of knowing how to use a sword array? It’s better if you let your Master do it instead!”","As he said that, Huang Fuzhao suddenly accelerated the speed of circulating the profound energy in his body.","The flames around him also re-condensed, and they were even more intense and powerful than before!","Under such coercion, Li Tianyi and the others were flushed, and blood even oozed from the corners of their mouths, but they refused to take a step back!","However, no matter how determined their will was, the gap in strength was apparent.","What Huang Fuzhao said was not just a threat, but a real fact!","In just three breaths of time, Li Tianyi and the others could no longer bear it, and were defeated.","“Bang bang bang bang—!”","Several crisp crackling sounds came out one after another!","The long sword in the hands of Li Tianyi and the others broke into two pieces under the impact of the flames, and the sword array also collapsed!","Without the protection of the sword array, Huang Fuzhao’s fire profound energy drove straight in, directly rushing to the chests of several people!","Given the difference in cultivation between the two sides, if Li Tianyi and the others fully withstood this attack, they would definitely die!"]},{"number":3532,"title":"Chapter 3532 Can’t Help But Say (3)","paragraphs":["3532 Can’t Help But Say (3)","A cold glint flashed across Li Moying’s eyes, and he wanted to go and save them.","However, Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao cooperated tacitly, how could they give him such an opportunity?","She also sped up the attack speed in her hand, holding Li Moying back, so that he couldn’t find any gaps to escape, let alone save the guards under him.","Seeing that Li Tianyi and the others were dying, Huang Fuzhao couldn’t help but sneered!","Although these guards don’t have much strength, if the ants dare to attack a strong man like him, it was tantamount to courting death!","After crushing these troublesome ants to death, he was able to deal with Li Moying wholeheartedly!","Dare to kill the god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, he will not let Li Moying die too happily, he must make him pay in blood and pay the price!","However, at the moment when Huang Fuzhao was about to win, there was a sudden “buzz” in his mind!","Immediately afterwards, he suddenly felt dizzy, and the movements of his hands slowed down a little.","This little bit of time was enough to decide life and death!","Huang Yueli used the zither together with her Piercing Sky Eye Technique, which made Huang Fuzhao dizzy for a while, and using that short span, she used her profound energy to wrap around the bodies of Li Tianyi and the other four guards, and threw them into the distance.","Huang Fuzhao soon came to his senses, but his moves were a step too slow and it was too late to take them back. The fire profound energy that came out of the bombardment happened to pass by the four guards!","Li Tianyi and the others were thrown heavily on the grass, and they all vomited blood before they fell into a coma.","However, after all, this is much better than receiving Huang Fuzhao’s attack head on and there was still a chance of being rescued.","Huang Yueli saved their lives, but she didn’t even have time to heave a sigh of relief.","Huang Fuzhao realized that it was the small young man next to Li Moying who ruined his good deed, and immediately became furious. As all his anger had not been vented just now, he directed them all at Huang Yueli and attacked her crazily!","Huang Yueli quickly used her Agility Dance Steps to the extreme to evade all the incoming attacks.","At the same time, the profound energy in her body was also fully mobilized, and the various Spirit Armaments that she had previously refined to save her life were also used without hesitation.","Although she was also a god-level genius and her talent was not inferior to Li Moying, but after all, she was only at the late stage of the Dream Profound Realm. Therefore, although her real combat power exceeded Li Tianyi, she still could not contend against Huang Fuzhao. Dao Profound Realm powerhouses were simply not comparable!","However, Huang Yueli was not immediately killed by one move, but persisted for quite a while.","This was mainly because she was also from the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and, as a god-level genius, her bloodline was purer and more perfect than Huang Fuzhao and the others.","Such kind of coercion from the bloodline’s superiority helped her gain a certain advantage when fighting against her own clan.","Huang Fuzhao also noticed that something was wrong with this young man.","It seems that it is only the cultivation base of the Dream Profound Realm, so why was he able to escape under his hands a few times?","However, the battle situation has entered a fierce stage, and Huang Fuzhao had no time to delve into it, so he could only do his best to chase after Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli’s situation gradually became dangerous. Li Moying saw it and felt extremely anxious in his heart. He couldn’t help but shout to the forest: “Lilac Jadeite, what are you waiting for?! Come out!”","The next moment, a purple lightning flashed out from the forest and rushed towards Huang Fuzhao!"]},{"number":3533,"title":"Chapter 3533 Can’t Help But Say (4)","paragraphs":["3533 Can’t Help But Say (4)","Lilac Jadeite’s speed was extremely fast, as an ancient divine beast with thunder attribute,her speed was even more astonishing than real lightning!","Huang Fuzhao suddenly saw a flash of lightning rushing towards him, and was really taken aback!","After he saw clearly that it was a Qilin that was galloping towards him, he broke out in a cold sweat.","“Qi... Qilin! Li Moying, you actually... tamed the Qilin!”","Over the past tens of thousands of years, the number of ancient divine beasts had become increasingly scarce, and the major Ancient God Clans have been unable to tame new divine beasts. The only few remaining in the clan were left by the masters of the Life Profound Realm in the clan tens of thousands of years ago.","But now, the one Li Moying summoned was obviously still a cub, and it even obeys him...","That can only mean that he personally contracted with this Qilin beast!","Even though he had already had a high evaluation of the strength of a god-level genius, Huang Fuzhao was still shocked by his new discovery!","God-level genius... Was it really such a heaven-defying existence? Could they do things that no one in the entire Ancient God Clan can do?","In addition to being shocked, Huang Fuzhao also felt even more hatred towards Li Moying.","Originally, their Sacred Phoenix Clan could also have a god-level genius! The god-level genius who was intercepted and killed by Li Moying halfway, if she was cultivated by the family, she would also be so outstanding and she could also bring the entire Sacred Phoenix Clan to the top!","But now?","Because of Li Moying, a ruthless guy, everything was ruined!","Thinking of this, Huang Fuzhao’s anger rose sharply, and his attacks became even crazier. He didn’t even care about defense, and his moves were all made in desperation trying to fight Li Moying!","As Lilac Jadeite flew towards Huang Fuzhao, she continued to grow in size. When she rushed to the front, she had changed from the size of a big cat to the size of an adult Qilin with a height of several metres.","She raised her head to the sky and howled, summoning countless thunderbolts, attacking towards Huang Fuzhao and Huang Shuangyu!","All of a sudden, Huang Fuzhao and the others’ pressure increased sharply, and Li Moying was also looking for an opportunity to make a move. Under the attack of the two sides, they fell into a disadvantage instead.","Huang Fuzhao didn’t care and attacked desperately.","Seeing him lose his composure and simply attacking crazily, Huang Shuangyu became anxious, and hurriedly shouted: “Elder Zhao, you must be steady! After all, this Qilin is just a cub, and although its strength has skyrocketed with the secret method, it won’t last long at all. At most a quarter of an hour, it will lose their strength and faint! As long as we persist for a while, they will definitely die!”","After all, Huang Shuangyu was the oldest and the most knowledgeable. She could see through the current situation of Little Qilin at a glance.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying became anxious when they heard her words.","Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao were indeed the elders of the Ancient God Clan. Although they seem to be at a disadvantage under the pressure of Little Qilin, it was almost impossible to kill them.","If they could not be severely injured or scared away within a quarter of an hour...","Could it be that thi was really the end for the two of them?","Huang Yueli didn’t want to reveal her identity at first, but at this moment, when life and death were at stake, she couldn’t care about anything else.","She suddenly let out a low voice: “Wang Cai, show up!”","As soon as the words fell, the figure of the Little Phoenix appeared from behind her, and, like the Little Qilin, he cast the most powerful secret technique as soon as he appeared, and each time he flapped his wings, he grew bigger!","In just a few breaths, he had already become the size of an adult phoenix!"]},{"number":3534,"title":"Chapter 3534 The Shocking Truth (1)","paragraphs":["3534 The Shocking Truth (1)","After Little Phoenix became bigger, he immediately pounced towards Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao!","The flames brought out by his wings swept across the entire forest and left a blazing sea of ??fire in its wake.","Seeing this, Huang Yueli also felt refreshed!","With the support of Little Phoenix, their strength had been greatly enhanced. However, Wang Cai’s strength was not as good as Lilac Jadeite’s, and the time to maintain this form was not as long as that of Little Qilin.","They had to hurry up and take advantage of this opportunity to defeat each other in one fell swoop!","Huang Yueli and Li Moying understood each other and at the same time, they unleashed the most powerful profound skills they had.","The two of them have cooperated countless times. When they made a move, they just made up for each other’s shortcomings, and they were able to display a strength far exceeding the sum of their profound strength!","Although she had an obvious advantage, Huang Yueli was still very cautious.","After all, there were two strong exponents in the Dao Profound Realm on the opposing side. She knew that if she was not careful, she would die. Therefore, when she made a move, she was also on guard with all her heart, focusing on defense, and was ready to resist at any time. The opponent’s counterattack.","However, just when the attacks of the two were about to land on the two elders, Huang Yueli’s eyes widened unexpectedly.","Because, she found... Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao seemed to be frozen, and they didn’t even resist!","This time, she didn’t use the sound of the zither to interfere with their consciousness. How could these two majestic Dao Profound Realm powerhouses be in a daze during the battle?","Could it be... that this was a trap?","Huang Yueli immediately felt bad, but at this moment, both Li Moying and her had already unleashed their skills and it was too late to make any changes.","She had no choice but to bite the bullet and rushed up after Li Moying!","“Boom—! Boom—!”","Several loud bangs came!","The profound energy of Huang Yueli and Li Moying bombarded Huang Fuzhao and Huang Shuangyu heavily!","What’s more, this time it was a real bombardment on the vital position of their chests, and the two of them immediately flew out and fell for thousands of meters, before they smashed heavily on a big tree. The giant tree more than ten metres thick was broken.","After Huang Yueli succeeded in one blow, she had already prepared countless back moves, but at this time, she was completely unable to continue to attack!","Because the two elders were blown away so easily, this... This was completely beyond her expectations!","With the strength of Huang Shuangyu and the others, even with the help of Little Qilin and Little Phoenix at the same time, they can completely resist for a period of time!","If they were lucky, they might even persist until the energy of the two divine beasts is exhausted!","But in fact? However, Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao seemed to have been shocked by something, they suddenly became stupid and became vulnerable, they didn’t even have any preparations for defense, they were just... blown away?","Li Moying also stopped, and looked towards the position where the two elders landed with a look of surprise.","The two of them fell extremely hard, paralyzed on the ground motionless, and didn’t know whether they were dead or alive.","Li Moying also felt that something was wrong, and turned to look at Huang Yueli, “Just now, you controlled their spirits?”","Huang Yueli shook her head vigorously, “How is that possible? My cultivation level is not enough, if I want to control them, I can only take advantage of them while they’re not paying attention and it will consume a lot of my own mental power! If I have the ability to control both of them at the same time... Well, we’ve already won...”"]},{"number":3535,"title":"Chapter 3535 The Shocking Truth (2)","paragraphs":["3535 The Shocking Truth (2)","Li Moying thought about it, and it was indeed the truth.","He was even more puzzled, “But just now...the two of them didn’t resist at all...were they intentionally seeking their own deaths?”","Having reached such a point, Li Moying did not believe that the two elders could still cheat.","After all, just now he and Huang Yueli fought with all their strength, and there were two ancient divine beasts who used secret techniques to help them. Without defense, even a strong Dao Profound Realm would have a narrow escape!","Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao had absolutely no reason to do this?","Huang Yueli frowned and thought, “That’s right, this really doesn’t make sense... Is there anyone who seeks death in such a manner? It’s not like they will definitely lose...” Suddenly, she seemed to have thought of something, her eyes lit up “By the way, Wang Cai suddenly appeared just now. When they saw Wang Cai, they were suddenly stunned! Could it be...”","She turned her head and glanced at Li Moying.","Li Moying immediately understood what she meant. He narrowed his eyes slightly, “I’ll go and have a look first.”","With that said, he turned around and strode towards the two elders who had collapsed under the big tree.","Huang Yueli hurriedly followed, “Let’s go together! Be careful, there might be danger!”","Li Moying didn’t stop her from coming together, but walked in front of her very carefully, protecting her with her body.","Huang Yueli obediently followed behind him. Although she felt that she didn’t need to be protected, seeing Li Moying always so nervous about her still made her feel sweet.","Soon, the two walked under the big tree.","As expected, Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao were stunned by the huge impact just now.","However, the bodies of those in the Dao Profound Realm were very strong, and by now, they had gradually came to their senses.","When Huang Yueli and the others walked over, Huang Fuzhao had already slowly opened his eyes, but he still had a painful and confused look on his face, trying to get up from the ground.","Li Moying and Huang Yueli stopped 30 meters away from them, looking down at them.","Huang Fuzhao was seriously injured. After struggling for a while, he still couldn’t get up.","He tried his best to turn his head and glanced at Huang Yueli and Li Moying, but immediately after, his eyes widened and he fixed his eyes on the big Phoenix behind Huang Yueli who hadn’t recovered in time!","Wang Cai flapped his wings and followed behind Huang Yueli. His beautiful feathers were like the most gorgeous sunshine, making people unable to take their eyes off.","Huang Fuzhao was really dumbfounded, the expression on his face was so shocked to the point of horror.","“This...this is...Phoen...Phoenix...cough cough...cough cough...”","Huang Fuzhao’s voice was incomparably hoarse and he coughed repeatedly before finishing a sentence, appearing to be in extreme pain.","Obviously, his lungs were seriously damaged.","However, he still persisted in pointing at Little Wang Cai, squeezing out some gasps from his throat.","Huang Yueli folded her arms around her chest and said calmly, “Of course I know it’s a Phoenix. Anyone with eyes knows it! Is it worth making such a fuss about?”","“You you...”","Only then did Huang Fuzhao turn his attention to Huang Yueli, “This... Phoenix... it’s you... it’s you... cough...”","“What do you mean? This Phoenix is indeed mine. I contracted it. I summoned it. Why? What’s your opinion?” Huang Yueli said slowly."]},{"number":3536,"title":"Chapter 3536 The Shocking Truth (3)","paragraphs":["3536 The Shocking Truth (3)","Huang Fuzhao gasped when he heard that!","This breath made his chest injury worse. He coughed desperately for a long time, but he couldn’t even say a word.","However, before he could adjust his breathing opening, another scream came from behind him.","“You summoned it? How is it possible? This... this is impossible??”","At some point, Huang Shuangyu also woke up, and heard Huang Yueli’s answer to Huang Fuzhao, and immediately exclaimed.","The location of her injury was not in the lungs, so although she was weak, she could still speak clearly.","Huang Yueli turned her head to look at her, “Why is it impossible? The fact is that, you all saw me summoning the Phoenix Divine Beast with your own eyes, didn’t you? Otherwise, you wouldn’t be lying here, would you?”","Hearing this, Huang Shuangyu froze, and at the same time remembered the scene that happened just before they were injured!","She never dreamed that the little young man next to Li Moying would summon a Phoenix!","Moreover, it still looks like a young Phoenix!","The Cloudy Qilin Clan has not tamed a young Phoenix for tens of thousands of years, so why not the Sacred Phoenix Clan?","Seeing how powerful the impact of Phoenix was on her, Huang Shuangyu couldn’t believe her eyes as she remained frozen in place.","And when such powerful exponents were fighting against each other, even just being in a daze for a few moments was deadly enough.","In the end, the two of them were lying here and fell at the feet of the two juniors.","But, how was that possible? She still feels that what she sees cannot be true!","However, behind Huang Yueli, the Phoenix was still alive and vivid, so real, even the powerful fire profound energy radiating from its body was so real that it couldn’t be more real, and it even made her feel an unbearable powerful pressure!","“Impossible... this... only the blood of our Sacred Phoenix Clan can make the Phoenix submit. Even if ordinary human races contract with the Phoenix by chance, it is impossible for the Phoenix to recognize the master, let alone get the Phoenix to fight for them! Moreover, if you want Phoenix to surrender, you must at least have a top-notch talent at the heaven level, even if you are a genius at the god level, not everyone can contract a Phoenix...you are a human race...how is it possible??”","Huang Yueli’s eyes fell on Huang Shuangyu’s body deeply, and she said calmly, “Elder, you are right, so what? Who told you that I belong to the human race?”","Originally, Huang Yueli used Sky Phoenix Ring’s power to hide her race and real cultivation.","At this moment, she no longer concealed it. As soon as she finished speaking, her aura suddenly changed, as if she had changed completely!","The two elders were originally trying to figure out what Huang Yueli’s words meant.","At this moment, sensing the aura emanating from Huang Yueli’s body, both of them were shocked!","“You...you are also from the Sacred Phoenix Clan!!”","“How did this happen? The Sacred Phoenix Clan actually produced a genius who can contract the Phoenix, but has been living outside?? At your age, you can have such a cultivation base, at least it is also a top-level talent... Wait..what is your real bone age??”","As Huang Yueli removed the disguise from her body, her real bone age was also exposed.","And although the disguise on her face was still there, without the assistance of Sky Phoenix Ring, she couldn’t hide it from the powerful Dao Profound Realm."]},{"number":3537,"title":"Chapter 3537 The Shocking Truth (4)","paragraphs":["3537 The Shocking Truth (4)","Therefore, in the eyes of Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao, Huang Yueli no longer had any pretense.","Her real appearance could be seen at a glance!","The two elders originally thought that seeing Huang Yueli’s true face would solve their doubts, but the facts completely shattered their illusions, because Huang Yueli’s real appearance and cultivation level surpassed their imagination!","“Your bone age...isn’t even twenty years old! Late stage of the Dream Profound Realm! Are...are you kidding me?”","“I’ve lived for thousands of years. I haven’t seen any kind of genius, and I’ve never seen such an outrageous thing!”","“That’s right, even Li Moying from the Cloudy Qilin Clan, who claims to be a god-level genius,... may not be able to do this, right?”","Hearing his name mentioned by the two elders, Li Moying crossed his arms and raised his eyebrows slightly.","He coldly interjected from the side: “I have seen stupid people, but I have never seen one as stupid as you! You really don’t know who Little Li’er is? Your Sacred Phoenix Clan also has a god-level genius, or have you already forgotten?”","Hearing Li Moying’s words, the expressions of the two elders changed, their eyes were filled with hatred, and they glared at Li Moying viciously!","The shock just now has been replaced by hatred! They haven’t forgotten why they came here today!","“Li Moying, you despicable villain, you still have the face to say that! Didn’t the god-level genius of our Sacred Phoenix Clan die at your hands?”","“A ruthless, narrow-minded scum like you, no matter how talented you are, you will never reach the pinnacle of cultivation! Sooner or later, you will die without a place for burial!”","The both of them cursed at him while gnashing their teeth.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying looked at each other, they never expected to hear such words.","These two elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan actually thought that Huang Yueli was dead, moreover, she was still killed by Li Moying! No wonder they used all means to kill Li Moying as soon as they met each other today!","Hearing the two scolding more and more, it became more and more unpleasant. Li Moying hadn’t reacted yet, but Huang Yueli couldn’t listen anymore.","She walked in front of the two of them, and said in a cold voice, “Shut up!”","Her voice was cold, although the volume was not high, but it had the power of a superior person.","The two elders were usually high-ranking figures in the family, but for some reason, when they heard Huang Yueli’s voice, they felt a chill behind them and subconsciously closed their mouths.","When they realized what they had done, they were shocked!","What was going on? Their aura...why was it suppressed by a little girl under the age of twenty?","Huang Yueli glanced at the two of them, and said coldly: “When did Moying kill a god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan? What proof do you have that you just spewed nonsense like this? These words... are they from Huang Sanbai?” Did it come from that damned old man’s mouth?”","Huang Shuangyu was startled, she didn’t expect her to guess so accurately.","However, she immediately retorted: “Yes, that’s what my Third Brother Elder Sanbai said! You know who he is, and he will never tell lies! He is a god-level genius who saw Li Moying attack us with his own eyes. ! The evidence is as strong as a mountain!”","“Irrefutable evidence?” Huang Yueli sneered, “I think you are all blind? I am the god-level genius you are looking for! I am still standing here, are you going to continue cursing me and say that I’m dead?”"]},{"number":3538,"title":"Chapter 3538 The Shocking Truth (5)","paragraphs":["3538 The Shocking Truth (5)","Huang Shuangyu froze in place and for a moment, she was unable to speak at all.","It was only after a while later when she spoke, her pale lips trembled slightly, “What... what? What did you say?”","Huang Yueli looked at them directly, and said seriously: “I really don’t know what Huang Sanbai told you, but, isn’t the truth already in front of your eyes? If I wasn’t a god-level genius, how could I summon the Phoenix? How could it be possible to have such a cultivation base?”","Huang Fuzhao was also dumbfounded, unable to come to his senses no matter what.","Huang Shuangyu said again: “It’s true to say so, but Elder Sanbai clearly said...that you have... how could you still be alive? And you’re still with Li Moying of the Cloudy Qilin Clan?”","Speaking of this, her eyes suddenly widened, and he shouted: “Yes, I know! Did you get arrested by the Cloudy Qilin Clan after you were injured by Li Moying? Did they threaten you? What restrictions have been placed on you? Are they forcing you to work for the Cloudy Qilin Clan? These despicable villains of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","Huang Sanbai’s hard work of establishing a reputation that his whole life was devoted solely for the clan was deeply ingrained in the hearts of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","So, even if Huang Fuzhao and the others saw Huang Yueli standing in front of them alive, they still couldn’t absorb such news.","So, he thought wrongly himself, and made up a big scene of Huang Yueli being coerced by others.","Huang Yueli didn’t know whether to laugh or cry, coughed heavily, and said, “Elder, you’re probably wrong! The one who injured me near the Nether Sea was not Li Moying, but Huang Sanbai!”","Huang Fuzhao was stunned, “What? You said... who is it?”","“You heard me right. The person who injured me was indeed Huang Sanbai! If it wasn’t because I tamed this Little Phoenix and caught him by surprise, I’m afraid I would be dead now.”","Huang Fuzhao’s eyes widened incredulously and he left his mouth wide open in a daze.","But Huang Shuangyu couldn’t help screaming, “No...impossible! This is absolutely impossible! You must have been brainwashed by the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! My Third Brother is the most senior elder of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. Since then, he has been diligently contributing to the clan, and is highly respected! How could he attack and hurt the family’s god-level genius? You are definitely lying!”","Hearing Huang Shuangyu’s accusation, Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows slightly, “It turns out that you are Huang Sanbai’s sister... I really feel pity for you, because you were used as a gun by your own brother, and you still foolishly believe that he’s a good guy!”","Huang Shuangyu didn’t believe her words at all, “Don’t accuse him! The whole Sacred Phoenix Clan can see how my Third Brother is! You...you are the god-level genius of the family? You can’t slander him like this! What kind of benefits did the Cloudy Qilin Clan give you that you have to do it!”","“I slandered him?” Huang Yueli’s lips curled up as she revealed a mocking smile, “I want to ask you, I just ascended from the Lower Realm, and I have no grievances with Huang Sanbai, why should I slander him? Besides, As a god-level genius, what capital do you think the Cloudy Qilin Clan has to buy me? As long as I return to the family, I can enjoy all the resources of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, but I dare not even return to the Sacred Phoenix Continent! Why!”","“This.. this...”","Pressed by Huang Yueli every step of the way, Huang Shuangyu was stunned for a moment, completely unable to think of how to refute."]},{"number":3539,"title":"Chapter 3539 The Shocking Truth (6)","paragraphs":["3539 The Shocking Truth (6)","Because what Huang Yueli said made so much sense!","A person who has ascended from the Lower Realm has no interest in anyone in the family, so how could she have nothing to do to slander Huang Sanbai?","Besides, Huang Yueli, as a god-level genius, has never returned to the family. This will have a great impact on her cultivation and progress. Normal people would not do such a thing, right? Unless...someone is really preventing her from returning to the family!","But, how could this person be Huang Sanbai?","This was absolutely impossible!","“Why...why...Sanbai...elder...cough!”","Huang Fuzhao also came to his senses at this time, and he was full of doubts. However, his injury prevented him from speaking completely, so he could only speak intermittently.","When Huang Shuangyu heard what he wanted to say, she understood what he wanted to say, and immediately asked: “Even if what you said is reasonable, then my Third Brother has no grievances or enmity with you? Why did he want to hurt you? Why should he stop you from going back to the clan? This doesn’t make sense at all! I think... the Cloudy Qilin Clan is still playing tricks!”","Huang Yueli smiled coldly, and said: “The reason why Huang Sanbai wanted to kill me is very simple. He wanted to get... this from me!”","As Huang Yueli’s voice fell, a golden light suddenly shot out from between her eyebrows!","This golden light formed a clear Phoenix imprint in midair!","The two elders stared at the imprint of the golden Phoenix, their faces were flushed, and their eyes almost popped out of their posture.","“This... this... can’t be... impossible, right?”","“No... No... How could the Sky Phoenix Ring appear on such a little girl! This must be... I lost too much blood and had hallucinations!”","The two elders muttered to themselves involuntarily and shook their heads desperately, completely unable to accept such a fact.","As the core members of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, they, like Huang Sanbai, have known the legend about the Sky Phoenix Ring since they were young. The Sky Phoenix Ring, which could be called the number one artifact in the clan, will appear once it recognizes the Master, just like what they saw with their own eyes now!","Huang Yueli’s golden marks on the center of her eyebrows are no different from those recorded in the clan’s top-secret classics!","But how could such a thing happen?","Even if this little girl was a god-level genius, even if she has the ability to tame the Phoenix beast, but... to say that she can repair the broken Sky Phoenix Ring and make it recognize her as Master... that was still a bit outrageous!","Several Supreme Elders of the Life Profound Realm in the family have been tracking the whereabouts of Sky Phoenix Ring, but for tens of thousands of years, there had been no progress...","It’s true that Huang Yueli’s talent was far superior to that of cultivators of the same generation, but if it is said that she can do things that no one at the Life Profound Realm can do...","Both Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao found it unacceptable!","Hearing the doubts from the two, Huang Yueli’s expression did not change much.","She said lightly: “The evidence is already in front of you, and you still don’t believe it. Well then, one can only say that you are stupid! As dignified elders of the Ancient God Clan, you don’t even have the least sense of judgment! The fact is that Huang Sanbai found out that I have the Sky Phoenix Ring on me and in order to get the clan’s artifact and at the same time gain the position of Patriarch, he plotted against me and tried to kill me!”","What Huang Yueli said shocked the two elders."]},{"number":3540,"title":"Chapter 3540 The Shocking Truth (7)","paragraphs":["3540 The Shocking Truth (7)","Huang Yueli continued: “It’s a good thing I’ve noticed Huang Sanbai’s evil intentions a long time ago, so I’ve been prepared, otherwise, I’d be dead by now!”","“This... this...”","Huang Shuangyu was tongue-tied, she repeated “this” for a long time, but couldn’t complete her sentence.","From the bottom of her heart, she didn’t want to believe that the Third Brother she had always trusted the most was actually a madman who murdered the genius of the clan for personal gain!","However, Huang Yueli’s words were well-founded, and no one could find any flaws.","The significance of Sky Phoenix Ring to the Sacred Phoenix Clan was indeed above everything else. If Huang Sanbai could really get the Sky Phoenix Ring and let it recognize him as its Master, even if his assassination of Huang Yueli was exposed, no one would fault him. His sin, on the contrary, would enshrine him as the future Patriarch!","This kind of temptation was enough to make people make fatal mistakes.","However, Huang Shuangyu never expected that even her Third Brother would be unable to resist the temptation of power!","“This... this girl, even if you are right, but after you escaped from death, why didn’t you return to the Sacred Phoenix Clan, but instead got mixed up with the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan? So many people came looking for you, why didn’t you show up?”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli raised the corners of her mouth mockingly, “Elder, you are not trying to make fun of me, are you? Who doesn’t know that the person in charge of searching for my whereabouts is Huang Sanbai! Once I show up, I will definitely be brought in front of him immediately. As you can see, my strength is limited, and I can’t compare with those in the Dao Profound Realm, and I don’t know how many members of the Sacred Phoenix Clan have already defected to Huang Sanbai. Once I fall into his hands, how can I save my life?”","Huang Shuangyu was once again blocked by her and was rendered speechless once again!","However, after Huang Yueli’s repeated explanations, the doubts in the hearts of the two elders had been clarified.","The two of them looked at each other, seeing shock and confusion in each other’s eyes!","Huang Sanbai would actually do such a thing!","If it wasn’t the god-level genius who was speaking now, and if Huang Yueli hadn’t shown so many unforgeable evidence, then even if they were killed, they wouldn’t believe that Huang Sanbai would betray the family!","He is the most loyal and willing senior elder in the family!","“Could it be that... the Third Brother really did such an outrageous thing?”","Huang Shuangyu turned her gaze to Huang Yueli again, “Young Miss, I am Huang Shuangyu, the elder of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, what’s your name?”","“Huang Yueli.”","Huang Shuangyu nodded, “Young Miss Yueli, what you said really convinced me. However, if you want to persecute Huang Sanbai’s betrayal of the clan, you have to go back to the clan with us. When we convene the Elders’ Council, you’ll have to confront Huang Sanbai!”","Huang Yueli frowned.","She naturally knew that there was nothing wrong with what Huang Shuangyu said, and it was impossible to convict Huang Sanbai just because Huang Shuangyu went back and passed a few words!","She herself must go back to the clan to testify against Huang Sanbai, which was what she had intended.","However, if she really wanted her to go back to the clan with the two elders now, she still had her hesitations.","On one hand, she didn’t want to be separated from Li Moying so soon. On the other hand, her subconscious mind told her that it might not be a wise choice to return to the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","The Sacred Phoenix Clan was a big clan that has been passed down for millions of years, and the relationship among the clansmen was intricate."]},{"number":3541,"title":"Chapter 3541 The Shocking Truth (8)","paragraphs":["3541 The Shocking Truth (8)","Only Heaven would know how much power and allies Huang Sanbai has in the clan?","Moreover, even for Huang Shuangyu who was in front of her now, Huang Yueli doesn’t trust her very much.","Moreover, she was also Huang Sanbai’s older sister. If she foolishly followed her away, if she colluded with Huang Sanbai to set her up, she might not be able to escape even if she had wings!","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli turned her head to look at Li Moying.","Just in time, Li Moying also looked towards her.","The two had the same mind, so after exchanging a glance, Huang Yueli understood what he meant immediately and nodded slightly.","She turned to Huang Shuangyu and said, “I’m sorry, Elder Shuangyu, I’m afraid I can’t go back with you!”","“Why...why?” Huang Shuangyu was stunned, then glanced at Li Moying who was beside Huang Yueli, and seemed to understand something, “You...what is the relationship between you and the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan? ”","Huang Yueli didn’t shy away from it, and said openly: “Li Moying and I were married when we were in the Lower Realm. After arriving in the God Realm, I barely escaped Huang Sanbai’s attempted assassination and had to travel stealthily. My husband has been trying to find me, and we met again only a few months ago.”","“What? You...you and Li Moying got married in the Lower Realm!!”","Huang Shuangyu’s eyes darkened, and she almost fainted on the spot!","The stimulation she received today was more than what she had received in hundreds of years!","First, they discovered that Li Moying’s strength was way beyond what they had ever imagined and then they discovered that the target of their attack was actually their clan’s god-level genius whom they thought had died and later, they even learned of Huang Sanbai’s true face.","In the end, thinking that all the blows were over, Huang Yueli actually threw out another piece of shocking news!","The god-level genius of their Sacred Phoenix Clan actually...married to a brat from the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","Was there a mistake? There has been no intermarriage between the Sacred Phoenix Clan and the Cloudy Qilin Clan for tens of thousands of years!","Once anyone in the clan is found to be in contact with members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, their cultivation will be abolished and they will be locked up in a dungeon.","However, Huang Yueli was the only god-level genius in the family, a rare treasure of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, who dares to do anything to her?","Huang Yueli shrugged as she saw the two elders being hit hard.","“I have also heard about the grievances between the Sacred Phoenix Clan and the Cloudy Qilin Clan. I don’t want to say anything about turning an enemy into a friend. After all, I am not the Patriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan! However, if you want to separate me from Moying, it is absolutely impossible!”","Huang Yueli paused, and then said: “The situation of the Sacred Phoenix Clan is complicated, I can’t just go back with you like this. If you believe me, tell the Patriarch what I said when you go back, and let the Patriarch come to the headquarters of Sky Gem Glass Chamber in person to look for me. Before that, I will be training outside with my husband.”","After much deliberation, this was the safest way for her.","For the sake of the clan, the Patriarch of the Sacred Phoenix Clan was the least likely person to harm her.","If Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao were trustworthy, they would truthfully tell the Patriarch about today’s conversation, and if the Patriarch personally took her back, safety would definitely not be a problem.","If Huang Shuangyu and the others didn’t bring her words, then Huang Yueli would know that they were also Huang Sanbai’s people, at least she wouldn’t fall into their trap.","Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao didn’t speak, they seemed to be thinking about it.","Just as Huang Yueli was about to say something, she suddenly felt Li Moying’s aura suddenly increase!","“Who is there! Come out!”","He turned to the northeast corner of the forest and shouted sharply."]},{"number":3542,"title":"Chapter 3542 Leave No Witnesses (1)","paragraphs":["3542 Leave No Witnesses (1)","“What? There’s someone??”","Huang Shuangyu and the others were all shocked!","They had focused all their attention on Huang Yueli. They were so shocked by the truth she had divulged and they had no energy left to pay attention to the surrounding situation, so they didn’t notice any abnormalities at all.","Unexpectedly, Li Moying was so careful, observing the surrounding situation all the time.","!!","Huang Yueli frowned, turned around and looked to the northeast.","As Li Moying’s words fell, an old and resonant voice sounded from behind the bushes: “Hahaha, as expected of a god-level genius of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, this insight is indeed extraordinary! It’s a pity, it’s too late for you to find someone... Already!”","This voice is too familiar to Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao!","Huang Shuangyu’s head buzzed, she was extremely shocked!","“Third Brother! Third Brother, are you here? Why did you come here at this time? I obviously... didn’t send you a message!”","“Cough... I... I...”","Huang Fuzhao’s face was pale, and he coughed all of a sudden, even out of breath.","Huang Yueli understood from the sidelines, and her eyes turned cold, “It seems that this elder secretly sent a message to Huang Sanbai for fear that he would die in our hands!”","When Huang Fuzhao heard her say it so directly, a look of guilt appeared on his face.","To be honest, he didn’t intend to harm Huang Yueli either.","At that time, Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s strength far exceeded their imagination, and they even summoned two ancient divine beasts to help out!","Seeing that the two Dao Profound Realm powerhouses were about to fall here, Huang Fuzhao was anxious, and secretly used the most secret communication method in the family to ask Huang Sanbai for help! For this reason, the profound energy he consumed was astonishing.","Huang Yueli understood that it was meaningless to blame Huang Fuzhao at this time.","So, without saying much, she looked in Huang Sanbai’s direction again, “Elder Sanbai, since you’re already here, please come out and meet!”","The visitor sneered twice, and strode out from behind the trees.","It really was Huang Sanbai, the elder of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","When Huang Shuangyu saw him, she immediately shouted eagerly, “Third...Third Brother! You came just in time! Do you recognize this person?”","Although she was weak, she stared closely at Huang Sanbai’s face, she didn’t want to miss any change in his expression.","Huang Sanbai noticed his sister’s gaze, but there was no expression of guilt on his face, and he was still very calm.","He opened the mouth and said: “What’s there that I don’t know? This Huang Yueli girl... that is the only god-level genius in our Sacred Phoenix Clan for tens of thousands of years! Tsk tsk, I haven’t seen you for a few months, Young Miss Yueli’s cultivation has taken another step forward, you really deserve to be the first-class peerless genius in the God Realm!”","As soon as Huang Sanbai opened his mouth, Huang Shuangyu and the others were taken aback!","No one expected that Huang Sanbai not only recognized Huang Yueli at a glance, but also looked so calm!","What exactly is going on?","A “dead person” suddenly came back to life, how did he react like this?","Huang Shuangyu was stunned for a long time before saying: “Third Brother, you...why aren’t you surprised at all? You were the one who told us earlier that Huang Yueli had died at the hands of the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! But now... how do you explain it?”"]},{"number":3543,"title":"Chapter 3543 Leave No Witnesses (2)","paragraphs":["3543 Leave No Witnesses (2)","“Explain?” Huang Sanbai sneered, and glanced at Huang Shuangyu disdainfully, “What kind of an explanation would you like to hear?”","“This...” Huang Shuangyu had an ominous premonition, but she still didn’t want to believe that her trusted brother was actually a traitor who betrayed the clan!","“Just now, Young Miss Yueli said you... said it was you...”","Huang Shuangyu stammered, and felt unable to speak, but Huang Sanbai sneered again, and took the initiative to take over the conversation.","“What did Huang Yueli say? She said that the person who attacked her was not the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, but me, didn’t she? She also said that I attacked her because of the Sky Phoenix Ring on her body! I did it! The reason is that I covet the position of Patriarch, isn’t it?”","“This... this... Third Brother, did you really do this?” Huang Shuangyu’s face was pale, and she looked like she might faint at any time.","Huang Sanbai smiled, “I heard everything you said here just now!”","Huang Shuangyu breathed out immediately when she heard the words, “It turns out that you heard what we said, and I thought you really did something unreasonable these days! I think there must be a relationship between you and Young Miss Yueli. There is a misunderstanding, it is better to take this opportunity to clarify...”","Huang Shuangyu hurriedly spoke, wanting to mediate.","However, Huang Sanbai just looked at her with a look of implied pity, did not answer her question, but shook his head slowly, and said: “Second Sister, what Huang Yueli said...is true!”","Huang Shuangyu originally thought that her younger brother had been cleared of suspicion, but when she heard this, she froze on the spot again.","“What... what? What did you say?”","Huang Sanbai met the shocked gazes of Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao, and said calmly: “What are you still asking? Didn’t Huang Yueli make it very clear just now? Although what she said was a little brief, but they are all facts. I really wanted to get the Sky Phoenix Ring on her body, but unfortunately, I let her run away at that time!”","Huang Shuangyu couldn’t believe that such a thing would happen!","Just now Huang Yueli put forward all kinds of evidence, which can be said to be solid evidence, but Huang Shuangyu has always been skeptical in her heart.","No matter what evidence others present, in her heart, she still prefers her younger brother.","But now, Huang Sanbai has indeed admitted that Huang Yueli’s accusations were all true!","Nothing shocked her more than this!","Huang Shuangyu’s eyes widened, and she shook her head in disbelief, “No...it’s impossible! You...why did you do such a thing?? We grew up in the clan and enjoyed the various resources provided by the clan. You have cultivated to the present level! Relying on the power and status of your clan, you are respected in the entire God Realm. You are also a highly respected elder in the clan, and you are in control, so what are you dissatisfied with?”","A cold light flashed in Huang Sanbai’s eyes, and he let out a piercing laugh.","“Hahahaha, Second Sister, what you said is so funny! You’re actually asking me what I am dissatisfied with?? There are many things I am dissatisfied with! Back then, Huang Tianhao and I were both the top geniuses in the clan. His speed is not as fast as mine, but the former Patriarch insisted on choosing him as his successor!”","“It’s fine for him to be the Young Patriarch, but he married the daughter of the previous Patriarch!”"]},{"number":3544,"title":"Chapter 3544 Leave No Witnesses (3)","paragraphs":["3544 Leave No Witnesses (3)","“Back then, the person Yunniang liked was obviously me, but because he was the future Patriarch, Yunniang didn’t want to go out for the clan’s power, so she could only obey her father’s order and marry Huang Tianhao!”","“And what did Huang Tianhao do to her? Marrying a peerless beauty like Yunniang is still not enough. He even married the second wife less than a year after the death of the former Patriarch, making Yunniang die of depression at such a young age!”","“If I were the Patriarch, Yunniang would not have such a fate! Besides, how is that old fellow Huang Tianhao better than me? After becoming the Patriarch, our Sacred Phoenix Clan has not been able to compare with Cloudy Qilin Clan all these years.” It is a disgrace to the Sacred Phoenix Clan! Only if I become the Patriarch, can the future of the clan be hopeful!”","The more Huang Sanbai talked, the more excited and angry he became, and his face gradually flushed red.","The more Huang Shuangyu heard it, the more shocked she became, “You...you actually have so many misunderstandings about the Patriarch! Third Brother, things are different from what you think...Actually...”","“Shut up!”","Huang Sanbai didn’t want to listen to his sister’s explanation at all, so he interrupted her with a bellow and at the same time, a strange smile appeared on the corner of his mouth.","“I don’t want to hear your excuses for that scum, no matter what, the position of Patriarch... only I am qualified to sit!”","Huang Sanbai’s smile was too creepy, and Huang Shuangyu couldn’t help but break out in cold sweat, “You... Third Brother, what do you want to do?”","Huang Sanbai smiled coldly, “I have waited hundreds of years to get this opportunity. As long as I can kill Huang Yueli and get the Sky Phoenix Ring on her body, I will be able to sit on the Patriarch’s position! Do you think that I will give up halfway like last time?”","Huang Shuangyu immediately realized that Huang Sanbai was going to attack Huang Yueli again, and immediately struggled on the ground, trying to get up and stop him.","Unfortunately, she was so injured that she couldn’t move at all.","She could only shout loudly: “Huang Sanbai, you...you stop! If you dare to attack Young Miss Yueli again, I will definitely not tolerate you! If this matter is reported to the clan, it will be a big deal! All members of our clan will be buried along with you!”","Huang Sanbai has done such a rebellious thing, it is no longer something he can solve by dying alone.","It is very likely that it will also affect the branch where the Huang Sanbai’s sisters belong. In the future, not only will the children of the branch be unable to become the elders of the clan, but even the cultivation resources of the young children will be deducted.","Huang Sanbai laughed even colder, “This matter really cannot be spread, so, for the consideration of other clansmen in our branch, we can only let the second sister sacrifice a bit!”","Huang Shuangyu’s heart was suddenly filled with panic, and a cold chill instantly penetrated into the bone marrow.","“What... what do you mean?”","Huang Sanbai took a few steps back, and suddenly shouted sharply: “Do it now!”","As soon as he finished speaking, five figures suddenly appeared from behind.","These five people were all dressed in black, and even their faces were wrapped behind black masks.","Only the silver emblems on their right shoulders were clearly visible.","“It’s... a member of the Dark Lord! You really...”","Huang Shuangyu never dreamed that Huang Sanbai actually went to find the killers of Dark Lord, and the real purpose of these killers was to kill her!","She also didn’t have the chance to finish her sentence.","As soon as the five killers appeared, they immediately attacked the position where Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao were lying."]},{"number":3545,"title":"Chapter 3545 Leave No Witnesses (4)","paragraphs":["3545 Leave No Witnesses (4)","These five people were all masters of the Dao Profound Realm, and their strength was on par with Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao.","Now that Huang Shuangyu and Huang Fuzhao were seriously injured, they have difficulty even moving, so naturally they can’t even take a single move!","After the first attack, the two elders lost their breath!","Huang Shuangyu’s eyes widened unwillingly, and she couldn’t close her eyes even after she died.","And at the same moment, at the same time that Huang Sanbai said “do it”, Huang Yueli and Li Moying immediately jumped up and ran towards the west at the same time!","The moment Huang Sanbai showed up, the two of them had already sensed that something was amiss.","Huang Sanbai did not come alone. Near this dense forest, there were several powerful auras hidden in the darkness.","Although Huang Yueli and Li Moying were aware of this, the opponent’s strength was very strong. It only took a little time for them to confirm that they were unable to confront the opponent head-on. It was even more impossible for them to escape under the noses of so many experts.","In addition, Little Phoenix and Little Qilin had used their secret skills and they had already fallen into a coma, unable to provide them with any help.","Therefore, they had no choice but to quietly wait for a good opportunity to escape.","Unexpectedly, this time had arrived so soon!","They didn’t expect that Huang Sanbai would be so cruel and merciless that he wouldn’t even let his own sister go, and would kill her to silence her!","At this time, Huang Yueli could not protect herself, and she was powerless to save others.","However, this provided her and Li Moying with an excellent opportunity to escape.","Seeing that the attention of the five black robed men was focused on the two elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, the two turned around in tacit understanding... and ran away!","After Huang Sanbai silenced the two witnesses, he immediately wanted to deal with Huang Yueli and Li Moying.","But who knew, when he turned around, he saw the backs of the two of them escaping!","Both of them were god-level geniuses, both had god-level body skills and secret skills, and their speed was astonishingly fast. They had already run a certain distance by this time.","Huang Sanbai was furious, and stared fiercely at the five black robed men.","“What are you all doing in a daze? Why did you let the two of them go! What’s the use of me looking for you?”","The leading man in black said displeased: “You didn’t say it in advance. According to the rules of our Dark Lord, we will not do superfluous things other than those ordered by the employer!”","Huang Sanbai was almost pissed off by them!","However, at least he still remembered that this was the killer he hired from Dark Lord, not his disciples who could be used at his beck and call by him.","He managed to suppress the anger in his heart, “I was negligent. Masters, the main purpose of me coming today is the two young people just now! Everyone, catch up quickly and kill that man! As for the girl, just catch her and leave her to me. If you can capture that little girl alive, I will give an extra 100,000 low-grade chalcedony!”","Hearing this, the eyes of the five black robed men lit up, they turned around and quickly chased after them.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were running side by side. Although Huang Yueli’s cultivation was not as good as him, she had a higher attainment in body skills, and her speed was not slower than Li Moying’s.","After the two of them ran for a distance, they heard footsteps behind them.","“They’ve already caught up!” Li Moying’s expression turned grim."]},{"number":3546,"title":"Chapter 3546 Evil Qi Enters The Body (1)","paragraphs":["3546 Evil Qi Enters The Body (1)","Huang Yueli also noticed this, and cursed in her heart, “It’s a pity that the array around here is no longer effective, otherwise, I have countless ways to make them die without a place for burial!”","Li Moying narrowed his eyes and looked forward, “But it’s alright, we’ll be there soon!”","The two sped up and flew towards the west.","Their destination was the entrance to the secret realm of Saint Iniquitous Shadow!","This place was fraught with danger, coupled with the fact that they were not familiar with the terrain and the strength of those hired from the Dark Lord was so astonishing, if they ran around aimlessly, they would probably be killed by them before they reached Forest Shade Town in time.","Besides, they were isolated and helpless here, even if they reached Forest Shade Town, they were not capable of fighting six Dao Profound Realm experts head-on.","Therefore, for them, the safest way was to immediately enter the secret realm of Saint Iniquitous Shadow!","People who don’t know how to open the secret realm, no matter how powerful they were, they wouldn’t be able to even step into it!","If one tried to forcefully open the secret realm, they may be backlashed by evil qi!","Moreover, the secret realm was a world of its own, completely self-sufficient. They could cultivate slowly in it, and they can stay for a few years. It is impossible for Huang Sanbai and those killers to have the patience to spend it here with them.","The two of them had exactly the same idea, they both ran towards the secret realm with all their strength.","And Huang Sanbai and the five black robed men followed closely behind them.","After chasing for a certain distance, the black robed men’s footsteps slowed down by coincidence, and doubts flashed in their eyes.","Huang Sanbai urged eagerly: “Why are you stopping? Chase! Hurry up and catch up with me!”","The leader frowned and said: “They ran all the way to the west! This place is the most evil place near our Forest Shade Town. Even people of Dark Lord, many of them died here, if we keep chasing, it’s too dangerous!”","Huang Sanbai didn’t expect that these killers would be so disobedient to orders, and after only a few steps of chasing them, another excuse appeared again.","He said angrily: “Then what else do you want? I hired you to kill, not to form a team with you to practice! Run away when you see danger, is this the reputation of your Dark Lord?”","The leader frowned again when he heard the words, and didn’t speak for a long time, obviously thinking that what Huang Sanbai said was reasonable.","After struggling for a while, he waved to the four subordinates behind him, “Since we have received the money, we can only take this risk. Let’s go, let’s chase!”","Only then did Huang Sanbai secretly exhale a long breath.","The leader said again: “Those two brats must have had a map in their hands all the way. They ran all the way, and they didn’t touch any arrays! Brothers, pay attention and follow their footsteps. It’s probably alright!”","Huang Sanbai fell on his back in anger again!","It turned out that these black robed men were willing to follow him because they saw that it was not too dangerous.","But no matter what, as long as they were willing to work.","If they really quit at the end of the day, even if they refunded his double deposit according to the agreement, he would feel like crying without tears.","There were not many chances of catching Huang Yueli alive. If he missed this opportunity, he was afraid that no such opportunity would ever arise again.","The black robed men dawdled for a while, and although they chased after them again, they had already wasted a lot of time"]},{"number":3547,"title":"Chapter 3547 Evil Qi Enters The Body (2)","paragraphs":["3547 Evil Qi Enters The Body (2)","In addition, they didn’t know that the surrounding arrays had been cleared. In order to strictly follow Huang Yueli’s route, they spent a lot of effort imitating their route, which also delayed time.","In this way, Huang Sanbai and the others were thrown away by quite a distance.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying had exerted all their strength, but they felt that they might not be able to get rid of them, and they were very anxious, but they suddenly found that the speed of the people behind them had slowed down.","Li Moying took the time to glance behind him, showing a look of surprise, “What’s going on? These people are running slower and slower?”","“Why do you care about them? We’re here now, do you still remember the order in which you took out the devil stones?” Seeing the entrance to the secret realm was in front of her again, Huang Yueli felt that they were one step closer to successfully escaping.","Li Moying said: “I still remember. Move out of the way first!”","Huang Yueli quickly moved aside, giving way to him as they stood at the entrance of the secret realm.","Li Moying leaned forward and stretched out his right hand. Almost in an instant, he grabbed one of the devil stones and pulled it out.","Immediately after, he proceeded step by step according to the sequence Huang Yueli told him before.","His footsteps barely landed on the ground, and his figure seemed to have turned into a phantom, circling around the entrance of the secret realm.","Huang Yueli stood on the side watching, and couldn’t help admiring his speed.","However, even though Li Moying used the fastest speed, Huang Sanbai and the others were cultivators in the Dao Profound Realm after all, and they had already caught up during the time they stopped.","When Huang Sanbai saw the movements of the two of them, his head buzzed!","“No, they must have activated some kind of array here, hurry up! Stop them!”","The five black robed men also knew that the situation was not good, and before Huang Sanbai opened his mouth, they had already made a move!","Moreover, in order to prevent the two from escaping, they all used their strongest killing moves!","The profound energy of the six Dao Profound Realm powerhouses blasted towards the array at the entrance of the secret realm. Under the impact of such a powerful attack, the surrounding space distorted!","However, they were still a step behind!","The moment the six of them shot, Li Moying had already taken away the last devil stone.","The area under his and Huang Yueli’s feet was suddenly filled with light, and a golden light shot straight into the sky!","Li Moying immediately grabbed Huang Yueli’s wrist, and pulled her into the golden light together.","“Hurry up, hurry up!” Huang Yueli said anxiously in her heart.","Last time, when the two of them came in with four guards, the teleportation process took a little time. At that time, Li Tianyi and the others hesitated for a while before entering the entrance, and they were all in time.","At that time, they thought that the slightly longer transmission time was an advantage, but now, it has become a fatal disadvantage!","No matter how anxious Huang Yueli was, no matter how long or how long the teleportation would take, it couldn’t be shortened at all.","Seeing that the attack of the six Dao Profound Realm powerhouses was about to arrive, the entrance was still a little bit too close to be closed.","Without hesitation, Huang Yueli and Li Moying used their most powerful defensive profound skills with all their strength!","On Huang Yueli’s brows, the golden phoenix imprint has emerged, using the power of Sky Phoenix Ring!","“Boom——”","There was a loud noise that tore through the heavens and the earth!","The profound energy of the two collided with the profound energy of the six Dao Profound Realm powerhouses!"]},{"number":3548,"title":"Chapter 3548 Evil Qi Enters The Body (3)","paragraphs":["3548 Evil Qi Enters The Body (3)","The result...of course... was not a surprise.","Two young talented cultivators, no matter how talented they were, they still couldn’t compete against six strong exponents above the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm.","The joint defense of Li Moying and Huang Yueli was defeated by one blow!","Not only that, even the entrance to the secret realm was severely impacted.","Li Moying and Huang Yueli spat out a mouthful of blood at the same time, and their faces became extremely pale.","The combined power of the six of them teaming up was really too great. Moreover, they could no longer summon their divine beasts to help out and were forced to face the enemy head-on. There was nothing worse than this situation!","Although the array at the entrance of the secret realm blocked most of the impact for them, preventing them from being seriously injured immediately, but it wouldn’t last for long.","To make matters worse, after the array at the entrance was attacked so violently, the teleportation process was interrupted.","Huang Yueli was even more anxious when she realized this.","She didn’t know the extent of the damage to the array, and if it was possible to repair it?","However, even if the array could be restored to its original state, they don’t have the time and opportunity to activate it again now!","Huang Sanbai saw that the blow failed to make the two of them fall immediately, so he hurriedly urged aloud: “Five masters, don’t miss this opportunity! Their array has obviously been damaged, everyone should work together to completely destroy the array and they won’t be able to escape!”","Actually, needless to say, the black robed men knew this too.","Immediately after the first strike, the few of them made moves one after another, launching wave after wave of fierce attacks towards the entrance of the secret realm.","Both Huang Yueli and Li Moying were very tenacious cultivators. Even though they were exhausted, they still tried their best to hold on.","However, human power has limits after all.","With such a huge gap in strength, the resistance of the two became weaker and weaker...","At the same time, the array at the entrance of the secret realm gradually collapsed under the continuous attacks...","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were originally standing in the beam of light, but at this moment, the beam of light has become weaker and weaker, and it may be completely extinguished at any time.","Seeing such a situation, Huang Sanbai immediately became excited.","“Come on, everyone! This array will not be able to hold on any longer! Everyone must use all your strength to fight for the next attack, and destroy the array! By the way, you can kill that brat, but, that little girl... We must leave her alive!”","“Understood!”","The leading man in black responded casually, and led his men to attack with all his might.","Huang Sanbai was worried, and used his strongest profound technique!","Six powerful forces swept towards the array once again!","The profound energy in Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s bodies had been completely exhausted at this time, and the protection that the array could provide was very little...","Huang Yueli closed her eyes, feeling extremely unwilling!","She and Li Moying had overcome countless difficulties before they were able to ascend to the God Realm, and only then did they get to where they are today!","Today... were they going to die at the hands of Huang Sanbai, a despicable and shameless villain?","But, now there was nothing they could do.","It seems that the only option was to close her eyes and wait for death...","Li Moying clasped Huang Yueli’s slender waist, and tightly protected her in his arms.","Although he knew that this was just a kind of comfort in his heart, under such a powerful energy impact, his physical body could not protect his beloved woman at all."]},{"number":3549,"title":"Chapter 3549 Evil Qi Enters The Body (4)","paragraphs":["3549 Evil Qi Enters The Body (4)","However, Li Moying was unwilling to relax even the slightest bit.","If today was really the day that they would die, at least, he will protect her until the last moment!","However, at the moment when the profound energy of the six Dao Profound Realm powerhouses collided with the array, drastic changes occurred!","The moment the teleportation light beam at the entrance of the secret realm completely disappeared, the profound energy of the six people directly hit the center of the array!","And that’s where the evil qi was accumulated in the entire dense forest!","Originally, these evil qi were all over the surrounding arrays, but since Huang Yueli and the others broke the entrance array last time and entered the secret realm of Saint Iniquitous Shadow, these evil qi have been gathering at the entrance of the secret realm and could no longer be restored to its original state.","It was also because of this that the traps around here that could instantly kill Dao Profound Realm powerhouses had suddenly disappeared.","This mist of evil qi had been hovering above the entrance of the secret realm, and even Huang Yueli couldn’t figure out what was going on.","And now, the profound energy of the six Dao Profound Realm powerhouses collided head-on with this black mist!","Huang Sanbai and the others saw that their profound energy had successfully shattered the beam of light, thinking that victory was in sight, and they all had relaxed smiles on their faces.","But the next moment, they suddenly felt that their profound energy had collided with an invisible force.","This force was not only very powerful, but also extremely tenacious. It instantly bounced back their profound energy, and the rebounded strength was even doubled!","“What?? What happened??”","The faces of the six people changed abruptly, trying to dodge.","It’s a pity that the rebounding speed of profound energy was too fast! Almost in the blink of an eye, it directly hit their chests, leaving them no chance to dodge!","No matter how much a Dao Profound Realm expert strikes with all his strength, this impact was doubled.","Even if it was their own profound technique, they couldn’t bear it.","All six people’s eyes went dark, and they fell into a coma immediately!","As for Huang Yueli and Li Moying, both of them were seriously injured at this time and fell to the ground, almost completely out of strength.","They thought that they would definitely die this time, but the situation of the battle turned around in an instant.","It was Huang Sanbai and those five killers who fell down!","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened. She couldn’t believe what she saw. Wasn’t this a little too scary? How powerful was this mist of evil qi left by Saint Iniquitous Shadow?","However, before the two of them had time to be happy, they suddenly discovered that the black mist above their heads, after colliding with Huang Sanbai’s profound energy, was not completely harmless, but began to slowly disintegrate .","The escaping evil qi extended downward and rushed towards the two of them.","Huang Yueli felt that evil qi was seeping into her body, and she couldn’t help breaking out in cold sweat, “This...what’s going on here?”","Li Moying’s handsome brows were raised, trying to prop up her limp body, and block these attacks for Huang Yueli.","However, this was in vain,","These evil qi were not real entities at all, and of course they cannot be separated.","Moreover, the evil qi not only invaded Huang Yueli’s body, but also crazily poured into Li Moying’s body!","The moment the evil qi entered his meridians, Li Moying felt his mind go blank, his body seemed to be immersed in warm water, and there was an indescribable sense of comfort that almost made him groan!"]},{"number":3550,"title":"Chapter 3550 The Final Victor (1)","paragraphs":["3550 The Final Victor (1)","However, after a brief moment, Li Moying quickly regained a trace of clarity.","He tried his best to mobilize the profound energy in his body, trying to force out the evil qi that had invaded his body.","However, no matter how hard Li Moying tried, these evil qi seemed to have taken root in his body, and he couldn’t force out even a single bit of them. Not only that, the speed at which the evil qi spread through the meridians was unimaginably fast, almost instantaneously. It filled every inch of his meridians.","Li Moying was unable to react at this time, and could only let these evil qi roam freely in his body.","He opened his eyes and looked at Huang Yueli in his arms.","Obviously, Huang Yueli’s meridians had been completely invaded by the evil qi and she lay unconscious on the ground.","However, her face was ruddy, and her breathing was very gentle. She didn’t look like she was in any danger, but more like she was asleep.","The fact was exactly that.","After Huang Yueli felt the evil qi entering her body, she began to mobilize a large amount of profound energy. Her cultivation was lower than Li Moying’s, so her resistance to these evil qi was also weaker.","However, after these evil qi invaded her dantian, they gradually merged with her own profound energy...","Li Moying looked at her expression and felt a little relieved.","Before he could breathe a sigh of relief, suddenly, there was a commotion behind him on the right.","It seems that something is approaching here...","Li Moying suddenly felt a chill behind him, and a huge sense of crisis rose from the bottom of his heart!","He almost exhausted all his strength before turning around. When he opened his eyes, he saw Huang Sanbai getting up from the ground and walking towards them step by step.","Seeing Li Moying turn around, Huang Sanbai suddenly sneered.","When the five killers attacked just now, although Huang Sanbai followed suit, he was careful and didn’t attack with all his strength, but just put on a show.","Not only that, but he deliberately stood behind the five of them.","Huang Sanbai felt that since he paid a lot of money to hire the killers of Dark Lord, then he should let them do the dirty work of risky killing, and he just needs to hide behind.","Such an idea really saved his life!","When the six people’s profound energy was doubled and bounced back by the black mist above the entrance of the secret realm, because Huang Sanbai’s shot was the lightest, and therefore, the backlash he suffered was also the lightest!","Although he was also knocked out at once, he regained consciousness not long after.","When he opened his eyes and looked around, he almost didn’t laugh out loud on the spot!","In the entire area, he was the only one who could barely move!","Li Moying and Huang Yueli fell on the destroyed teleportation array, motionless. Although he doesn’t know how injured they were, if they could move, they must have already fled for their lives. Now that they were still here, it proved that their injuries were extremely serious!","Not only that, even the five killers he hired had fallen to the ground at this time, their bodies were covered with wounds of various sizes, and blood flowed all over.","The invited helper died, Huang Sanbai not only didn’t feel nervous or sad, but was overjoyed!","Originally, he was worried that the people of Dark Lord had witnessed his insane and crazy behavior today, and would use this incident as a handle to manipulate him!","He also thought about getting rid of these five people afterwards, but he couldn’t deal with five Dao Profound Realm experts at the same time."]},{"number":3551,"title":"Chapter 3551 The Final Victor (2)","paragraphs":["3551 The Final Victor (2)","Fortunately, these five people were seriously injured. Judging from the current situation, they were probably dead.","This saved him a lot of trouble!","Huang Sanbai looked at Huang Yueli and Li Moying who were huddled together and his heart was about to jump out of his chest!","Even Heaven is on his side!","!!","Although the process was a bit tortuous, the final victory still belongs to him.","Huang Sanbai quickly took out a crimson pill from his interspatial ring, and stuffed it into his mouth.","This god-level elixir, as long as there was still a breath left, it could snatch one back from death’s gate! This crimson pill was extremely precious. The existing pharmacists in the God Realm can no longer refine it. It was obtained by accident when he was out on an experience many years ago.This was the very last one!","However, when Huang Sanbai swallowed the elixir, he didn’t feel any pity at all.","On the contrary, he thinks this medicine was worth taking!","Because it only took a few breaths to take the pill, Huang Sanbai could clearly feel that the damage to his meridians and lungs had all been repaired.","Even the massive consumption of profound energy has been replenished.","Now, his state is almost the same as before he was not injured, and he can even exert 80% of his power in his prime!","Huang Sanbai got up from the ground and walked straight towards Li Moying and Huang Yueli.","He didn’t deliberately shield his voice, and the noise he made was not small. As expected, Li Moying discovered his existence very quickly.","However, seeing Li Moying turning around with difficulty, Huang Sanbai could hardly control the smile on the corner of his mouth!","This extremely talented, seemingly incomparable peerless genius... finally fell at his feet!","Huang Sanbai slowly walked up to Li Moying, looking down at the two of them.","“Tsk tsk, Young Master Li, what’s wrong with you? Aren’t you the most talented genius in the God Realm? Isn’t your strength tyrannical? Not only are you invincible among your peers, but you even look down on masters at the Dao Profound Realm?”","Li Moying listened to the cold sarcasm coming from above his head, but the expression on his face did not change, it was still extremely indifferent.","At this moment, he doesn’t care what Huang Sanbai said about him.","Now, the only thought in his mind was to protect Huang Yueli!","Even if he himself was smashed to pieces, he must ensure that his little Li’er can survive!","He almost exhausted all his strength, wanting to get rid of the current state of powerlessness. Even if he had a little strength to explode himself, that would be enough.","But no matter how hard Li Moying tried, he couldn’t move!","The profound energy in his body was constantly merging with the evil qi, and powerful energy was filling every meridian. However, his body seems to have been administered a paralyzing poison as he felt his strength leave him and he felt himself getting heavier and weaker...","Just now, he could barely turn around, but now, he couldn’t even move a finger.","To make matters worse, his consciousness also began to become blurred, as if he might fall into a coma at any time.","Huang Sanbai has been staring at Li Moying, observing his reaction.","He knew that with Li Moying’s arrogance, anyone who had the strength to resist would not let others bully him like this, but now not only did he not jump up to resist, but even his gazes began to become blurred...","Huang Sanbai suddenly kicked Li Moying’s face!"]},{"number":3552,"title":"Chapter 3552 The Final Victor (3)","paragraphs":["3552 The Final Victor (3)","Huang Sanbai kicked quite hard.","After becoming an elder of the Holy Phoenix Clan, he hasn’t lost face for many years, but in the past six months, he almost fell into the hands of Li Moying and Huang Yueli again and again.","The resentment accumulated in his heart has reached its peak!","A large bruise suddenly appeared on Li Moying’s handsome face, and a trace of blood trickled out from the corner of his mouth.","Huang Sanbai was just about to kick him again, wanting to vent his anger.","But who knew, the moment his right foot touched Li Moying’s face, another huge force came from him!","Huang Sanbai yelled “Noooooo!” in his heart! However, it was already too late to retreat his foot at this time!","Huang Sanbai once again felt the backlash of receiving the rebound of double the profound energy, and quickly retreated.","But fortunately, he just wanted to vent his anger with that kick. He only used brute force and didn’t use much profound energy. Therefore, the rebound was not too strong.","He just flew back a certain distance and fell to the ground and the injury was not serious.","Huang Sanbai quickly got up from the ground again, and went towards Li Moying.","Li Moying glared at him with a piercing gaze. If eyes could kill people, Huang Sanbai would have died hundreds of times already!","When Huang Sanbai saw him in such a state of distress, he felt a morbid sense of excitement in his heart!","These two god-level geniuses, who were rare in the God Realm, could only be humiliated by him now, and he can do whatever he wants. What’s the use of having high talent?","Huang Sanbai sneered, “Sect Master Li, I’m really sorry. Everyone says you are the most handsome man in the God Realm. There must be many girls looking at your face? If they knew that you were almost disfigured by me, I wonder how distressed they would be? Oh, yes, and your wife, she should be the most distressed, right? ”","As Huang Sanbai said, he looked at Huang Yueli who was protected by Li Moying.","At the moment Li Moying was attacked, Huang Yueli also opened her eyes suddenly, glaring at Huang Sanbai!","Huang Sanbai said with a smile: “Young Miss Li, you are really too courageous. As a member of the Holy Phoenix Clan, you dare to marry the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and dare to swagger in front of everyone. As the elder of the clan, if you beat this kid up, it is helping you! Don’t worry, this kid will die when he dies. If you are not dead after the Sky Phoenix Ring is taken out of your mind, I will definitely find you a better man.”","“After all, you are so beautiful, even if you are a fool, there are probably many men willing to accept such a bed-warming maid!”","When Li Moying heard this, he became anxious, and the profound energy in his body even loosened for a moment!","As soon as he raised his hand, a burst of profound energy rushed directly towards Huang Sanbai’s chest!","The speed of this attack was astonishingly fast, it was as quick as a flash of lightning, twice as fast as Li Moying’s previous attack!","Huang Sanbai couldn’t react at all and he was struck directly in his chest without any defenses and was sent flying back.","This time, he fell very hard.","Although it wasn’t as strong as the one that was unleashed by the black mist just now, it still made him ache all over his body, his internal organs seemed to be falling apart, and he spit out a mouthful of blood in mid-air.","Huang Sanbai fell to the ground, his face was full of horror!","Because, the profound skill that Li Moying used just now was so powerful that it had completely surpassed his imagination!","That was almost comparable to the normal attack of a strong exponent in the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm."]},{"number":3553,"title":"Chapter 3553 The Final Victor (4)","paragraphs":["3553 The Final Victor (4)","However, Li Moying shouldn’t be so strong at all?","Although his talent is very high, but just now, he was completely at a disadvantage in the face of the attack of the Dao Profound Realm powerhouse!","Why did he suddenly increase in strength?","Huang Sanbai quickly took out another handful of pills and swallowed them. Feeling that his body had recovered a little, he climbed up tremblingly.","He had lingering fears, and when he approached Li Moying again, he walked very slowly, taking a step to observe for a while.","If Li Moying really regained his ability to move, and he didn’t know how to greatly increase his strength, then he might fall here if he underestimated the enemy.","However, fortunately for Huang Sanbai, Li Moying fell back to the ground after delivering that powerful blow, and there were more blood stains at the corners of his mouth.","It seems that the last profound energy has been used up.","Huang Sanbai was afraid of being cheated, so he circled around Li Moying and Huang Yueli several times very cautiously, before confirming that the two of them were really unable to move.","However, he no longer dared to provoke the two of them anymore.","Although ridiculing and humiliating them could make him, who is not talented enough, feel unusually satisfied, but if it stimulated the potential of the two of them and caused any accidents, it would not be worth it at all.","Huang Sanbai thought for a while, before he took out a dagger from his pocket.","He had already noticed that the black mist above the secret realm was now covering Huang Yueli and Li Moying. Although it doesn’t look so dark and thick, the ability to counter still exists.","When he kicked Li Moying just now, it was rebounded.","So, if he attacks with profound energy again, maybe while killing the two of them, he will also die.","Fortunately, you don’t have to use profound energy to kill people.","Huang Sanbai squatted down slowly, raised the dagger, and stabbed it at Li Moying’s temple!","Even without the injection of any profound power, Li Moying would surely die if the fatal parts were severely injured like this!","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened, wishing she could pounce on Li Moying to block the knife!","However, she inhaled more evil qi than Li Moying, and at this moment, her whole body was stiff and unable to move.","Seeing that Huang Sanbai’s dagger was about to fall on Li Moying, Huang Yueli closed her eyes in despair.","But at this moment, a strong wind suddenly hit from a distance!","“Boom—!”","This burst of profound energy hit Huang Sanbai’s wrist, and the dagger flew out of his hand.","Huang Sanbai’s wrist was in pain, and even his bones were about to be broken.","He knew that a master was coming, so he hurriedly turned around, “Who? Who is here??”","“Huang Sanbai, how dare you lay such a vicious hand on the Young Master of our Cloudy Qilin Clan! It’s shameless! Leave your life!”","With a stern shout, two bolts of lightning fell towards Huang Sanbai’s head!","Huang Sanbai’s face changed in shock, almost rolling and crawling on the ground to avoid.","Even though the time was short, he had already recognized the sudden glimpse just now. The people who came were the two six-star generals of the Cloudy Qilin Clan——Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai!","The cultivation base of these two Divine Generals was slightly lower than Huang Sanbai’s, but after the experience of the Allied Armies, their actual combat ability was not inferior to Huang Sanbai’s!","Even if he wasn’t injured, facing one of them, he wouldn’t dare to say that he would win."]},{"number":3554,"title":"Chapter 3554 Completely Lost It!(1)","paragraphs":["3554 Completely Lost It!(1)","Under the current situation, he has absolutely no chance of winning!","Huang Sanbai quickly realized his own weakness, so he didn’t bother to fight back at all.","After dodging Li Yuntao’s first attack, he immediately rolled his body and hid directly behind Li Moying.","He even grabbed Li Moying’s waist, trying to grab him and use him as a shield.","The two Divine Generals who were originally furious were completely merciless when they attacked and they no longer had any qualms about abiding by the peace agreement. Each of their moves were all filled with murderous intent and the only thought in their hearts was to kill Huang Sanbai immediately.","However, the true face of Huang Sanbai was beyond their imagination!","He was actually so insidious and shameless! The usual dignified appearance in the Holy Phoenix Clan was all just a pretense!","His shameless move forced Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai to forcibly halt their attack as they saw their lightning infused attack narrowly pass Li Moying’s side!","Because of the temporary withdrawal, the two Divine Generals also endured a certain degree of backlash.","Huang Sanbai reacted very quickly, hiding behind Li Moying was just a stopgap measure, he didn’t intend to really confront the two generals.","Taking advantage of the moment when Li Yuntao and the others were furious, he had already dodged and rushed towards the depths of the dense forest!","Li Yunhai was about to go after him, but was held back by Li Yuntao.","“That old man... If you want to kill him, there will be plenty of opportunities in the future, so it’s more important to save Young Master first.”","Li Yunhai’s struggle was fully shown on his face and he angrily released more than a dozen bolts of lightning towards the dense forest, but the forest was pitch black, and he really couldn’t see whether he had hit Huang Sanbai.","He stomped his feet resentfully, and turned back to Li Moying.","At this moment, a slender figure also ran towards this side.","Still some distance away, someone came and shouted: “Seniors, have you found Young Master yet? He...is he alright!”","Li Yuntao’s face was very gloomy, and he said in a low voice: “Do you think he’s alright? How could he be alright? He’s in a really terrible situation! But fortunately we caught up in time. Although he passed out, the injury doesn’t seem to be serious. The profound energy in his meridians are sufficient, there should be no danger to life.”","As he said that, he looked at Li Leyun who had just arrived, “It’s really thanks to you this time! If you hadn’t told us that Young Master left Medial Arch City suddenly, and there were people from the Holy Phoenix Clan following him, we would never think of coming to check on Young Master! This time, you have saved Young Master’s life!”","Li Yuntao already hated Li Leyun very much, but after this incident, he changed his opinion of her.","Li Leyun couldn’t help feeling secretly happy.","Half a month ago, Li Yuntao and the others kicked her out of Medial Arch City even though she made a fool of herself in Grandmaster Xiao’s competition.","However, she was still unwilling after all, so she never really left. Instead, she was still near Medial Arch City, looking for an opportunity to get close to Li Moying.","In the end, she couldn’t get close to Li Moying, but found out that he and Huang Yueli were leaving together in an airship.","Li Leyun couldn’t help but wanted to follow. However, it was precisely because of her actions that she spotted the suspicious-looking Huang Sanbai and the others!","At this time, Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai happened to be carrying out the mission of the Allied Armies near Medial Arch City.","After she realized that something was wrong, she hurried to explain the situation to the two Divine Generals.","It was a matter of their Young Master’s safety, so the two Divine Generals did not dare to be negligent, so they quickly dispatched their airship to follow."]},{"number":3555,"title":"Chapter 3555 Completely Lost It!(2)","paragraphs":["3555 Completely Lost It!(2)","However, they came relatively late, Li Moying and Huang Yueli had already entered the secret realm of Saint Iniquitous Shadow a few days before.","Even Huang Sanbai and the others have found Huang Yueli’s location and set up a vicious trap.","But Li Yuntao and the others were like headless chickens, unable to find any clues at all. Even the waiter who had seen Li Moying before and provided information to the Holy Phoenix Clan was killed by Huang Sanbai!","Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai stayed in Forest Shade Town for several days without any clue. They thought Li Leyun had made a mistake and almost planned to leave.","Fortunately, before they left, they happened to see Huang Sanbai hurrying along the street with five killers!","Li Yuntao and others hurriedly followed, and they arrived in time, saving Li Moying’s life!","Also because of this, Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai’s impression of Li Leyun has also changed, and they feel that she still has merits, at least she was sincere to the Young Master, and she was still quite clever.","Although Li Yuntao and the others didn’t say these words, their eyes and expressions said a lot.","Li Leyun saw it in her eyes and was happy in her heart.","Especially when she noticed that Huang Yueli beside Li Moying was unconscious, not knowing whether she was dead or alive, her mood became even better!","While talking, Li Yunhai had already carried the unconscious Li Moying.","He said to his elder brother: “Brother, the Young Master’s injury is not so serious, but he has been in a coma for a long time. I gave him several pills but nothing worked. There’s something weird, we can’t delay, we have to hurry up and take him back to Amethyst Paramount Palace, and ask the clan doctor for treatment!”","Li Yuntao grimaced, and nodded, “That’s true, we can’t delay here, and take the Young Master back safely first!”","As he said that, he looked at Li Leyun, “Yunhai and I must escort the Young Master back immediately, and you will be responsible for the rest of the matter here! There are quite a few cultivators from the clan who came with me this time, and they should all be here now. They are rushing here as we speak so when they arrive, you have someone take all the guards around the Young Master back, and treat them well. I saw them just now, they were seriously injured, but they are still alive!”","Li Leyun nodded emphatically, and said in response: “Two Divine Generals, don’t worry, I know the seriousness! Brother Tianyi and the others have done a great job in protecting the Young Master, and I will definitely do my best to treat them!”","The two Divine Generals trusted Li Leyun very much at this time, and at the same time they were concerned about Li Moying’s injury, so they had no time to think about it.","They took Li Moying with them and used their profound body skills, but within a few breaths, their figures had already disappeared into the dense forest.","Seeing them walking away, Li Leyun’s eyes flashed, and she lowered her head to look at Huang Yueli who was still on the ground.","At this time, the black mist above the entrance of the secret realm had completely penetrated into the bodies of Huang Yueli and Li Moying.","It was also because of this that Li Yunhai was able to carry Li Moying so easily without being backlashed.","Huang Yueli’s body was no longer surrounded by black mist.","She fell to the ground, her eyes closed tightly, and her whole body was limp and weak, but her face looked normal.","Now, the profound energy in her body has been completely mixed with the evil qi. A large amount of evil qi poured in, along her meridians, entered her dantian, and even spread to her brain.","Huang Yueli couldn’t even move a single finger.","Because of this, even though she was so shocked that Li Moying was taken away, there was nothing she could do!"]},{"number":3556,"title":"Chapter 3556 Completely Lost It! (3)","paragraphs":["3556 Completely Lost It! (3)","From Li Leyun’s point of view, Huang Yueli was no different than a lamb waiting to be slaughtered.","She slowly approached Huang Yueli, and first kicked her on the waist. Seeing that she didn’t respond, she immediately showed an icy smile.","“Tsk tsk, you stinky girl with the surname Li, you still have today! Aren’t you very arrogant and proud? You think that as long as you can use despicable tricks to captivate brother Moying, you can ascend to the sky and become the young lady of the Cloudy Qilin Clan? Huh? But look at you now, aren’t you lying at my feet like a dog?”","At this time, Huang Yueli had completely lost consciousness.","Although these evil qi had integrated well with her own profound energy, there was still too much!","The raging evil qi poured into her dantian crazily. It was fine at first, but later on, it increased more and more, and it almost caused her dantian to explode!","A blush appeared on Huang Yueli’s face, and she began to feel pain.","Seeing that she was silent, Li Leyun felt annoyed. She lowered her head to Huang Yueli’s ear, and said again: “Speak! Why don’t you speak? Is it because you’re hurt too badly, or did you not put me in your eyes at all?? Do you think... I dare not kill you? Now that brother Moying has been rescued, and there is no one else here, no one will know if I kill you!”","The evil qi in Huang Yueli’s body flowed more violently, and beads of perspiration started to form on her forehead.","But, she still couldn’t move!","Moreover, she couldn’t feel any movement from the outside world. Even if Li Leyun spoke so close to her, she didn’t hear anything.","When Li Leyun saw that there was no response at all, she was disappointed.","She said these words in order to humiliate Huang Yueli, and she wanted to see panic and unwillingness appear on her confident face, so as to remove the psychological shadow caused by Huang Yueli’s repeated slaps in the face.","However, Huang Yueli didn’t respond!","No response, what’s the point of scolding her then?","Li Leyun’s plan to kill Huang Yueli was originally just a threat, but as soon as she said the words, she suddenly realized that this was really a golden opportunity!","After killing Huang Yueli, no one will come to snatch Li Moying from her again!","Moreover, there aren’t any witnesses here, and she wants to deny it afterwards, without any effort!","All she needed to say was that when she came, Huang Yueli was already dead!","Even if Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai might think of her, they will definitely not stand up and testify, because they definitely want Huang Yueli to disappear quickly!","Huang Yueli did not hand over Grandmaster Xiao’s business to the Cloudy Qilin Clan, but instead cooperated with the Black Tortoise Clan. This matter made the two Divine Generals very angry!","Thinking of this, Li Leyun suddenly became terrified!","She raised her right hand, and the profound energy in her body condensed towards her palm, and soon formed a blueish purple ball of light on her hand.","Li Leyun narrowed her eyes, ruthlessly slammed towards Huang Yueli!","“Boom—!”","A loud bang!","Li Leyun held on to the idea of not doing one thing and not doing the other, so she acted extremely viciously, and used the secret method of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","But this time with all his strength, the attack was clearly aimed at Huang Yueli’s heart, but it seemed to hit an iron plate directly!","At the same time, a force of counterattack turned towards Li Leyun instead!","Li Leyun did not expect such a thing to happen."]},{"number":3557,"title":"Chapter 3557 Completely Lost It!(4)","paragraphs":["3557 Completely Lost It!(4)","Just like those black robed men experienced just now, she was defenseless, and she had no time to dodge, and was directly sent flying!","“Uh... pffft...!”","Li Leyun vomited blood in the air and fell to the ground.","Fortunately, she only had the cultivation base of the Heart Profound Realm. Although the blow was heavy, she still managed to save her life under the doubled rebound.","She was in so much pain that she collapsed on the ground, tried her best to turn her head, and looked in Huang Yueli’s direction in disbelief.","After enduring Li Leyun’s attack, a black mist suddenly emerged from Huang Yueli’s body, wrapping her in the middle.","At the same time, the stones around Huang Yueli suddenly emitted a golden light!","“This... this is actually a teleportation array! She... where will she be teleported??”","When Huang Yueli was attacked, the evil qi in Huang Yueli’s body suddenly overflowed and filled a small area around her. The evil qi poured into the teleportation array, providing enough energy for the interrupted array.","So, the teleportation array was activated again!","Li Leyun didn’t realize that it was a teleportation array at first. She didn’t realize it until the golden light came on, but it was already too late!","Now she was seriously injured because of the backlash, and it was impossible to rush to stop it.","She could only watch helplessly as the stunning beauty she hated to the marrow slowly disappeared into the golden light.","Li Leyun gritted her teeth angrily, “What’s going on? Why is that damn girl so lucky? She ran away! I don’t know where the teleportation array leads to. I hope she falls into a crisis-ridden place. I hope she’ll end up in a horrible place and die before she can even wake up! That would save me from having to do it myself.”","Li Leyun cursed Huang Yueli fiercely, and still couldn’t get over her anger, she clenched her fist and hit the ground forcefully.","At this time, the young disciples of the Cloudy Qilin Clan who were sent by Li Yuntao to aid had already arrived.","Seeing her acting so strangely, they couldn’t help but look at each other, “Young Miss Le... Young Miss Leyun, what’s wrong with you? Why are you injured so badly? Is it those bastards from the Holy Phoenix Clan attacked you?”","Li Leyun didn’t answer them, but instead asked: “There’s only me and those five black robed men here, right?”","This question she asked was terrifying as a cold glint flashed by Li Leyun’s eyes.","Several young cultivators couldn’t help but shudder. They scanned the surroundings tremblingly before replying in a low voice: “Yes... yes! We only saw you and those five black robed men...”","“Very well, remember your words!”","These were all her witnesses! What a help!","Now, Li Leyun felt that it was time for Huang Yueli to disappear!","“I’m fine. You don’t need to worry about me. In the southwest of the forest, there are four bodyguards of Brother Moying. Li Tianyi and the others were all seriously injured. They seem to be on the verge of dying. Hurry up and save them first!”","The young cultivator made a stretcher and carried Li Leyun away.","Before leaving, Li Leyun turned her head to look at the place where Huang Yueli disappeared.","The teleportation array, which was shining golden just now, had completely recovered its calm. Even the cloud of black mist that suddenly appeared just now has disappeared.","The teleportation array that had calmed down looked very dilapidated and inconspicuous.","That dead girl... Where did she go?","I hope she never comes back alive!"]},{"number":3558,"title":"Chapter 3558 Secret Inheritance (1)","paragraphs":["3558 Secret Inheritance (1)","Huang Yueli’s felt as if an eternity had passed as she fell.","During the short time she passed through the teleportation, her body kept shaking with the fluctuations in space, and the evil qi in her body was also under such pressure, and penetrated deeper into her meridians.","Not only that, the dizziness caused by the teleportation made Huang Yueli, who was already unwell, feel more and more uncomfortable.","Especially after she fell into the secret realm, the evil qi in the secret realm also began to pour into her body.","The evil qi in her body became more and more abundant, and in the end, it almost burst her dantian!","Huang Yueli frowned, her whole body was hot, and she didn’t know where she was.","She didn’t know how long it took, but the evil qi running wild in her body suddenly calmed down a lot, and her consciousness gradually returned to her mind.","Huang Yueli opened her eyes in a daze, and the scene in front of her shocked her!","She was actually in a richly decorated Palace. There was no one in the room, and there was no way out.","The surrounding walls were engraved with complicated patterns and various mechanisms.","Even a genius armament master like her couldn’t understand the function and mechanism of these mechanisms at all!","Huang Yueli shuddered in her heart, and immediately felt that she was in a rather precarious situation.","Although she was not conscious just now, she roughly knew that at the moment when her life and death were on the line, the teleportation array suddenly activated by itself and teleported her out.","However, according to common sense, she should have been teleported to the secret realm of Saint Iniquitous Shadow, right?","But the Palace presented to her now was completely unfamiliar, completely different from the abode she left just a day ago...","Could it be that the teleportation array could lead to other places?","While thinking about it, Huang Yueli propped herself up, trying to get up from the ground.","However, as soon as she tried hard, she realized that she was still unable to move. Although her consciousness had become much clearer, her body was still limp and weak.","Just then, she suddenly heard a mysterious voice sound above her.","“You can’t move around yet.”","Huang Yueli had already seen it just now, and there was no one in the room, but suddenly there was someone talking, which really surprised her.","She widened her eyes and looked in the direction of the sound.","What appeared in front of her was a middle-aged man in a white robe. He looked about forty years old, and he was very elegant and handsome. It could be seen that he must have been an outstandingly handsome man when he was young.","Huang Yueli looked at him, and asked in shock: “Who are you? What kind of place is this?”","The man in white frowned, “You can break through the many tests I left behind and enter my abode, but you don’t know who I am?”","After hearing this, Huang Yueli’s mind suddenly had a flash of inspiration, and she couldn’t help blurting out: “You...you are Saint Iniquitous Shadow!”","As soon as the words came out, she felt something was wrong again, “No, haven’t you already... passed away? Uh, I’m sorry, I didn’t mean to offend...”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was not angry because of her words, but laughed instead.","“It is true that my main body was already gone tens of thousands of years ago. This is just a trace of my consciousness left in the abode. It is the limit to be able to last for tens of thousands of years. I have been waiting for a suitable candidate who will be able to inherit my skills...”"]},{"number":3559,"title":"Chapter 3559 Secret Inheritance (2)","paragraphs":["3559 Secret Inheritance (2)","“At first, after such a long time, no one could successfully pass the various tests I left behind. I was already planning to give up. I didn’t expect that a genius like you who is suitable for cultivating my lifelong skills would appear!”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow looked at Huang Yueli, smiled and nodded.","He was very satisfied with Huang Yueli.","Originally, as long as that person had a heavenly talent and met the other conditions he set, he was ready to pass on his skills to the other party.","After all, god-level geniuses were extremely rare in the God Realm. They could be met but not sought after, and they had other conditions to meet as well. It was really hard to find them. Saint Iniquitous Shadow did not have such extravagant hopes.","But now, seeing Huang Yueli... this really surprised him!","After hearing this, Huang Yueli was not that excited.","After all, she has also entered many secret realms, and has a certain understanding of the inheritance of various masters.","The moment Saint Iniquitous Shadow revealed his identity, she had roughly guessed why this once peerless powerhouse showed up.","She asked in bewilderment: “Test? Senior Iniquitous Shadow, sorry but I’m very confused, what kind of test did I pass? How come I don’t understand anything you say at all?”","If the so-called test was to decipher the arrays at the periphery and the entrance of the secret realm and successfully enter the secret realm, then when she entered with Li Moying and four guards a few days ago, she had already fulfilled the conditions.","However, she was not able to obtain the inheritance at that time. Even after they searched inside and outside the abode for several times, they did not find this secret room or any clues related to the inheritance.","But this time, she didn’t come in by her own strength at all. On the contrary, she fell into a state of semi-consciousness and embarrassment.","How could the conditions be met at such a time?","Hearing this, Saint Iniquitous Shadow smiled and said, “You must be very surprised. Why didn’t you meet the conditions when you entered the abode last time? In fact, the treasures and medicinal materials I left in the thatched hut and the medicinal field were originally what I was going to give to passersby. As for the real inheritance, I will only leave it to young cultivators with certain qualifications!”","“Certain qualifications...” Huang Yueli repeated in a low voice, thoughtful.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow further explained: “That’s right, the most important requirement for me to find a successor is that this person must have a special physique and be able to withstand a large amount of evil qi entering the body!”","Huang Yueli was startled, then remembered her current state, and couldn’t help but let out an “ah”.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow said: “Actually, when you first entered the abode, you should have noticed that the air in this secret realm is full of evil qi. Ordinary cultivators have very low tolerance to this evil qi. Those who are a little higher, although they can barely use their profound energy to resist for a while, but after a long time, their meridians and spiritual consciousness will be damaged, and they cannot last for a few days at all.”","“However, for cultivators with special physique who can become evil cultivators, it is completely different! Evil qi enters the body and can perfectly integrate with their original profound energy. Not only will they not be injured, but they will also feel very comfortable.”","Having said that, Saint Iniquitous Shadow paused, with a look of doubt on his face, and looked at Huang Yueli.","“Strange, why didn’t you absorb these evil qi when you first entered the secret realm?”"]},{"number":3560,"title":"Chapter 3560 Secret Inheritance (3)","paragraphs":["3560 Secret Inheritance (3)","Huang Yueli blinked, “I’m not an evil cultivator, why would I absorb the evil qi? Besides, if the evil qi enters the body, if it’s really harmless, I wouldn’t be so immobile now, right? This is enough to show that I didn’t take the initiative to absorb evil qi!”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was stunned for a moment, then shook his head and laughed, “You are quite shrewd, little girl! No wonder... Actually, the concentration of the evil qi I left in the secret realm is not high, even if you absorb it all, you won’t be able to absorb it all.” There are too many disadvantages. Moreover, the conditions I set at the beginning was like this, only when most of the evil qi in the secret realm is absorbed will my spiritual sense be clear and the real inheritance will be opened.”","After hearing this, Huang Yueli finally understood.","It turned out that she and Li Moying were afraid that there would be negative effects, and that they could force these evil qi out of their bodies. This action made them unable to meet the inheritance conditions of Saint Iniquitous Shadows.","!!","But now, when she fell into the secret realm for the second time, she was in a trance, and her profound energy had been completely invaded by evil qi, so she couldn’t counter these evil qi. As a result, the evil qi in the secret realm also entered her body and evidently triggered the inheritance.","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli couldn’t help sighing secretly.","The behavior of these seniors and strong men really made them puzzled!","Saint Iniquitous Shadow looked at Huang Yueli, and said, “You fell from the top of the secret realm just now, is it because you accidentally touched the mechanism of the entrance when you left, causing the evil qi to impact into your body, and you almost died?”","Huang Yueli gave a wry smile, and replied: “Senior Iniquitous Shadow, you guessed pretty well, but I didn’t touch the mechanism by mistake, but when I was leaving, I was attacked by the enemy, and the other party’s attack destroyed the teleportation array and also dispersed the large mass of evil qi above! These evil qi bounced off the opponent’s attack and saved the live of my husband and me, but they also invaded my meridians, making me unable to move, so I could only fall in.”","Hearing the words, Saint Iniquitous Shadow shook his head and said, “This is really your fate! To tell you the truth, my original idea was to screen through the thin evil qi in the secret realm. Once I selected a disciple, I would teach that person how to refine the evil qi with my cultivation technique, so that when he leaves, he can just absorb the large cloud of evil qi at the entrance of the secret realm! Don’t underestimate that cloud of black mist, it was carefully refined by me over the years and absorbed countless devils and the energy of the God Clan powerhouse!”","“If it weren’t for your great destiny and extremely high talent, under the impact of so much energy, you would be dead now!”","After hearing this, Huang Yueli also felt a wave of fear.","Unexpectedly, the large cloud of black mist outside was actually a legacy left by Saint Iniquitous Shadow to future generations!","While cultivating, one had to also pay attention to the step-by-step process.","The concentration of evil qi in the secret realm was very low. She did not feel any discomfort after inhaling a little.","If she could follow the plan of Saint Iniquitous Shadow, first learn to refine this energy, and then gradually increase the intensity, so as to absorb the energy from the outside, her safety was guaranteed.","But now, she was directly hurled into the unknown.","Without any basis at all, such a large amount of evil qi was directly poured into the body!","One had to know, the evil qi contained in that black mist was once enough to drive dozens of arrays within a radius of more than ten miles in the entire dense forest, and countless cultivators died in these arrays! Its magnitude of power could be seen."]},{"number":3561,"title":"Chapter 3561 Secret Inheritance (4)","paragraphs":["3561 Secret Inheritance (4)","If so much evil qi is poured into the body of an ordinary cultivator, it will definitely be the result of instant kill!","She was able to survive, so it was definitely a blessing!","However, she was not completely out of harm’s way, at least for now... she was still completely unable to move!","Moreover, she could also clearly feel that the influence of evil qi in her body has not been eliminated, but that these evil qi feel fear in front of Saint Iniquitous Shadow, and she has hibernated herself. Once Saint Iniquitous Shadow leaves, the torment she had endured just now will definitely reappear!","!!","“Senior Iniquitous Shadow, then... what should I do now? So much evil qi has invaded my body, can I force them out again? Please give me some pointers!”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow smiled and said: “Forcing it out? Why do you want to force it out? Although you can’t completely refine the qi contained in these evil qi, as long as you practice my unique technique, you can store them in the dantian, it won’t affect you anymore, just refine it slowly in the future.”","A look of anxiety appeared on Huang Yueli’s face.","“But...Senior Iniquitous Shadow, I don’t want to cultivate evil cultivator’s practices. You must have noticed that I am a cultivator of the ancient gods. When I was in the secret realm, I didn’t absorb the evil qi in the air because of this consideration...”","Huang Yueli spoke very cautiously, for fear of angering Saint Iniquitous Shadow.","But upon hearing her refusal, Saint Iniquitous Shadow still showed obvious anger on his face, “Little girl, what do you mean? I am also a cultivator in the Fate Profound Realm after all, and I am willing to accept you as a closed disciple. If you can’t ask for it, you don’t like it anymore? You, like those vulgar people outside, think that evil cultivators are some villains who are insane and do evil, don’t you?”","Actually, Huang Yueli really had some considerations like this.","Not long after she arrived in the God Realm, she had a falling out with her clan again. She didn’t plan to have another identity as an evil cultivator at this time. It would be conceivable that a lot of trouble would come to her, which would not help her improve her strength at all.","Even if the inheritance of a powerhouse in the Profound Fate Realm is really powerful, for her, the loss outweighs the gain.","After all, with her talent, she could become a top expert in the God Realm through normal practice, so there is absolutely no need to follow such deviated ways.","However, she didn’t dare to tell the truth to Saint Iniquitous Shadow.","But Saint Iniquitous Shadow was not someone who had not seen the world, so he already guessed it in his heart.","The gaze towards Huang Yueli became more and more harsh.","Huang Yueli was sweating profusely from behind. She knew that although Saint Iniquitous Shadow looked gentle and refined on the outside, there was no one who could be easily provoked by such a peerless powerhouse with such a cultivation level!","She suddenly thought of a reason, and quickly said: “Senior Iniquitous Shadow, please don’t get me wrong! I just don’t want to lie to you and let you take in the wrong disciple!”","“Take in the wrong disciple? What do you mean?” Saint Iniquitous Shadow frowned and said, “I’m lucky to be able to receive an disciple with god-level talent!”","Huang Yueli hurriedly said: “Senior, although I’m a god-level genius, it’s true that I was able to absorb these evil qi not because of my inborn special constitution, but because of other reasons. I’m afraid I’m not the successor you’re looking for!”","“Another reason?” Saint Iniquitous Shadow sized her up for a while, then asked suspiciously: “What reason? As far as I know, apart from possessing the physique of evil cultivators, no one can absorb so much evil qi.”"]},{"number":3562,"title":"Chapter 3562 Secret Inheritance (5)","paragraphs":["3562 Secret Inheritance (5)","Huang Yueli explained: “This is a long story, we have to start from twenty years ago...”","“Twenty years ago?” Saint Iniquitous Shadow frowned, but then he seemed to think of something, and his gaze towards Huang Yueli became deeper and sharper.","Huang Yueli nodded and continued, “Yes, twenty years ago! At that time, I was a cultivator in the lower realm, and I was hunted down by my enemies. Due to the large number of opponents, I had no choice but to explode my soul! At this time, my husband arrived, but he was one step too late after all, and could only helplessly watch me perish in front of him...!”","“My husband and I have gone through many hardships to be together. He was unwilling to be reconciled to such a result, so from an ancient manual, he found the technique left by you, Senior Iniquitous Shadow—the legendary soul splitting technique!”","!!","Hearing this, the eyes of Saint Iniquitous Shadow suddenly shone with excitement.","Although he had guessed a moment ago, he was not as excited as hearing the news with his own ears.","“What did you say? Soul-splitting technique?? How did my skills spread to the lower realm? Forget it, this is not important, then did your husband really use the soul-splitting technique? He used the soul-splitting technique The technique saved your primordial spirit and saved you? Then what happened afterwards?”","As Saint Iniquitous Shadow spoke, he became more and more excited, and couldn’t help but rush to Huang Yueli in two or three steps.","Huang Yueli was taken aback by his eager expression, but she still nodded and said: “Yes, my husband did learn the art of splitting the soul, and gave me half of his primordial spirit. Later, we both reincarnated, we experienced a lot of things, and finally we are together again...”","Although she only briefly explained the situation at that time, recalling the scene of Li Moying tearing his soul apart for her, Huang Yueli still couldn’t help but tremble all over.","Sometimes in her dreams, the scene of the night when she saw Li Moying’s soul splitting, occasionally became her nightmare.","She has always been afraid that Li Moying will encounter danger again in order to protect her.","Because of this, she has been working hard to improve herself, in order not to repeat the mistakes of the past.","Today, Li Moying almost died because of her again!","Fortunately, people from the Cloudy Qilin Clan showed up in time.","Although Li Leyun tried to kill her just now, if time goes back, she still hopes that people from the Cloudy Qilin Clan can arrive. At least, Li Moying was safe and sound now...","While Huang Yueli was in a daze, Saint Iniquitous Shadow had been sizing her up.","After a while, he suddenly asked: “That’s not right, after splitting your soul, your soul should be in an extremely unstable state, but your soul is very complete, moreover, it’s stronger than ordinary young cultivators.” It must be hundreds of times stronger, and there is no damage at all, so what is going on?”","Huang Yueli lowered her eyes slightly, “That’s because my husband and I got married again later and successfully consummated...”","“What? Successfully consummated??” Hearing this, Saint Iniquitous Shadow couldn’t help exclaiming, “Then how can you still be alive? What about your husband? Isn’t he too unreliable? Did you consummate? Or is it that the exercises he got are incomplete?”","When Huang Yueli heard what he said about Li Moying, she immediately put on a stern face, “How can my husband be unreliable? If it wasn’t because he saved me, I would have been dead twenty years ago!”"]},{"number":3563,"title":"Chapter 3563 Secret Inheritance (6)","paragraphs":["3563 Secret Inheritance (6)","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was full of disapproval, “Yes, he did save you. However, he should also know that once the marriage is consummated with you, that part of your primordial spirit will return to him. In this way, all his efforts to save you will be in vain! Unless he is tired of you and wants to take this opportunity to get rid of you...”","“Shut up! Although you are a senior, you can’t slander my husband like this!”","Huang Yueli was still explaining well at first, but after hearing such wild speculations from Saint Iniquitous Shadow, she finally couldn’t help it.","What she can’t accept the most is someone slandering Li Moying!","!!","Not a single person!","Saint Iniquitous Shadow glanced at her coldly, “What? Am I wrong?”","Huang Yueli snorted, “Of course not! Besides, you were the one who wrote this manual, and you must know that if I don’t consummate the marriage with him, then sooner or later he will die due to the exhaustion of his soul! How can I just watch him die?”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow said nonchalantly: “Since he has chosen to save you even at the expense of cutting his soul, he probably regards you as more important than his own life! If that’s the case, how can he give up halfway!”","Huang Yueli said seriously: “I’ll say it again, he didn’t give up halfway, but I must save him! At that time we were trapped by the enemies, both of us were going to die, and I also peeked at the secret manual he hid, knowing that consummating our marriage can save him, and it can also greatly increase his strength, so I... For him, my life is more important than his, so why not for me?”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow had no expression at first.","However, after hearing Huang Yueli’s accusation, his expression became more and more serious.","After Huang Yueli finished speaking, he didn’t reply immediately, but narrowed his eyes slightly, as if he remembered something.","After a while, he sighed deeply, “You and your husband have a deep relationship, which is rare in the God Realm.”","After a pause, he asked again: “However, in this way, your own life will be lost. Why are you still alive now? And the soul is so stable? Could it be that... with the help of some top-grade treasure? If you rely on treasures, it’s not impossible, but... this at least has to be the natal Spirit Armament of a strong man in the Profound Fate Realm, right? Moreover, there must be a strong external force to help your primordial spirit and Spirit Armament Fusion!”","It seems that what Huang Yueli said just now moved Saint Iniquitous Shadow. Now, his tone has become much calmer, and his gaze towards Huang Yueli has also become gentler.","Huang Yueli didn’t intend to tell the truth at first, but she didn’t expect Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s eyes to be so sharp. Hearing what she said at the beginning, she deduced that she had a Spirit Armament on her body.","Huang Yueli realized that in front of a top powerhouse like Saint Iniquitous Shadow, she couldn’t hide her little secrets from him at all.","After a little thought, she chose to tell the truth, “Yes, I did have a Spirit Armament to recognize me as its master at the time, and the circumstances at that time were very coincidental. The lower realm we were in was originally covered by demonic qi, which cut off communication. On the way to the God Realm, the barrier formed by the demonic qi was broken at that time, and a large amount of profound energy poured in, which happened to be absorbed by me, helping me complete the fusion of the primordial spirit and the Spirit Armament.”","Hearing Huang Yueli’s words, a man as well-informed as Saint Iniquitous Shadow couldn’t help showing some surprise."]},{"number":3564,"title":"Chapter 3564 Secret Inheritance (7)","paragraphs":["3564 Secret Inheritance (7)","“I didn’t expect such a thing, I didn’t expect that the luck between you and your husband is really good! This... this is simply unbelievable!”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow even paced back and forth in the room excitedly.","Meeting Huang Yueli’s puzzled eyes, he explained: “Do you know that the soul splitting technique is very, very difficult to succeed, and the person who needs to perform the technique has a very powerful primordial spirit, which is better than ordinary heaven-level geniuses? Not only withstanding the bombardment of the tribulation lightning by a hundred times, in the process, we also need to ensure that the primordial spirit splits into two halves instead of completely collapsing!”","“For tens of thousands of years, counting the 3,000 planes including the God Realm, there are only seven or eight people who can succeed. It’s enough to surprise me that you two were able to accomplish this.”","“However, among the seven or eight people who succeeded in splitting their souls, almost all of them died within fifteen or sixteen years after reincarnation due to the exhaustion of their primordial spirit. Those who survived the consummation, those who were rescued died as a result!”","“You and your husband are able to survive. You are young and in the lower realms, and you have a Spirit Armament in your body, and it just happened to be a great opportunity when the magic barrier shattered! Your luck...is like the gods! It has never been seen in millions of years!”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a while, and finally, when she heard that the words of Saint Iniquitous Shadow became more and more exaggerated, she hurriedly laughed a few times.","“Senior Iniquitous Shadow, you’re flattering yourself! We’re actually just lucky. When we encounter dangerous things, we can often turn bad luck into good luck.”","Hearing this, Saint Iniquitous Shadow immediately shook his head, “For ordinary people, this is good luck, but for a peerless genius like you, this is your luck! Being able to have such a powerful luck shows that you In the future, he will definitely become the top powerhouse in the God Realm!”","While talking, Saint Iniquitous Shadow laughed again, “It seems that my luck is not bad, although I waited for tens of thousands of years to wait for a disciple, but he is a peerless genius whose future achievements may be higher than mine! ”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow once again mentioned the matter of taking Huang Yueli as a closed disciple.","Huang Yueli felt bad when she heard it, so she hurriedly emphasized again, “This, this...Senior Iniquitous Shadow, as I said just now, I don’t want to become an evil cultivator. To be honest, I just ascended from the lower realms and married my husband Not a few years. My husband is the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, the future Patriarch of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. If I become an evil cultivator, I’m afraid I won’t be able to be with him! You should understand us!”","Huang Yueli had always been clever and shrewd.","She has already seen it, because after she told the love story between herself and Li Moying, the attitude of Saint Iniquitous Shadow towards her improved a lot.","Thinking back to the rumors she had heard about Saint Iniquitous Shadow over the years, it was obvious that Saint Iniquitous Shadow must have had a woman he loved deeply before, but he didn’t know if they were able to get together successfully.","It’s easier to get the approval of Saint Iniquitous Shadow if you talk about the relationship between husband and wife.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow didn’t answer her right away, but asked: “By the way, what about your husband? When you entered the secret realm last time, the handsome boy who was with you should be your husband? Why didn’t he come in together?”","Huang Yueli’s eyes darkened, and she replied: “At that time, we were hunted down by people, we were all seriously injured, and because of the evil qi entering our bodies, we couldn’t move, and when we thought we were going to die, people from the Cloudy Qilin Clan suddenly appeared and rescued him .”"]},{"number":3565,"title":"Chapter 3565 Secret Inheritance (8)","paragraphs":["3565 Secret Inheritance (8)","“He left you behind?” Saint Iniquitous Shadow asked with some dissatisfaction.","Huang Yueli shook her head and defended him, “He had already lost consciousness at the time, but somehow I triggered the teleportation array, and as a result, I fell directly into this place.”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow looked at her aversive gaze and knew that she was not telling the complete truth.","However, he did not continue to probe, but snorted coldly and said, “So, your husband is out of luck, maybe he will die!”","Huang Yueli was startled when she heard his harsh verdict and quickly asked: “Senior Iniquitous Shadow, what do you mean by...? What’s wrong with my husband? Could it be that evil qi entered his body and caused him to be seriously injured? But, he is from the Cloudy Qilin Clan , Don’t the ancient gods have a way to resolve these evil qi?”","“Resolve evil qi? Hehe, most people in the God Realm have never seen real evil qi! Moreover, after these evil qi enters your body, they will fuse with your own profound energy. It’s hard to tell the difference! Tell me, what does the Cloudy Qilin Clan use to defuse evil qi?”","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened, “The Cloudy Qilin Clan can’t resolve it either? Then... isn’t my husband in danger?”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow glanced at her, and said coolly: “You still have the heart to think about others? Why don’t you think about yourself! But you have also been invaded by a lot of evil qi, and your husband still has clan resources to help hang onto his little life, but you... haha are not so lucky.”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment, then said, “It doesn’t matter what happens to me, but my husband...”","“What? You really want to save your husband?”","Huang Yueli nodded, “Of course, he was the one who saved me before, this time, I will save him!”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow did not speak, stared at her for a while, and suddenly smiled: “Then you should be my disciple! To save your husband, it is nothing more than teaching him the method of turning evil qi into his own use. The method can save him, and it can save you too! You have to save yourself first, then you can save him, can’t you?”","“But, I really can’t...” Huang Yueli was still hesitating.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow said casually: “You have to think clearly! If you are not my disciple, why should I teach you the method of dispelling evil qi? Your life and death have nothing to do with me, let alone your husband? , you don’t want to live anymore, and you want to drag your husband into the water?”","These words can be regarded as hitting Huang Yueli’s achilles’ heel.","She paused, and finally nodded, “Then... no, Master, please accept me as a disciple! It’s a pity that I can’t move now, and I can’t kowtow to you as a Master!”","Huang Yueli had always been straightforward, so since she had already made her decision, she immediately addressed him as Master.","Seeing her addressing him so naturally, Saint Iniquitous Shadow showed a hint of a smile.","“Isn’t it good to have a Master early, why delay it for so long! I owe you these few heads first, and wait until your cultivation base reaches the Heart Profound Realm! Don’t worry, Master, I will not treat you badly!”","“Heart... Heart Profound Realm?” Huang Yueli was stunned.","She was only at the seventh level of the Heart Profound Realm, although with her talent, it should take less than a few months to advance to the Heart Profound Realm.","However, Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s tone sounded like “I’ll talk about it after you finish this meal”, which really surprised her.","“Look at this for yourself!”","With that said, Saint Iniquitous Shadow threw a golden scroll at Huang Yueli."]},{"number":3566,"title":"Chapter 3566 Secret Inheritance (9)","paragraphs":["3566 Secret Inheritance (9)","Huang Yueli saw the scroll flying towards her, and subconsciously wanted to dodge it.","However, she realized that she was still unable to move!","Looking at the direction in which the scroll was flying, it seemed that it was about to hit her in the face, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but scold in her heart, secretly thinking that this new cheap master of hers seems to be very unreliable!","However, just as the scroll was about to fall, a halo of light suddenly enveloped the scroll.","!!","Immediately after, the scroll stopped in front of Huang Yueli.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow had a panoramic view of Huang Yueli’s expression, and couldn’t help but sneered: “Why are you nervous? Do you think that your Master will harm you?”","“Hey, I didn’t mean that...” Huang Yueli nervously laughed twice.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow glanced at her and said, “Look carefully...open!”","Following his words, the golden scroll slowly opened before Huang Yueli’s eyes...","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment, then quickly looked over at the scroll.","This was the lifelong mastery of Saint Iniquitous Shadow! And, as soon as she learns this, she could move!","However, she only glanced inside, and suddenly there was a “buzz” in her head, all distracting thoughts disappeared instantly, and all she could see in her eyes was the golden light radiating from the scroll.","These golden lights formed extremely obscure symbols in her mind.","These symbols were not any kind of characters that Huang Yueli knew, and they were not even pictures, so she couldn’t understand what they meant at all.","However, when they were projected into her divine consciousness, Huang Yueli could clearly sense that the profound energy in her body was pulled, and the evil qi that filled her dantian was like being injected with chicken blood. Same, jumping up and down excitedly!","Huang Yueli felt a surge of energy and blood, but she was unable to calm it down.","At this moment, the voice of Saint Iniquitous Shadow sounded in her mind: “Relax a bit, don’t try to control the evil qi with the skills you practiced in the past, look at the talisman in front of you, let the qi in the meridians flow smoothly. Relax a little, relax a little more...”","Huang Yueli quickly relaxed her body according to the technique taught by Saint Iniquitous Shadow.","By doing this, the effect was immediate.","Originally, she felt pain all over her body, and her meridians felt as if they were to explode anytime, but after choosing to let nature take its course, her body suddenly felt relaxed.","She could still feel that the evil qi was circulating repeatedly in her meridians, and the direction of the flow was completely different from that of her past practice. Such a disordered flow direction could easily lead to the consequences of a Qi Deviation.","However, Huang Yueli couldn’t do anything else now.","She could only choose to trust the judgment of Saint Iniquitous Shadow, and let the evil qi flow in such a weird way...","I don’t know how long it took, Huang Yueli gradually felt the benefits of such a flow of qi.","The evil qi in her body returned to her dantian after circulating for a few big rounds, and unexpectedly... transformed into profound energy bit by bit! Moreover, it was more pure than what she usually cultivates!","Such a good thing actually happened, which made Huang Yueli happy with such an unexpected outcome!","She couldn’t help being excited. Judging from this, if she can continue to practice according to this, she could turn all the evil qi in her body into profound energy! That was enough for her to directly rush to the Dao Profound Realm!","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli no longer hesitated, no longer had her original worries, and began to intensify her cultivation."]},{"number":3567,"title":"Chapter 3567 Hurt Strangely (1)","paragraphs":["3567 Hurt Strangely (1)","After all, Huang Yueli was a god-level genius, and her talent in cultivation was astonishingly high.","Once she decided to cultivate well, her speed of cultivation exploded exponentially!","Saint Iniquitous Shadow had been standing beside Huang Yueli to protect her. Seeing this scene, he was also taken aback.","“I’ve expected that this little girl is extremely talented, and she will achieve great success in practicing this set of cultivation skills. But I didn’t expect that she would master the skill of transforming evil qi so quickly, and the speed is obviously accelerated! What kind of level of comprehension is this? Terrible, terrible!”","!!","Saint Iniquitous Shadow has been in the God Realm for tens of thousands of years. He thought he was well-informed, but he had never seen such a genius!","“It’s unimaginable! I didn’t expect that my luck would be so good! This is really... In this way, she should be able to complete the first level that originally took five years to complete within two months!”","Fortunately, Huang Yueli could no longer feel any changes in the outside world, and did not hear his words.","Otherwise, she would definitely be so angry that she would curse out loud!","Saint Iniquitous Shadow never told her that it would take at least five years to cultivate this set of techniques! She was still in a hurry to rescue Li Moying, how could she delay here for five years!","Saint Iniquitous Shadow looked at Huang Yueli’s sweaty face and nodded, “This little girl is really nice! I just don’t know how talented her husband is? Seeing how smart she is, she shouldn’t have married someone useless, right? But, it’s impossible for her husband’s talent to be higher than hers... No, no, it’s impossible to be almost the same as her!”","...","Just when Huang Yueli started to cultivate, Li Moying was sent back to Cloudy Qilin Continent as quickly as possible with the desperate efforts of the two Divine Generals.","Li Shihong, the Patriarch of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, greeted him personally, followed by several elders.","He had already received a summons from Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai in advance, and when he learned that Li Moying was attacked by Huang Sanbai and was seriously injured, he immediately became very anxious.","As soon as he saw Li Yuntao get off their airship, he hurried up and asked, “Where’s Moying? Where is he? Are you awake?”","Li Yuntao’s face was heavy, and he shook his head, “The Young Master is not seriously injured, but I don’t know why he has been in a coma. Subordinate doesn’t dare to move him rashly... Patriarch, subordinate did not protect the Young Master... ...”","“What’s all this, how can you still say such things! If you two were not alert enough and arrived in time, Moying would have been killed by that old man Huang Sanbai long ago! We have a common hatred with the Holy Phoenix Clan, we must seek justice in the future! Don’t talk about it now, let the doctors go and see Moying!”","The best doctors of the Cloudy Qilin Clan had been summoned long ago and have been waiting.","Hearing Li Shihong’s order, they hurriedly followed Li Yunhai into the airship to give Li Moying a diagnosis and treatment.","Li Shihong also followed in person.","In the most magnificent room on the airship, Li Moying was lying on the bed with his eyes closed, his face flushed, and cold sweat constantly breaking out from his forehead.","This symptom can be seen as a serious internal injury, or damage to the primordial spirit.","Li Shihong was very anxious, but he didn’t dare to interrupt the doctors’ diagnosis and treatment. He could only forcibly suppress his anxiety and wait for the results of the diagnosis and treatment.","Several genius doctors took Li Moying’s pulse in turn, and after observing his other symptoms, they all had puzzled expressions on their faces."]},{"number":3568,"title":"Chapter 3568 Hurt Strangely (2)","paragraphs":["3568 Hurt Strangely (2)","They started discussing in hushed tones.","“The Young Master’s veins don’t seem to be internally injured?”","“Yes, but how could he be unconscious? Could it be...”","“How about...”","“No, no, it’s too risky. I haven’t even figured out the cause...”","Several genius doctors discussed each other one by one, but after a long time had passed, no progress could be seen, and the expressions on their faces became even more confused.","Li Shihong couldn’t wait any longer, walked over, and interjected and asked: “Several esteemed doctors, how are you doing? Moying is the hope of the clan’s future, and his life is even more important than mine! Please Be sure to try your best to diagnose and treat, no matter what kind of medicinal materials you want, we won’t be stingy!”","One of the old men with a gray beard turned his head and bowed to Li Shihong.","“Patriarch, don’t worry, we also understand the importance of the Young Master, we will do our best to treat him, but it’s just that...”","“Just what?” Li Shihong asked.","The old man replied: “The Young Master’s symptoms are really strange! Judging from his pulse, his external injuries are only flesh injuries, but there are some internal injuries, but they are not considered serious injuries, and his soul is also very complete. According to common sense, even if he was stunned for a while, he should have woken up long ago, it is impossible for him to still be unconscious!”","“Are you sure there is nothing wrong with your diagnosis? According to what you said, how could Moying still be in a coma!” Li Shihong’s heart skipped a beat.","If something goes wrong, he may suffer from Qi Deviation and even lose his sanity.","Especially in the world of cultivators, anything can happen.","In such an abnormal situation, it is very likely that the enemy has used some kind of secret method. If they can’t solve it, then their god-level genius might really end here!","Seeing that his face turned ugly instantly, the old man quickly comforted him and said, “Patriarch, please calm down first. This is only a preliminary diagnosis. In fact, there are many reasons for being unconscious without internal and external injuries. It’s just hard to judge now. Please find someone to carry the Young Master back to Amethyst Paramount Hall first, so that we can take more time to diagnose him.”","Li Shihong hesitated and said: “It’s really inconvenient here, but... in his current situation, can he move? It won’t cause any damage, right?”","The old man shook his head and said, “That’s not true. The Young Master came all the way here by airship. If he moves, something will happen. I’m afraid he won’t be able to make it here alive.”","Li Yuntao has been waiting at the door.","Hearing the conversation between the two, he immediately understood, and took the initiative to go out and call for someone.","Not long after, Li Moying was carried to his residence in Amethyst Paramount Palace.","As the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, he occupies one of the best place in the Amethyst Paramount Palace. Not only is it gorgeously decorated, but it is also the most abundant place in the entire Cloudy Qilin Continent. There is also a gathering spirit array in the room to further gather profound energy.","Therefore, the concentration of profound energy in this room is several times higher than that in the outside world.","Li Moying was lying motionless at first, but when he entered this room, he suddenly trembled all over, his face showed obvious pain, his eyebrows were tightly furrowed, and the cold sweat on his body became more intense.","Li Shihong suddenly became nervous, “This... Doctor Zhang, come and take a look, what’s going on here??”","The old man from just now caught up quickly, and probed Li Moying’s meridians again, as a look of bewilderment appeared on his face."]},{"number":3569,"title":"Chapter 3569 Hurt Strangely (3)","paragraphs":["3569 Hurt Strangely (3)","“This... I really don’t understand! There is no change in his body, why is he in such pain all of a sudden? It’s really hard to understand...”","Li Shihong was so anxious that he bellowed at them, “Can you stop saying í don’t understand’! As a doctor, if even you don’t understand, who else can save Moying? Can’t you think of a way? Could it be that you are all just casually shirking responsibility?”","All the doctors were shocked and cried out injustice.","“Patriarch, we’ve really been wronged! It’s not that we are unwilling to contribute, it’s because the Young Master’s injury is simply out of the ordinary!”","“That’s right, Patriarch. Just now, the old man checked the Young Master’s pulse again. I didn’t feel any signs of aggravation of his injury. I really don’t understand why he suddenly seemed to be in more pain!”","Li Shihong was even more speechless, and flicked his sleeves, “Whether you are wronged or not, quickly find a way for me! If you can’t cure the Young Master, you will stay here forever, and don’t even think about going back!”","Seeing that the Patriarch was really angry, the doctors didn’t dare to say anything, and quickly surrounded Li Moying again.","Li Shihong waited on the side for a long time. He saw that the doctors were checking the pulse and examining again and again. Some even took out golden needles, but couldn’t see any effect.","Seeing that Li Moying’s suffering seemed to have intensified, Li Shihong was full of anxiety and almost lost his temper again.","At this moment, Li Yuntao came over and whispered in his ear: “Patriarch, this subordinate has an idea...”","“What do you think? Say it!”","Li Yuntao said in a low voice: “This subordinate thinks that the Young Master’s room is not suitable, perhaps this was what worsened Young Master’s condition?”","Li Shihong was startled, “What do you mean?”","Li Yuntao said: “When I brought Young Master back, there was no time to think further. All I wanted to do was to return to the Amethyst Paramount Hall as soon as possible, but at that time, the Young Master’s condition was very stable. It was not as bad, the injury worsened only after entering this room.”","Li Shihong recalled the situation at that time and found that it was indeed the case.","“But what’s going on here? Moying’s room has the strongest profound energy in the world, and it’s the best for healing injuries. Why is it like this?” He frowned.","For cultivators, the body’s own recovery ability was very strong. If supplied with a large amount of heaven and earth profound energy, it can better stimulate the body’s potential and help them recover.","Li Moying’s room should be very suitable for recuperating. Because of this, no one thought of it at first.","Li Yuntao shook his head, “This... this subordinate doesn’t understand either, but why don’t we let the Young Master change the room and give it a try!”","“Alright, then let’s bring him to the bamboo house in the back mountain first!”","The bamboo house was located on the edge of the Amethyst Paramount Hall, and behind it was a large medicinal field. It can be said to be the most secluded corner in the entire Palace.","After being carried to this room, Li Moying immediately seemed to relax a lot. Although his face was still a little red, the tightened furrowed brows had eased a lot.","Only then did Li Shihong heave a sigh of relief.","However, he was still puzzled.","Several doctors were already under pressure because they couldn’t diagnose the cause of Li Moying’s coma. Now that the Patriarch has been watching them all, they are all sweating, and their actions and words are even more flustered.","Li Yuntao saw this, and walked up to Li Shihong, “Patriarch, shall we go out and wait for the result?”"]},{"number":3570,"title":"Chapter 3570 Hurt Strangely (4)","paragraphs":["3570 Hurt Strangely (4)","Li Shihong looked anxiously at those doctors, then at Li Yuntao, and finally gritted his teeth.","“Just right, I haven’t asked you in detail what Moying was like when he was injured!”","Li Shihong followed Li Yuntao out of the room, and couldn’t wait to ask, “Tell me carefully, how did Moying provoke Huang Sanbai?”","“This...” Li Yuntao hesitated for a moment, and said hesitantly, “I don’t know what’s going on. The Young Master took a few guards and left Medial Arch City secretly without telling his subordinates. He went directly to a remote place in Forest Shade Town. The subordinates speculated that he should have found out that there was an ancient secret realm nearby, so he went there.”","After hearing this, Li Shihong couldn’t help sighing: “Oh, this kid is just too wilfull! It’s reckless to do such a thing! Even if he wants to practice, he should tell you and let you protect him secretly! Such a thing will not have happened!”","“Young Master is still young. Besides, true geniuses must grow up through dangerous trials. He has the heart to experience, so it can’t be said to be a bad thing.” Li Yuntao said quickly.","However, only he himself knows that Li Moying didn’t tell him not just to be able to hone himself, the bigger reason is for his wife who ascended from the lower realm!","Among the people Li Leyun brought back this time was not that little girl, and he didn’t know how to deal with it. This matter was exactly what Li Yuntao wanted, so although he knew that there was something weird about it, he didn’t expose it at all. He even deliberately concealed the fact that Huang Yueli was there when Li Moying was injured.","Li Shihong did not doubt his rhetoric at all.","Because Li Moying’s personality is like this, after this year, most people in the clan have already understood it.","So, he turned to ask the next more important question: “Then how did Huang Sanbai end up fighting with Moying? Could it be that the Holy Phoenix Clan also discovered that secret realm, and the two sides fought for the treasure?”","“This... This subordinate is not sure.” Li Yuntao said while thinking: “Miss Le Yun first discovered that the Young Master left Medial Arch City, and she also noticed Huang Sanbai and the others, because she was worried about Young Master’s safety hence she came to inform me and Yuntao. When we learned about it, we immediately chased after him. When we arrived at the scene, Huang Sanbai had already injured the Young Master. If we were one step late, the Young Master would have suffered that from the murderous hand of that old thief!”","“They are simply incorrigible!”","After hearing this, Li Shihong was so angry that he slapped the nearest pillar heavily!","A pillar that could only be embraced by two people was shattered by his blow!","Li Yuntao quickly persuaded: “Patriarch, please calm down!”","Li Shihong was so angry that his chest kept heaving, “From what you said, I’m afraid the two really had a dispute over treasures! These bastards of the Holy Phoenix Clan are simply audacious now, completely ignoring the agreements between the major god clans! Maybe he deliberately found an excuse to simply try to get rid of the god-level genius of our Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","Li Shihong’s face flushed with anger.","Seeing this, Li Yuntao didn’t dare to persuade him anymore, so he could only bow his head and stand aside.","He didn’t dare to intervene easily on such a topic about the grievances between the two great god clans.","However, he also agreed with Li Shihong’s judgment. Who would believe that Huang Sanbai didn’t deal such a poisonous hand at such a moment without any hidden intention?"]},{"number":3571,"title":"Chapter 3571 Strangely Hurt (5)","paragraphs":["3571 Strangely Hurt (5)","Moreover, Huang Sanbai chose to kill Li Moying near the secret realm obviously out of bad intentions.","This time, if Li Yuntao and the others hadn’t retaliated and beat him into a sorry state, no one would have known about Li Moying’s death at all. Even if the incident happened, Huang Sanbai would have enough reasons to deny all allegations!","After all, there are many crises in the secret realm, and the symptoms in Li Moying’s body are so strange, who can tell clearly how he died?","While the two were talking, several doctors came out again.","The oldest Doctor Zhang came up to report: “Patriarch, we have really tried our best, but the Young Master’s injury...”","“What’s wrong with the Young Master’s injury? Is there nothing you can do??”","“This... so far, we haven’t found a cure, but we have some guesses about the Young Master’s injury...”","“What guess? Say it quickly!” Li Shihong urged impatiently.","Doctor Zhang hurriedly said: “The Young Master’s symptoms are definitely not caused by injuries! We speculate that if the Young Master is not seriously injured but unconscious, either he was poisoned, or someone used some special skills to open the meridians... and did something to it.”","“Poisoned? What kind of poison has he been poisoned by? Special skills... what skill exactly?”","“This...we don’t know yet...”","“I don’t know? How could it be possible that we don’t know? Our Cloudy Qilin Clan has been passed down for millions of years, and we can’t even identify a single poison or skill?”","“This... the situation of the Young Master is indeed very strange! Besides, Huang Sanbai is an elder of the Holy Phoenix Clan. He is already more than a thousand years old this year. His knowledge will definitely not be less than ours. It is hard to say where he found this unfathomable poison...”","Hearing such evasive words, Li Shihong was furious, but he couldn’t say that Doctor Zhang was wrong!","Just like what he said, if Huang Sanbai really intended to murder Li Moying, he must have come prepared. It’s normal to have a potent poison on his body.","He stared at several doctors, “Then tell me, what should we do with this matter! How long will it take you to determine the specific reason for Young Master’s coma?”","The doctors said one after another: “This is really uncertain...”","Seeing that Li Shihong was about to get angry again, Doctor Zhang said cautiously: “Patriarch, I think it’s best for the clan to come forward and negotiate with the Holy Phoenix Clan. It’s best to find Huang Sanbai, and let him take the initiative to explain what happened to the Young Master and let us know what kind of poison he has administered! If possible, it would be better to let him hand over the antidote! This is much better than us pondering like headless chickens...”","Li Shihong frowned. Although he was dissatisfied with the performance of several doctors, he had to admit that this was the correct way of thinking.","He called Li Yuntao over and handed over the matter to him.","“Yuntao, you saw Huang Sanbai attacking someone with your own eyes at that time, so you will be in charge of this matter! On behalf of me, put pressure on the Holy Phoenix Clan and make them hand over Huang Sanbai! ”","“Yes! This subordinate obeys the order!” Li Yuntao immediately went to carry out his order.","Li Shihong stayed in the bamboo house for a while more and only after seeing that it was really impossible for Li Moying to wake up in a short time did he leave. Before he left, he had to repeatedly order the doctors to guard Li Moying carefully, and report to him no matter what happened.","“I want to see what Huang Tianhao, that insidious and cunning person, would say! This matter... Hmph! We’ll wait and see!”"]},{"number":3572,"title":"Chapter 3572 Strangely Hurt (6)","paragraphs":["3572 Strangely Hurt (6)","The secret realm of Saint Iniquitous Shadow.","Huang Yueli was still in the process of cultivating the new inherited skills.","At the beginning, she cultivated with the mindset to just be able to get back to action as soon as possible. With the sole intention to quickly leave to find Li Moying, she persevered on but as she delved deeper and deeper into her cultivation, she gradually felt that Saint Iniquitous Shadow was indeed worthy of being a peerless figure that appears once in ten thousand years in the God Realm. What he had created was broad and profound, and it was more effective than all the martial and profound skills she has ever cultivated before.","The evil qi in her body was gradually transforming into her own profound energy under the circulation of this new skill.","!!","Moreover, it wasn’t just her profound energy that increased.","The golden characters kept flashing in her mind which deeply stirred her consciousness, and made her comprehension of conception improve by leaps and bounds as she felt a sudden enlightenment.","Such a chance of enlightenment was more than what she comprehended through the conception drawing. It was not even limited to the fire attribute itself. The conception contained in the golden characters belongs to the origin of heaven and earth, one that harnessed all attributes.","Although Huang Yueli’s talent was best displayed in the fire attribute talent, and her improvement was the fastest, but in the process, she also gained some understanding of the conception of other attributes.","Although these comprehensions do not help her improve her cultivation, they could play a great role in actual combat.","When Huang Yueli’s dantian was filled with profound energy, and her conception reached a higher level, advancement became a matter of course.","On the third day of cultivating, Huang Yueli steadily advanced to the eighth level of the Dream Profound Realm.","On the tenth day, she had rushed into the ninth level.","As long as she advanced one more time, she will be able to become a cultivator in the Heart Profound Realm.","A person in the Heart Profound Realm who was less than twenty years old was unprecedented in the God Realm.","Huang Yueli was immersed in her cultivation, so she didn’t feel anything, but Saint Iniquitous Shadow who had been protecting her from the side looking at her incredulously!","This was the real peerless genius!","It was a very honorable thing to be able to help her reach the peak and become one of her masters.","However, after Huang Yueli cultivated for a few more days, her progress was no longer so obvious.","From the ninth level of the Dream Profound Realm to the early stage of the Heart Profound Realm, it seems that there was not much difference, but it was indeed a big leap.","For the vast majority of cultivators in the God Realm, this was a huge bottleneck, even an insurmountable moat!","More than 90% of cultivators will never be able to break through to the Heart Profound Realm in their lifetime, and can only stay at the ninth level of the Dream Profound Realm.","Of course, for a genius like Huang Yueli, it was impossible to really get stuck here, but it would take a certain amount of effort to pass this limit.","Huang Yueli was so absorbed in her cultivation that she completely forgot where she was.","In fact, she had been able to move since the first time she advanced, but she didn’t move at all!","Saint Iniquitous Shadow looked at her focused face, and a satisfied smile appeared at the corner of his mouth.","“Not only is she gifted and savvy, but she can also concentrate on cultivation without any distractions. Such a genius...is really rare to meet! If so, let me help you again!”","Saying that, Saint Iniquitous Shadow suddenly raised his hand, and swung his palm down heavily!","——It actually hit himself in the chest!","Receiving a blow with the power of the Life Profound Realm, he himself couldn’t bear it and immediately spat out a mouthful of blood!","However, once his blood touched the air, it instantly turned into a black mist."]},{"number":3573,"title":"Chapter 3573 Stick To One’s Word (1)","paragraphs":["3573 Stick To One’s Word (1)","The black mist was exactly the same as what Huang Yueli and the others saw at the entrance of the secret realm before, it was the evil qi that was so dense that it had manifested into a black mass.","These evil qi slowly drifted toward Huang Yueli, and the moment they touched her skin, they penetrated into her body.","After being invaded by these new evil qi, Huang Yueli’s body shook suddenly!","But immediately after, the speed of transforming evil qi in her body also began to increase rapidly. The mixture of evil qi and profound energy circulated continuously in her body, helping her break through the threshold as she entered the Heart Profound Realm!","!!","Seeing this, Saint Iniquitous Shadow smiled even deeper, and lightly clenched his fists.","“I hope...you don’t let me down...”","...","Empyrean Fox Continent, Medial Arch City.","As an important stronghold of the Allied Armies, it is also the Empyrean Fox clan, which has a good relationship with the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Holy Phoenix Clan.","The Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, Li Moying, a god-level genius, was attacked by Huang Sanbai, the elder of the Holy Phoenix Clan, causing serious injuries and is still in a coma.","This incident has become the most shocking gossip news in the God Realm. In just a dozen days, it has spread to every corner of the God Realm, and it has become the topic of conversation for everyone after dinner.","And this high-level negotiation between the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Holy Phoenix Clan also attracted the attention of all the various god clans.","Although the Twelve God Clans signed an agreement tens of thousands of years ago, they no longer fought with each other, but united and led the clans to fight against the devils.","Moreover, each and everyone had their own little calculations, so they were naturally very interested in this negotiation.","However, both the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Holy Phoenix Clan rejected the request of the other God Clans to act as peacemakers.","On the day of the negotiation, apart from the host, the Patriarch of the Empyrean Fox Clan, no one else showed up.","“Patriarch Huang, Patriarch Li, both of them are my old friends, and we haven’t seen each other for more than ten years! This reunion of old friends really makes me very happy, and it’s worth getting drunk together!”","Lan Yuanzhen, the Patriarch of the Empyrean Fox Clan, was really a well-rounded person. He is called “Old Fox” by people in the God Realm. Seeing the two clansmen meet, they glared at each other as if they had eaten gunpowder, wishing to rush up and fight on the spot. He came out and said a few words, trying to smooth things over.","He can be regarded as one of the top powerhouses in the God Realm, his status is comparable to that of Huang Tianhao and Li Shihong, and they usually give him a lot of face.","But now, when he spoke, neither of them seemed to hear him.","Not only were they still confronting each other, but the atmosphere was obviously becoming more and more tense.","“Cough cough, Brother Huang, Brother Li! You two have travelled a long distance, and you must be very tired. I have already arranged a quiet place for you, you two might as well take a rest first, and negotiate things tomorrow...”","Before Lan Yuanzhen finished speaking, Li Shihong couldn’t bear it anymore.","He glared at Huang Tianhao, his voice was full of anger, “Huang Tianhao! Where’s Huang Sanbai? Hand over that old man to me!”","Li Shihong himself is a master at the peak of the Dao Profound Realm, and he is only one step away from the Life Profound Realm. When he glared at him, the coercion he exuded was enough to make people tremble and not stand steadily!","However, this was of no use to Huang Tianhao."]},{"number":3574,"title":"Chapter 3574 Stick To One’s Word (2)","paragraphs":["3574 Stick To One’s Word (2)","The cultivation bases of the two Patriarchs were originally equal to each other, besides, on such an occasion, Huang Tianhao would never show weakness!","The two glared at each other, and the elders behind them couldn’t help scolding each other.","“Where’s Huang Sanbai? Hurry up and hand over that old bastard!”","“Bah! Why? Who do you think you are?Moreover, you are from the Cloudy Qilin Clan? If you want us to hand over and we’ll just hand him over?”","!!","“Huang Sanbai, get out! You dared to attempt to murder our Young Master, but now you don’t have the guts to admit it?”","“Are you asking for a beating? How dare you insult the elders of our clan like this!”","“What’s wrong with scolding him? It’s obvious that you hurt others first!”","“Let’s hurt people first? You know what you Cloudy Qilin Clan did secretly!”","Both sides insisted on their own opinions, and soon quarrelled with each other.","Lan Yuanzhen was listening on the sidelines, suffering from a headache, and could not help but secretly groan in his heart.","Originally, he thought that accepting the entrustment from the two great God Clans would not only make the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Holy Phoenix Clan owe him a favour, but also be the first to know the truth about the conflict between the two great clans. Unexpectedly, this was really a chore!","If the current development continues, the two clans will inevitably fight on the territory of the Empyrean Fox Clan!","Seeing that the two sides were really going to fight, Lan Yuanzhen couldn’t care about anything else, so he rushed into the crowd with a stride, and just stopped between Huang Tianhao and Li Shihong.","The two Patriarchs had already started mobilising their profound energy and were about to make a move. Suddenly seeing Lan Yuanzhen rushing out regardless of safety, they could only stop abruptly.","“Patriarch Lan, please get out of the way!”","“Patriarch Lan, this is a grievance between our two clans, and it has nothing to do with you!”","Li Shihong and Huang Tianhao spoke at the same time, they didn’t even look at Lan Yuanzhen, they still stared fiercely at each other.","Lan Yuanzhen said helplessly: “Brother Li, Brother Huang, don’t embarrass me! You all promised me before that you would never do anything in Empyrean Fox Continent, so I agreed to be the middleman, why? Are you going to regret it?”","Only then did the two Patriarchs think of this, and their faces froze immediately.","Then, both of them snorted coldly at the same time, and took a few steps back.","“Patriarch Lan, then I will give you this face and let these bastards live a few more days!” Li Shihong sneered.","“Li Shihong, what do you mean? Do you really think that the Holy Phoenix Clan is afraid of you?” Huang Tianhao’s anger immediately surged up again when he heard this!","Lan Yuanzhen pressed his forehead with a headache, “Two Patriarchs, please be quiet and don’t be impatient. If you have anything to say, let’s talk about it tomorrow...”","“No, we can’t talk about it tomorrow! I’m going to find out old man Huang Sanbai today!”","Li Shihong’s face was gloomy, and he cut Lan Yuanzhen’s words decisively, “It’s not that I don’t give you face, brother Lan, but... Moying’s injury can’t be delayed any longer! That old thief Huang Sanbai, I don’t know how to give Moying any face.” What kind of poison did he administer? It’s too vicious, Moying has been in a coma for more than a month, and he still hasn’t woken up!”","Li Shihong was really in a hurry.","Although the doctors of the Holy Phoenix Clan judged that it was Huang Sanbai who poisoned Li Moying, Li Shihong didn’t plan to come to the Holy Phoenix Clan to ask for the antidote at first, and the trouble became known all over the world!","Li Moying is the pride of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and the hope of the future. His life and death was uncertain, and how many forces were secretly gloating!","Therefore, at the very beginning, Li Shihong still placed his hopes on the medical skills of the clan doctors."]},{"number":3575,"title":"Chapter 3575 Stick To One’s Word (3)","paragraphs":["3575 Stick To One’s Word (3)","However, even though all the doctors in the clan were grandmasters from the Heaven Elixir Pagoda, they were helpless against Li Moying’s injury.","As a last resort, Li Shihong had no choice but to secretly seek out famous doctors in the God Realm, all grandmaster-level doctors who had a little friendship with the Cloudy Qilin Clan were invited to treat Li Moying.","The result disappointed him greatly.","Not only has no one been able to find a way to detoxify, but because some foreign doctors are not tight-lipped, they even spread the news of Li Moying’s serious injury.","!!","This kind of news spread the fastest, and it didn’t take long for everyone to know about it.","When Li Shihong heard the news, he almost fainted on the spot!","However, since the news had leaked out, he no longer had any qualms. He simply denounced the shameless behaviour of the Holy Phoenix Clan and asked Huang Tianhao to negotiate in person.","When Huang Tianhao heard Li Shihong’s words, he also knew that he was very anxious now.","However, not only did he not empathise with him, but he even laughed triumphantly, “Li Moying hasn’t woken up yet? Tsk tsk, it’s really not going to work, right? You really deserve it!”","“What did you say??” Li Shihong was already very angry, but being fueled by Huang Tianhao, his anger became even more intense.","However, Huang Tianhao was not affected by his aggressive appearance at all, and sneered again, “Li Moying will have today, I’m afraid it really is retribution!”","Li Shihong’s eyes gradually turned cold, “It seems that I guessed right! This incident was not an accident caused by a secret treasure hunt at all, and Huang Sanbai himself did not have the guts to plot against our god-level genius. Your Holy Phoenix Clan’s secret plan is to get rid of the god-level genius of our Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","Li Shihong’s voice was cold and hard, but every word he uttered was enough to make people shudder.","Lan Yuanzhen was listening on the sidelines, he had already forgotten about the matter of persuading the fight, and was so overwhelmed by Li Shihong’s words that he couldn’t even speak!","A genius who murdered other God Clan’s...","This is something that was clearly prohibited in the agreement signed by the twelve ancient gods, and it is the most criticised thing!","A peerless genius is the hope of the clan, and it is also the factor that is most likely to cause conflicts among the major families.","In order to alleviate the conflicts caused by the struggle between geniuses, the agreement stipulates that the twelve great god races must treat all the geniuses of the god race and the human race equally and cultivate them together.","In fact, this is of course very difficult to do. All races must have selfishness towards their own geniuses. However, on the surface, no one will show their jealousy and hatred for other God Clan geniuses. Such assassination of foreign geniuses is even more important. It hasn’t happened in tens of thousands of years!","Lan Yuanzhen held his breath, his gaze wandering back and forth between Li Shihong and Huang Tianhao.","If things are really as Li Shihong said, then the Holy Phoenix Clan will become the object of boycott by all the God Clan!","Huang Tianhao sneered when he heard Li Shihong’s accusation.","“Yes, you guessed it right! It is the wish of all members of our Holy Phoenix Clan to kill the scourge of Li Moying!”","Admitted!","Huang Tianhao actually... admitted it!","Lan Yuanzhen couldn’t believe what he heard.","Li Shihong was even more shocked, trembling with anger, “You... you... how dare you do such a thing! This is a violation of the God Clan agreement! You actually dare to blatantly commit such crimes, you are waiting to become the public enemy of all God Clans!”","Although he had already guessed, Li Shihong never expected that Huang Tianhao would admit it directly!"]},{"number":3576,"title":"Chapter 3576 Stick To One’s Word (4)","paragraphs":["3576 Stick To One’s Word (4)","He admitted this, but it was tantamount to pleading guilty.","At that time, the other eleven great god clans will put pressure on the Holy Phoenix Clan together, and the Holy Phoenix Clan will not be able to bear such pressure at all!","Li Shihong originally thought that although this matter was definitely a conspiracy of the Holy Phoenix Clan, it was absolutely impossible for the other party to admit it, and the two sides would definitely have to argue for a long time on this issue.","Who knew that the other party would admit it so readily!","How dare they be so arrogant?","Could it be that the Holy Phoenix Clan has anything else to rely on?","Thinking of this, Li Shihong looked suspiciously at Huang Tianhao, and as expected, he saw a gloomy and calculating look in the other’s eyes.","Huang Tianhao took a step forward and said loudly: “Since Patriarch Lan is here, let’s explain it right now! Let Patriarch Lan judge and judge, who is right and who is wrong!”","Li Shihong frowned, and the ominous premonition in his heart became more obvious.","“What do you mean? You have already admitted just now that you deliberately attempted to murder our clan’s god level genius. What else do you have to say?”","“What do I have to say?” Huang Tianhao glanced at everyone in the Cloudy Qilin Clan disdainfully, “Don’t play dumb for me! Li Moying first assassinated the god-level genius of our Holy Phoenix clan. Clan seniors, don’t you know? It’s clear that you Cloudy Qilin Clan used their brains first and used such low-handed means to kill our genius! We had no choice but to take revenge with an eye for an eye!”","“What... what??”","“How can that be?”","On the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s side, from Li Shihong to several elders, they never expected such a thing to happen, and they all looked shocked!","However, the members of the Holy Phoenix Clan had long believed that they were pretending to be stupid, and they all looked at each other with resentment. If Huang Tianhao hadn’t stopped them, they couldn’t help but rush forward and tear the enemy apart.","Lan Yuanzhen was even more scorched by this thunderbolt.","He knew that he would definitely hear some secrets today.","But I didn’t expect to hear such shocking secrets twice in a row!","Not only did the Holy Phoenix Clan assassinate the god-level genius of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, but the Cloudy Qilin Clan also killed the Holy Phoenix Clan’s god-level genius? Moreover, Li Moying of the Cloudy Qilin Clan did it himself!","Lan Yuanzhen wouldn’t even have dared to think about these words if he hadn’t heard them with his own ears!","However, Li Shihong behaved more like a normal person than Huang Tianhao before.","After being stunned for a moment, he came back to his senses again, and immediately denied it: “Impossible, this is absolutely impossible! We did find out that there might be a god-level genius in the Holy Phoenix Clan, but no one has even seen the person, and I haven’t verified the authenticity of the matter, so how could it be possible to kill that person?”","After Lan Yuanzhen heard this, he also said: “Patriarch Huang, this matter... Is there any misunderstanding? When did the nobleman produce a god-level genius? We, the Empyrean Fox Clan, have never heard of it. What about the news! Come to think of it, the Cloudy Qilin Clan may not know about it... Isn’t it a bit arbitrary when you say that? Is there any evidence?”","Before today, Lan Yuanzhen was really not sure if there were any god-level geniuses in the Holy Phoenix Clan.","The rumours did circulate outside but after a few days, there was no other news. Moreover, the so-called god-level genius of the Holy Phoenix Clan did not appear in front of everyone like Li Moying, let alone made any splash. He had long believed that the feat of killing the powerful devil was a rumour."]},{"number":3577,"title":"Chapter 3577 Stick To One’s Word (5)","paragraphs":["3577 Stick To One’s Word (5)","Only now did Lan Yuanzhen realise that the rumour was actually true!","In this way, it’s no wonder that there are only rumours from the Holy Phoenix Clan, but no one has seen that god-level genius. It turns out that the other party was killed by Li Moying just after arriving in the God Realm!","Lan Yuanzhen had made such an assumption, which others would also think about.","Especially the elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, they immediately remembered that when the clan first learned that the Holy Phoenix Clan had produced a god-level genius, the Patriarch specially called all the high-level officials to discuss the matter.","At that time, the clan sent people to Soul Connection Ocean to inquire about the god-level genius of the Holy Phoenix clan!","And the person who was sent... was Li Moying!","Moreover, since Li Moying left Amethyst Paramount Palace that day, he has never returned to Cloudy Qilin Continent. No one knows whether he has seen the god-level genius of the Holy Phoenix Clan, let alone what he did after he left or something happened after he left.","Thinking of this, several members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan lowered their heads, feeling a little guilty for no reason.","Although, they all thought that, judging from Li Moying’s usual behaviour, he was arrogant and arrogant, and it was unlikely that he would do such a dirty thing, but, after all, people’s hearts are far away, so who can say for sure?","Li Moying has only been in the God Realm for more than a year, and she didn’t grow up in the clan.","Li Shihong also thought of this, and his expression changed several times quickly.","However, he is the Patriarch after all, and he has a very clear mind, knowing that no matter what the truth of the matter is, they absolutely cannot admit it!","Once admitted, it will be their Cloudy Qilin Clan who are unlucky!","He immediately said in a cold voice: “Huang Tianhao, I know that your Holy Phoenix Clan is shameless enough, but I didn’t expect that you would be so shameless! Knowing that you can’t deny the fact that you murdered our genius, you actually made up such a lie? Aren’t you just bullying Moying, who is now in a coma in bed, unable to wake up and confront you?”","Huang Tianhao sneered disdainfully, “Our Holy Phoenix Clan has always been upright, so why do we need to do such a thing? Li Moying assassinated our genius, this is what Elder Huang Sanbai saw with his own eyes! Elder Sanbai, what did you go through at that time? Tell the truth, and see how they deny it!”","As soon as Huang Tianhao finished speaking, Huang Sanbai walked in from the back door of the room.","In fact, he had already arrived at the door, but for his safety, Huang Tianhao asked him to wait outside the door, and only let him appear at the critical moment.","Huang Sanbai walked behind Huang Tianhao, before he could speak, two lines of tears had already flowed down.","He choked up and said: “Patriarch, please... Please, please be sure to seek justice for Young Miss Li! This little thief, Li Moying, deserves to die! He not only killed Young Miss Li, but even my sister Elder Shuangyu, Elder Zhao also died at his hands!”","An old man with white beard and hair, a master who has been famous for a long time, was devastated in front of so many people.","For a while, Lan Yuanzhen felt a little moved, and before Huang Sanbai started to testify, his heart was already biased towards him.","Huang Tianhao was even more angry and sad, “Elder Sanbai, don’t be sad, tell them the truth!”","“Yes!”","Huang Sanbai lowered his head slightly, covering the darkness in his eyes, “Half a year ago, our clan sensed that there was a possibility of a god-level genius in the lower realm who was about to ascend. When I met Young Miss Li, she did have a god-level talent!”"]},{"number":3578,"title":"Chapter 3578 Stick To One’s Word (6)","paragraphs":["3578 Stick To One’s Word (6)","Lan Yuanzhen sucked in a mouthful of cold air as he gasped.","Huang Sanbai’s words positively verified the rumours about the god-level genius of the Holy Phoenix Clan.","Huang Sanbai continued, “The old man was afraid of delaying time, so he personally escorted her to return early on Azure Luan. But who knows, it was such a hasty decision by the old man, but...it killed Young Miss Li!”","When he said this, he began to choke up again.","!!","Huang Tianhao was furious, but seeing the elders in the clan so sad, he couldn’t help comforting him: “Elder Sanbai, don’t blame yourself so much! You are also thinking about the clan, if you want to blame this matter, you can only blame Li Moying, that lowly bastard! He wants to harm people, and you can’t guard against him!”","Huang Sanbai had a sad look on his face, but he was about to laugh out loud in his heart.","Originally, he failed to attack Li Moying this time, and was rescued by the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. He thought that the things he did must not be hidden!","When the truth is revealed, he will definitely die without a place to bury him!","For this reason, Huang Sanbai has been wandering around in anxiety, not daring to return to Sacred Phoenix Continent.","But who would have thought that, as time passed day by day, what he was worried about did not happen at all!","Li Moying didn’t know what happened, but he was poisoned by a strange poison, and he is still unconscious until now. Moreover, judging from the anxious appearance of everyone in the Cloudy Qilin Clan, he was likely to die because of it!","Moreover, the guards around Li Moying are said to be seriously injured, two of them have already died!","After hearing the news, Huang Sanbai couldn’t help but smile from ear to ear.","God is on his side!","He is the final winner after all!","Hearing that the Holy Phoenix Clan and the Cloudy Qilin Clan were going to negotiate in Medial Arch City, Huang Sanbai came here on purpose last night just to pour dirty water on Li Moying again.","Anyway, Huang Yueli probably died, and Li Moying seemed to be dying too...","No one will ever know about the crimes he committed!","It was impossible for Li Moying to stand up and defend himself.","He was proud of himself, but he didn’t show it at all on his face.","Huang Sanbai raised his sleeves, wiped the tears from the corners of his eyes, and said, “Patriarch, although you and the other elders are magnanimous, this old man is still to blame...”","Seeing Lan Yuanzhen’s questioning gaze, he quickly continued to explain.","“The old man and Young Miss Li walked halfway to a deserted riverside. We wanted to take a rest, but Li Moying had already spotted us. Taking advantage of the darkness, he first killed Azure Luan, and then hurt Young Miss Li again!”","“The old man lives with Young Miss Li in the tent beside hers. When I heard something strange and rushed over, it was too late. Li Moying had already led someone to hold Young Miss Li hostage and was about to leave. I chased after him and fought hard against him. Although he was defeated, he had already severely injured Young Miss Li, and even threw her from the airship that had flown high into the sky!”","Having said that, he paused again, as if he was suppressing the grief and indignation in his heart.","“Li Moying is... so mad! The old man didn’t care about chasing him, so he turned his head and wanted to rescue Young Miss Li first, but he couldn’t find it after several searches. The place where Young Miss Li fell is a wild place, maybe it’s true... ...real...”","Huang Tianhao had obviously heard it countless times.","Just when Huang Sanbai was busy pretending to cry, he turned to Li Shihong with a pale face."]},{"number":3579,"title":"Chapter 3579 Stick To One’s Word (7)","paragraphs":["3579 Stick To One’s Word (7)","“Patriarch Li, have you heard Elder Sanbai’s words? The majestic Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, actually did such a thing! It is simply a disgrace to the entire God Realm, and he deserves to die!”","After Huang Tianhao died, the elders of the Holy Phoenix Clan were all inexplicably sad and angry.","“That’s right, Li Moying deserves death!”","“It was he who murdered our god-level genius first, and now it’s just letting him pay back his life, which is as it should be!”","“Even if Li Moying is dead, it can’t cover up the shamelessness of your Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","“I really admire you, Cloudy Qilin Clan. You actually have the face to accuse our Holy Phoenix Clan of harming people? Hmph! Why don’t you take care of yourselves!”","The elders of the Holy Phoenix Clan were all deceived by Huang Sanbai. The anger was definitely from the bottom of their hearts. The more they talked, the more excited they became, and they were about to fight again.","Lan Yuanzhen hastily stepped forward to stop him, “Elders, please calm down! The truth of the matter has not yet been determined, so let’s listen to what Patriarch Li said...”","“Listen to what he said? It is absolutely impossible to admit that a shameless person like Li Moying is the future heir. They are clearly the same as birds of a feather!”","Huang Sanbai was afraid that everyone would calm down, so he quickly poured another spoonful of oil on the fire.","Hearing this, Huang Tianhao immediately looked at Li Shihong, “How is it? Li Shihong, what else do you have to say?”","Listening to Huang Sanbai’s testimony, Li Shihong’s face became more and more ugly, and his heart gradually sank...","However, Li Moying was cultivated by him alone. He has a much deeper understanding of Li Moying than others. Although he hasn’t been in contact with him for long enough, he believes that Li Moying was definitely not such a person!","If he didn’t believe in Li Moying’s character, he wouldn’t have recognized Li Moying as the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan in such a short period of time!","To sit in this position, talent alone is definitely not enough.","Li Shihong’s thoughts turned, he looked straight at Huang Tianhao without fear, and snorted coldly, “Dare to ask Patriarch Huang, apart from the testimony of the old man Huang Sanbai, what evidence do you have?”","Huang Tianhao was startled.","Huang Sanbai stood up and glared at Li Shihong with an expression of being greatly insulted.","“This old man guarantees with his own reputation that everything he said before is true! This is the evidence!”","Hearing this, Li Shihong snorted coldly with disdain: “Who wouldn’t swear? So, you are the only witness in this matter? Just based on your empty words, you want to slander the Young Master of our Cloudy Qilin Clan and kill him? Then I also want to say that this matter was clearly fabricated by you Cloudy Qilin Clan, in order to cover up your dark purpose of assassinating Li Moying! In my opinion, you just want to pour dirty water on him while Moying is unconscious, in fact, you don’t have any god-level geniuses at all!”","Hearing Li Shihong’s words, the elders behind him also reacted.","It is true that not all of these elders are like Li Shihong and believe that Li Moying is innocent, but when it comes to such an occasion, everyone knows what they should say.","“That’s right, the intentions of your Holy Phoenix Clan are really sinister enough!”","“He fabricated a god-level genius out of thin air, just to push the responsibility onto our Young Master!”","“Huang Sanbai, you old man, you dare to use your reputation as a guarantee, bah! How much is your reputation worth for the bastards of the Holy Phoenix clan?”","Everyone spoke in unison, and turned their spearhead to the Holy Phoenix Clan."]},{"number":3580,"title":"Chapter 3580 Stick To One’s Word (8)","paragraphs":["3580 Stick To One’s Word (8)","Huang Sanbai’s face was flushed red, and he pointed at the other party, his hands trembling a little.","“You...don’t make any blatant accusations! Our Sacred Phoenix Clan has god-level genius, and I am not the only one who has met her! Moreover, it’s not only our clansmen who have seen Li Moying at the Sea of Soul Connection Ocean, even the steward of Soul Connection Ocean can also prove this point!”","Li Shihong said unhurriedly: “What can that prove? Li Moying has indeed been to Soul Connection Ocean, but having been there does not mean that he killed someone! If you can’t find evidence, don’t bite around like a mad dog!”","“You...you are really going to deny it to the end, right?” Huang Tianhao was furious!","“This is not denial, but that it cannot be slandered by others! Moying will never do such a thing! In my opinion, it wasn’t Huang Sanbai who killed your god-level genius himself, but blamed Moying. It was you, the Holy Phoenix Clan, who colluded together to kill Moying first and then planted the blame on him!” Li Shihong sneered, and quickly had an idea in his mind.","The elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan also joined in.","Speaking of which, these two were indeed the most likely reasons.","However, both Li Shihong and the elders believe that the possibility of Huang Sanbai killing someone was very low. The most likely thing is that the Holy Phoenix Clan intentionally framed it!","When Huang Sanbai heard Li Shihong’s analysis, a cold light suddenly flashed in his eyes.","He did not expect that Li Shihong’s guess was so accurate.","However, this is nothing to worry about, because the Holy Phoenix Clan has preconceived ideas, and no one will listen to Li Shihong’s words.","Sure enough, the members of the Holy Phoenix Clan believed in Huang Sanbai and believed that the Cloudy Qilin Clan was treacherous and shameless.","The two sides insisted on their own words, and a new round of scolding started again, and it soon rose to the fighting stage.","Lan Yuanzhen tried his best to stop them.","In desperation, he didn’t care about the etiquette of the host and guest, and directly called all the masters of the Empyrean Fox Clan to fight.","Fortunately, both the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Holy Phoenix Clan sent only five or six representatives, and the number of masters was far less than that of the Empyrean Fox Clan. In this way, they also used some violent means to separate the people on both sides.","Even though they were forcibly pulled away, the elders of the two major God Clans were still yelling at each other, wishing they could pounce on each other and kill each other.","Lan Yuanzhen coughed heavily, “Two Patriarchs, don’t embarrass me as a middleman, alright? Didn’t you say that you should fight? If you really want to argue right and wrong, you can ask the twelve great gods to discuss together according to the agreement. Fighting is not going to solve the problem.”","Li Shihong and Huang Tianhao calmed down for a while, and they both knew that they had caused Lan Yuanzhen trouble.","They could barely suppress the anger in their hearts, and each took their people back to the resting place.","Lan Yuanzhen looked at the backs of both parties leaving, and pressed the throbbing forehead.","“This negotiation will go on for three more days. What should I do next? If I had known, I would not have accepted this hot potato!”","As he spoke, he frowned again, “The Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Holy Phoenix Clan...who told the lie?”","...","Just as the two great god races were arguing endlessly, Huang Yueli had reached the most critical point in her cultivation in the secret realm of Saint Iniquitous Shadow.","At this time, she received the help of Saint Iniquitous Shadow, and the evil qi in her body became more vigorous, constantly impacting on her dantian, and the advancement was coming soon!","He saw that she was about to breakthrough and advance to the Heart Profound Realm!"]},{"number":3581,"title":"Chapter 3581 Huang Yueli Comes Out Of Seclusion (1)","paragraphs":["3581 Huang Yueli Comes Out Of Seclusion (1)","Saint Iniquitous Shadow watched from the side, with a faint smile in his eyes.","But at this moment, he felt a shock outside the secret realm.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow frowned, “It’s really troublesome. If you want to break through the secret realm, it will still cause the vision of heaven and earth. I hope it won’t be too eye-catching!”","Entering the Heart Profound Realm from the peak of the Heart Profound Realm, although there was no need to cross the Heavenly Tribulation, it will also cause drastic changes in the world.","!!","Moreover, the higher the talent of the cultivator, the more obvious the phenomenon will be.","Judging from Huang Yueli’s talent, the visions of heaven and earth she caused should be comparable to ordinary cultivators who advanced to the Dao Profound Realm.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow thought for a while, then moved Huang Yueli out of the underground secret room, let her lie on the grass in the secret realm, and at the same time, opened the entrance to the secret realm a little.","Immediately, the profound energy of heaven and earth gathered above the entrance of the secret realm rushed in frantically towards the secret realm.","The profound energy quickly filled the entire secret realm, and at the same time, quickly invaded Huang Yueli’s body.","Huang Yueli frowned tightly, groaned and felt as if all the meridians in her body were about to explode!","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was also dumbfounded.","He had expected that there would be a lot of profound energy attracted by Huang Yueli’s breakthrough, but there was so much! This simply went beyond his imagination!","Under the impact of such a large amount of energy, Huang Yueli’s body suddenly trembled!","At the same time, a golden light radiated from her chest, illuminating the entire secret realm.","“This little girl...has finally advanced!” Saint Iniquitous Shadow showed a gratified smile on his face, “I just don’t know, how long will it take her to absorb all the profound energy of the world?”","Huang Yueli closed her eyes tightly, folded her hands on her chest, and lay flat motionless.","She could feel that after entering the Heart Profound Realm, her comprehension of the entire fire attribute had entered a new level.","After the nine kinds of fire attribute conceptions were integrated, the law of fire was formed!","Let her not only be able to drive the fire attribute energy contained in the profound energy of heaven and earth, but at the same time, rely on her own comprehension and profound energy to create new fire attribute energy out of thin air!","This was a qualitative leap!","Although she had successfully advanced, Huang Yueli was not feeling very well right now.","She managed to refine part of the evil qi in her body before, but during this advanced stage, Saint Iniquitous Shadow injected evil qi into her body, coupled with the influx of heaven and earth profound energy, causing her to fall into that kind of predicament of her meridians exploding again.","Although her meridians had widened a lot after entering the advanced stage, the feeling of splitting is now more serious than before.","As a last resort, Huang Yueli could only choose to continue cultivating the secret technique of Saint Iniquitous Shadow.","And when she closed her eyes, the golden characters in front of her eyes had also changed.","“Congratulations on entering the Heart Profound Realm. Now, you have reached the Little Realm in the first chapter of the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual”. If you can continue to complete the second chapter and reach the Great Realm, you can leave the secret realm.”","The voice of Saint Iniquitous Shadow resounded in her mind again.","Huang Yueli almost didn’t spit out a mouthful of blood!","Why didn’t you say this earlier? At the beginning, you said that as long as I have achieved success in cultivation, I can go out, and now I say that I have to cultivate to the level of the Great Realm!","Old man Iniquitous Shadow, you really know how to cheat!","However, she had no other choice but to force herself to continue to practice hard."]},{"number":3582,"title":"Chapter 3582 Huang Yueli Comes Out Of Seclusion (2)","paragraphs":["3582 Huang Yueli Comes Out Of Seclusion (2)","Fortunately, Huang Yueli has already mastered the tricks to this set of techniques, and the speed of cultivating the next part was even faster than the first one.","After about ten more days, she controlled all the evil qi and profound energy of the world in her body.","However, being in control doesn’t mean complete refinement. She just sealed them in the dantian and will release them little by little when cultivating in the future, which can achieve twice the result with half the effort.","Huang Yueli heaved a sigh of relief, and slowly opened her eyes.","She got up from the ground, moved her hands and feet, stretched her waist again, and couldn’t help complaining: “Ahhhhh——! I can’t stand it. I haven’t moved for months! I feel that my whole body is going to turn into stone...”","Lying still all the time, stiffness was inevitable.","But Huang Yueli didn’t have the aches and pains of ordinary people, because as she entered the Heart Profound Realm, her body got the essence again, the impurities were forced out and her whole body became lighter, and more laws of heaven and earth were integrated.","“Soon, it’s only less than two months! You can cultivate this set of “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual” to the level of mastery so quickly, even the deity did not expect it!”","A voice suddenly came from above her head. As soon as Huang Yueli raised her head, she saw Saint Iniquitous Shadow standing in front of her.","She blinked her eyes, with some doubts in her eyes.","I don’t know why, but she always feels that Saint Iniquitous Shadow looks a little different from when she first came here...","However, she couldn’t tell what was different.","Just as Huang Yueli was thinking, Saint Iniquitous Shadow spoke again, “How do you feel now? I checked the aura in your body. It should be completely stable. Is there any discomfort?”","Huang Yueli let her profound energy flow through her meridians for a whole week, then shook her head, “It’s nothing uncomfortable.” She paused, and then asked, “It’s just... so much evil qi is sealed in my body, probably How long will it take to fully refine?”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow said: “This is not sure. If you cultivate normally, these evil qi can increase your cultivation speed by five times. It will take about eight to ten years to fully refine them. However, in some Under special circumstances, it may also be released in large quantities!”","“Special circumstances?” Huang Yueli was puzzled.","However, Saint Iniquitous Shadow just smiled and didn’t explain much, “You will know when the time comes.”","Huang Yueli pursed her lips, feeling a little dissatisfied.","What time is this, and I still have to play charades with her!","What about the good master who promised to love his disciples? If you don’t tell her such a crucial question, do you want to cheat her again?","Huang Yueli thought of one more thing, and hurriedly asked: “By the way, Master, will these evil qi stay in my dantian, will they be detected by the masters of the God Realm? Is there any way for me to cover up my identity as an evil cultivator...?”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow glanced at her, and said coolly: “As your Master, I never hide that I am an evil cultivator.”","“Uh...” Huang Yueli was at a loss for words for a moment.","Judging from the various legends circulating in the God Realm, Saint Iniquitous Shadow never hides himself. He has been righteous and evil all his life, but he has always stood at the pinnacle of the God Realm. No one dared to make irresponsible remarks to him.","Huang Yueli was naturally very envious and fascinated by the free and easy pride of Saint Iniquitous Shadow.","However, she also knows her own strength..."]},{"number":3583,"title":"Chapter 3583 Huang Yueli Comes Out Of Seclusion (3)","paragraphs":["3583 Huang Yueli Comes Out Of Seclusion (3)","Seeing the tangled expression on his new disciple’s face, Saint Iniquitous Shadow snorted softly, “You are so talented, yet you are so cowardly? If the world knew, I’d lose face as your Master!”","Facing the cold expression of Saint Iniquitous Shadow, Huang Yueli was not afraid at all, she smiled with her lips curled up, and said, “Master, what kind of cultivation are you at? You are at the pinnacle in the entire God Realm! As for me, your poor disciple, I’m far behind! Besides, I’m already married and for the sake of my family, I must be more cautious in my actions, so I can no longer be as rash as I was when I was young!”","After hearing this, Saint Iniquitous Shadow almost spit out.","“You are still so little, what do you mean when you were young? Moreover, you’re even married! Aren’t you ashamed at all saying such things? Hmph! Let me tell you, a girl like you in the God Realm only knows how to cultivate hard. No one is like you who would shamefully marry yourself out!”","!!","Huang Yueli said with a smile: “What do I have to be ashamed of? My husband can save my life with the technique of splitting the soul, he is an amazing man just like Master!”","Huang Yueli said this very well. She not only praised her husband, but also flattered Saint Iniquitous Shadow.","Although Saint Iniquitous Shadow knew that she did it on purpose, but, I have to say, these words sounded very useful.","He couldn’t help showing a bit of complacency on his face, “Well... speaking of it, your husband can withstand the pain of the splitting the soul, and the strength of the soul is indeed the only one I have ever seen in my life that I can nod my head with approval. Besides, to make a genius like you fall in love with him, I guess the talent is not bad...”","Huang Yueli hurriedly said: “My husband is also a god-level genius! His talent is only higher than mine!”","“He’s also a god-level genius?” Saint Iniquitous Shadow was stunned for a moment, “How is it possible? It is already very good to have one god-level genius in 10,000 years, but two at the same time... Such a thing is even more rare. It may not happen once every ten thousand years! Not to mention, you are still... still husband and wife!”","“I also know that this is rare, but the fact is like this.” Huang Yueli said with pride.","“Impossible! How could such a thing happen!”","He frowned, apparently not believing it very much, but seeing Huang Yueli’s swearing, he couldn’t help but accept this fact.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow said: “You don’t have to worry, only a person whose cultivation level is higher than me can see the evil qi in your body. When your Master’s strength was at its peak, it was at the sixth level of the Life Profound Realm. Over the past few tens of thousands of years , God-level talents have been withering, and there should be no one with a higher cultivation than me.”","Only then did Huang Yueli feel relieved.","She thought for a while, and then said: “Master, since I have cultivated the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual” to the Great Realm according to your request, then I...uh, I will rush to Cloudy Qilin Continent to save my husband as soon as possible. ”","Hearing this, Saint Iniquitous Shadow immediately frowned, “What? You are leaving so soon? I still have a lot of skills and profound skills, and I plan to pass them on to you slowly! No, you have to stay here for at least two years! ”","“Two years?” Huang Yueli’s eyes widened, and she immediately shook her head, “No, no! This is definitely not possible! My husband has absorbed more evil qi into his body than I have absorbed. God knows what kind of pain he is enduring now. It will be life-threatening! I must rush to teach him this set of skills!”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow snorted coldly: “Didn’t you say that he is also a god-level genius?”"]},{"number":3584,"title":"Chapter 3584 Huang Yueli Comes Out Of Seclusion (4)","paragraphs":["3584 Huang Yueli Comes Out Of Seclusion (4)","“For a god-level genius, although such an impact is severe, it is still bearable. He can’t die within a few years, it’s just that he’ll be a bit uncomfortable. It doesn’t matter much.”","Huang Yueli said in a depressed tone: “Master, then... you can’t say that! A few years of coma will also affect his cultivation! No, I have to leave here! Besides, I plan to participate in the God Ream Tournament!”","“God Ream Tournament?”","Huang Yueli nodded, “You just said that it took me less than two months to cultivate, so the God Ream Tournament will start in about one month’s time.”","!!","Hearing this, Saint Iniquitous Shadow obviously hesitated.","He pondered for a while, then said: “You said that you have been ascended for less than a year, so you must have very little experience in fighting against geniuses from the God Realm. The God Ream Tournament will help you a lot, so you really have to go...”","He looked at Huang Yueli, “Since that’s the case, then you should go to the God Ream Tournament first. However, once the God Ream Tournament is over, you must return to the secret realm to accept the rest of the inheritance.”","Of course Huang Yueli had no objection to this condition, she hurriedly nodded in agreement.","“By the way, there is one more thing...”","“What’s the matter? Master, just say it!”","“You want to use the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual” to save your husband, of course it is not impossible, but he must also worship under my sect and become my disciple, otherwise, it is impossible for me to pass on the unique cultivation method to the outside world.” Saint Iniquitous Shadow said solemnly.","Huang Yueli nodded, “Master, don’t worry, I understand the truth, my husband is definitely willing.”","“Can you guarantee it?”","“I can guarantee it!”","Taking Li Moying’s manner of loving his wife as his life into consideration, not to mention Huang Yueli had already acknowledged Iniquitous Shadow Saint as her Master so it was definitely impossible for him to have any objections.","Besides, in the past, Li Moying was very envious of her Senior Brothers and Sisters studying arts together as childhood sweethearts. Now, if he knows that he can be her Senior Brother, he might even be very happy!","Seeing that Huang Yueli had guaranteed it, Saint Iniquitous Shadow nodded in satisfaction.","“With your words, I feel at ease as a Master.”","Huang Yueli couldn’t wait to go to Cloudy Qilin Continent to save people. As soon as she heard that Saint Iniquitous Shadow was relieved, she wanted to leave quickly.","Unexpectedly, Saint Iniquitous Shadow stopped her again.","“Wait, if you want to save your husband, using the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual” is not the best way, you should take this manual along as well!”","“Master, you actually have a better technique, why didn’t you tell me earlier?” Huang Yueli was very happy when she heard that, and took the thin booklet with her hand.","She opened it casually and flipped through it. Her eyes flickered over the pages, and she was taken aback for a moment.","Immediately afterwards, her entire face turned red, and she almost threw the book in her hand out!","“This... This is a dual cultivation technique!!”","Seeing the little girl’s embarrassed expression, Saint Iniquitous Shadow laughed instead.","This ghost girl was very clever. She acted with ease in everything she did before, not at all like she should be at her age, which made him, her Master, feel unfulfilling.","Now, he finally got to see her embarrassing side!","He explained slowly: “Yes, this is indeed a dual-cultivation method. But, don’t underestimate it! Back then, my wife and I were not as talented as you, and it was only by cultivating this set of techniques that we could both achieve our destiny and reach the Life Profound Realm! However, this has been improved by me several times, and not just anyone can practice it.”"]},{"number":3585,"title":"Chapter 3585 Huang Yueli Comes Out Of Seclusion (5)","paragraphs":["3585 Huang Yueli Comes Out Of Seclusion (5)","Seeing that Huang Yueli was puzzled, he further explained: “This dual cultivation secret manual was rewritten after I performed the soul splitting technique and became an evil cultivator. If you want to practice it, you must meet two conditions.”","“First, both men and women must have talents above the heaven level. Second, both of them must be evil cultivators, with enough evil qi in their bodies.”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment, and after thinking about it carefully, she found that these two conditions seemed simple, but they were actually very harsh.","Because, the cultivators who can reach the talent above the heaven level are basically super-first-class geniuses that the major forces have tried their best to cultivate. No matter how unsatisfactory they are, they cannot become evil cultivators, let alone both husband and wife are evil cultivators.","!!","After all, in the God Realm, evil cultivators are still very unpopular.","Most of the cultivators who become evil cultivators have a miserable history behind them.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow paused for a moment, and continued: “Meeting those two conditions is just a matter of successful double cultivation, but to achieve the best results, there is another condition, and this condition can only be achieved by you and your husband!”","Huang Yueli was startled, and she had already thought of something, “Could it be... the art of splitting soul?”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow nodded, “You are indeed very smart, yes, it is the art of splitting the soul! The two of you used to share the same soul, although your husband is now one, but the memories, feelings, and ideas that have been shared between you will not disappear, and will still remain in your body. Once you perform this dual cultivation method, these ties will be awakened to help you refine the evil qi in your body.”","“Didn’t you ask me just now, under what circumstances, the evil qi in your body will be released in large quantities, and the refining speed will be doubled? This is one of those situations!”","After hearing this explanation, Huang Yueli was overjoyed. She looked down at this double cultivation secret manual, and she didn’t hate it so much anymore.","No matter what, it’s still... cultivation is the most important thing, right?","It’s definitely not that she wants to be like that with Li Moying...","She is not as full of impure thoughts as Li Moying!","However, she still didn’t dare to read more, but carefully put away the secret manual, then bowed her hands to Saint Iniquitous Shadow, “Thank you, Master, for your guidance.”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow glanced at her, “However, you should be more careful when you practice. The evil qi in your body is released at the same time, which may attract the attention of others. If your identities as evil cultivators are exposed, don’t blame me and say that I didn’t warn you!”","Huang Yueli hurriedly said: “The disciple understands, and will definitely act carefully.”","Speaking of this, she thought of one more thing, and asked cautiously: “By the way, Master, besides... other than dual cultivation, what else would cause my evil qi to be released? Please tell me as well!”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow said: “There is another situation, that is, the profound energy in your body is exhausted and you are attacked by foreign enemies. At this time, the evil qi will be released automatically to help you take the damage. However, in this way, you will really It’s very dangerous! Don’t let this happen!”","Huang Yueli shuddered all over.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was right.","If she really waited until her profound energy was exhausted and she had to release the evil qi in her body, then for her, she must have reached a desperate situation.","Without the evil qi, she might have died on the spot.","With evil qi, even if she didn’t die at the time, there would be endless troubles waiting for her."]},{"number":3586,"title":"Chapter 3586 Interests Of the God Clans (1)","paragraphs":["3586 Interests Of the God Clans (1)","Huang Yueli hurriedly nodded and responded to his advice one by one.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow explained a few more words before raising his hand and allowing her to leave.","Huang Yueli was determined to return home, and she had no time to think about other things. When she saw him let her go, she immediately left without looking back.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow stood in place, watching Huang Yueli’s petite figure disappear at the entrance, his eyebrows frowned slightly.","If Huang Yueli had been more careful just now, she would have found that the figure of Saint Iniquitous Shadow seemed a little more transparent than before...","“I hope you can keep your promise and return to the secret realm immediately after the God Ream Tournament, otherwise...”","...","After Huang Yueli left the secret realm, she did not return to Forest Shade Town immediately, but first carefully searched the surroundings, for fear that there might be any ambush.","However, there was not even a living person around the entrance of the secret realm.","Li Tianyi and the others did not stay where they were. Huang Yueli speculated that they should have been found by the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan and brought them back.","Even the bodies of the five black robed men who were killed by Li Moying and her at that time were nowhere to be found now.","“This is weird. The corpse can’t grow legs, so can it still run away? Did the people from the Cloudy Qilin Clan sprinkle corpse powder, or were they dragged back by the Dark Lord’s people for burial?”","Huang Yueli thought for a while, but she couldn’t figure it out, so she put this matter aside.","At least now that no one is here to monitor her, they probably thought she was dead. This was just right, and it will not affect her actions.","Huang Yueli returned to Forest Shade Town, stayed for one night, and set off the next day, intending to go directly to Cloudy Qilin Continent to save Li Moying.","Since there was no air ship, it took several days to get back from Forest Shade Town to the nearest White Tiger Continent.","After entering a big town, things will be much easier. She can use the teleportation array to travel instead.","Huang Yueli was still a low-level Spiritual Armament Master, and she didn’t have time to go to Sky Gem Glass Chamber to change for a higher-level badge. However, being a low-level Spiritual Armament Master was enough for her to use the teleportation arrays in major towns.","Moreover, she has a lot of spirit jade on her body now, and she can’t spend it all. Even if she encounters some soldiers who don’t cooperate very well, she could use money to solve the problem.","Just like that, about ten days later, she was already standing on the ground of Arcane City, the main city of Cloudy Qilin Continent.","As soon as she entered Arcane City, she felt something was wrong with the atmosphere.","There were a lot of soldiers coming and going on the street, and the passers-by on the road were all cautious, not even daring to speak loudly.","Huang Yueli knew that there was a problem, moreover, this problem was probably related to Li Moying.","After thinking about it for a while, she decided to use the simplest method – go to the teahouse and ask the waiter.","However, this time, when she found an empty seat in the teahouse and sat down, before she had time to find someone, she heard the discussions of other guests around her.","Of course, these guests didn’t dare to speak too loudly, but Huang Yueli’s spiritual sense is very strong, as long as she listens carefully, she can still hear clearly.","“This time we have a complete falling out with the members of the Holy Phoenix Clan. I don’t know if we will start a war?” A man dressed in green asked in a low voice.","“The Holy Phoenix Clan dares to start a war with us? How dare they have such courage? Don’t forget, the God Clan Agreement was passed by the Twelve Great God Clans. Boycott it together!” The middle-aged man next to him said disapprovingly."]},{"number":3587,"title":"Chapter 3587 Interests Of the God Clans (2)","paragraphs":["3587 Interests Of the God Clans (2)","The man dressed in green said: “I also know this, but now it seems that it is not the Holy Phoenix Clan who wants to go to war, but the Cloudy Qilin Clan who can’t bear it! Think about it, I heard that the Young Master’s injury has not improved , the clan has searched for famous doctors but nothing worked, the Holy Phoenix Clan refused to hand over the antidote, and they also refused to hand over Huang Sanbai. If the Young Master is really... ahem, then the Patriarch and the others can bear this breath ?”","“Silence!”","Upon hearing the man dressed in green’s words, the middle-aged man’s face changed abruptly, and he stopped him, while looking around nervously.","“You dare to spout such nonsense! Young Master is a man of good fortune, so nothing will happen! There are so many famous doctors in the God Realm, there must be someone who can cure the Young Master well!”","The man dressed in green also realised that he had said the wrong thing, and coughed twice in embarrassment, “Ahem, I also know that a god-level genius like the Young Master has very good luck, and he will definitely turn evil into good fortune. But ...This Holy Phoenix Clan is too shameless! Not only does it deny it, but on the contrary, it bites us back, saying that our Cloudy Qilin Clan killed the god-level genius of their Sacred Phoenix Clan? Isn’t this deliberately confusing right and wrong?”","The middle-aged man sighed, “Even if we all know that this matter cannot be true, the other God Clan don’t know who we are and who is right! In this lawsuit, it is impossible to tell right from wrong in a short period of time. .”","The man dressed in green became anxious, “Then what should we do? I heard that the Young Master’s injury can no longer be delayed any longer! Even if his life is not in danger, but...the God Ream Tournament will start soon, right?”","The middle-aged man glanced at him lightly, raised his teacup to his mouth, and lowered his voice.","“This is the problem! Think about it, although the Patriarch has reported this matter to the headquarters of the Allied Armies, don’t say who is right and who is wrong in this matter now, even if the evidence is clear, other God Clan will deliberately delay time, at least It will be delayed until the end of the God Ream Tournament in the God Realm, without such a competitor as the Young Master, wouldn’t the geniuses of each clan have more opportunities?”","The man dressed in green’s face changed, “This...they are all dignified ancient gods, how could they act like this?”","“What is this?” The middle-aged man said wryly, “Do you think that the gods are saints? Isn’t it the same as fighting for power and profit? If it is delayed until the end of the God Realm Tournament, it is considered a noble hand by everyone. If someone’s mind is darker, maybe In the end, it will be judged that it is more reasonable to say that it is the Holy Phoenix Clan, so take this opportunity to get rid of the Young Master!”","The man dressed in green was suddenly shocked!","However, he also recalled, “You are right, with the Young Master as a god-level genius, the geniuses of the major god races have been suppressed. In the future, the Young Master will advance to the Life Profound Realm, and it is more likely that other God Clans can’t lift their heads. It’s in everyone’s interest to get rid of him before he grows up...”","“You finally got the hang of it, kid! This matter... But it’s a tacit understanding! Moreover, there is no need for other God Clans to do it themselves, the Holy Phoenix has already done the dirtiest and most tiring work, and even gave it to someone who is not very reliable. There is no proof, but there is some truth to it. Others just need to push the boat along with the flow, and they can do it without any responsibility, so why not do it?”","The middle-aged man is obviously a well-informed person, and he has a thorough understanding of the interests of the major god races.","It was the first time for the man dressed in green to hear about these sinister intentions, and he was so shocked that he couldn’t speak."]},{"number":3588,"title":"Chapter 3588 Interests Of the God Clans (3)","paragraphs":["3588 Interests Of the God Clans (3)","Huang Yueli sat on the side, listening to the conversation between the two of them.","Based on these words, she quickly analysed the crisis Li Moying was in now.","Obviously, in order to save Li Moying, the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Holy Phoenix Clan had already gone through negotiations, but the result was an obvious failure. The Holy Phoenix Clan also said that the Cloudy Qilin Clan attacked their god-level genius first. ...","These words were obviously made up by Huang Sanbai.","She really had to applaud this old man to come up with such a vicious lie. Sure enough, this old man was insidious enough.","!!","Now, the Cloudy Qilin Clan should have reported this inexplicable case to the Allied Forces to wait for the Twelve Great God Clans to make a joint decision. However, the other God Clans have their own thoughts, so it is impossible to make a fair judgement.","To put it bluntly, there are far more people who want Li Moying to die than those who want him to live...","Huang Yueli narrowed her eyes, a cold light flashed in her eyes.","She stood up suddenly, picked up the teapot on the table, and walked to the table of the middle-aged man and the man dressed in green.","“You two... If you don’t mind, let’s share a table?”","The two of them were getting together, discussing the most sensitive topic in low voices, when they suddenly heard a strange voice next to them, and they were all startled.","When he looked up, he found that it was an unremarkable young man, he immediately frowned.","“Who are you? We’re not interested in sharing a table with others! There are a lot of seats here, you just pick one.”","Huang Yueli didn’t take their hostility seriously, and said directly: “Just now, I listened to the two analyses of the attitudes of the major God Clan towards the injury of the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. The two really have extraordinary insight, which makes Li very impressed!”","The faces of both of them changed.","As a subordinate force of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, they can be said to be treasonous when they say these words!","I thought they were sitting in the corner, their voices were so soft that they wouldn’t be heard, but I didn’t expect that this young man in front of me could actually hear them?","Huang Yueli smiled slightly and said: “You two don’t need to be nervous, I have no other intentions. In fact, I just came from Empyrean Fox Continent just because I heard about the serious injury of the noble Young Master. I am a doctor myself , although he is not proficient in academic skills, he can be regarded as proficient in poison arts, so he came here specially to see Young Master Li.”","After hearing this, the two of them relaxed a little.","However, the middle-aged man still looked at Huang Yueli with a distrustful expression.","“You said, you want to detoxify the Young Master? Just you? Ask a blunt question, how old are you? How many years have you studied medicine? Are you a Spirit Alchemist? The Young Master’s injury is too serious, but there is nothing to do?”","Huang Yueli curled her lips slightly, with an inscrutable look.","“This...don’t bother your Excellency. Whether it can be cured or not will be known in due time. However, in order to be able to prepare before seeing the doctor, I still have a few questions I want to ask you. You just need to tell me what happened recently, then... this pot of tea is on me!”","As Huang Yueli said, she put down the teapot in her hand.","When the two of them took a closer look, they both showed surprise.","The pot of tea in Huang Yueli’s hand was the most expensive kind in Arcane City. A pot costs thousands of low-grade spirit jades. For ordinary cultivators, it was definitely a huge sum of money that could not be earned in a lifetime."]},{"number":3589,"title":"Chapter 3589 Interests Of the God Clans (4)","paragraphs":["3589 Interests Of the God Clans (4)","The middle-aged man looked at her in surprise, “I didn’t expect you to be so rich! It seems that you said that you have good medical skills, which is true! Well, then you can ask if you want, but I can only tell you what happened in the Cloudy Qilin Clan and I don’t know much about it.”","Huang Yueli said slowly: “It’s alright, I just want to know...”","She asked a few more questions about Li Moying’s situation after returning to Cloudy Qilin Continent, as well as the negotiation between the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Holy Phoenix Clan. Then, she asked about Li Moying’s current situation.","The middle-aged man was still able to answer the questions fluently at first, but when he heard this, he seemed hesitant.","“This... This is the secret of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and I don’t know it! However, the Young Master’s injury must not heal so quickly. The rewards offered by the clan to famous doctors from all walks of life are multiplying every day. If you really believe in your ability, you can try it.”","!!","Huang Yueli had already received the news she wanted, so she nodded, “That’s it, thank you both!”","As she spoke, she casually dropped another large piece of spirit jade, turned around and left quickly.","The two of them stared at the piece of spirit jade, their eyeballs almost fell out.","“This... What is this kid’s background? He is too rich! This piece of spirit jade, cut up, can be worth hundreds of dollars! Just give it to us? No one in Arcane City doesn’t know what we are talking about. what?”","“It seems that he is really an expert, maybe he can really cure the Young Master!”","Huang Yueli ignored the surprised eyes behind her, left the teahouse directly, and headed towards the Amethyst Paramount Palace where the direct descendants of the Cloudy Qilin Clan gathered.","Amethyst Paramount Palace was located in the centre of Arcane City. The entire main city was ring-shaped and built around this Palace.","Huang Yueli found the east gate. There were a large number of soldiers at the gate with solemn expressions, swords in hand, and they were all at the late stage of the Dream Profound Realm, and they were all imposing.","Huang Yueli walked straight over and was stopped immediately.","“Who is coming? This is the important place of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Idlers are not allowed to enter!”","Huang Yueli explained: “I’m your Young Master Li Moying’s friend when he was training outside. After we parted, I heard that he was seriously injured and couldn’t be cured for a long time. I was worried, so I came here to visit him.”","She didn’t say that she was a doctor at all.","Those words were no problem to fool a few ordinary cultivators, but facing many masters of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, it will be revealed in a matter of minutes.","She doesn’t have much attainment in medical skills, and she doesn’t have the confidence to refine pills at all.","“Young master’s friend?” The leading captain sized up Huang Yueli and frowned slightly, “What evidence do you have?”","Seeing that this kid is dressed in ordinary clothes and his cultivation level was not high, he really doesn’t know how he can become friends with their superior Young Master?","Seeing that the other party didn’t believe it, Huang Yueli didn’t explain, but just took out a purple jade pendant from her bosom.","“This is the token your Young Master gave me, saying that if you need something, you can go to the Cloudy Qilin Clan to find him.”","This token looks ordinary, but it was actually Li Moying’s identity mark, and it was the most important thing for the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","The soldiers turned pale with shock when they saw it.","The Young Master even gave away such an important thing, this was a fateful friendship!","The captain immediately became respectful, “Young Master, my subordinate was rude just now, please...”","At this moment, Huang Yueli suddenly heard a scolding sound from behind: “Wait! No one is allowed to let him in!”"]},{"number":3590,"title":"Chapter 3590 What kind of strength is this? (1)","paragraphs":["3590 What kind of strength is this? (1)","As soon as Huang Yueli turned her head, she saw Li Leyun just got off a carriage, leading a group of maidservants and walking towards him.","She narrowed her eyes slightly, realising that she had come by such an unlucky time.","Li Leyun walked in front of her, showing a cold smile, “It’s you! Stop pretending, I know it must be you! Unexpectedly, you didn’t die!”","After hearing the words, Huang Yueli subconsciously touched the disguise on her face.","When she went out, she changed her appearance a little bit, which was slightly different from her previous disguise in Medial Arch City.","However, it was more difficult to change things like height, fat and thin, and she came to find Li Moying in a hurry, so she didn’t make too many changes. For people who have met her, it was not particularly difficult to recognize her.","In addition, she took out Li Moying’s identity jade token just now, and it was impossible to give this thing away easily.","Li Leyun also knew that Li Moying didn’t have any friends when he went out. Apart from the guards, there was only his beloved little wife by his side, so it was not surprising that she was guessed right away.","Huang Yueli quickly figured out the key point and regained her composure.","“Young Miss Li, I’ve let you down. Although you racked your brains to kill me, unfortunately, I don’t die that easily!”","When Li Leyun called to stop Huang Yueli, she only had some vague guesses. After seeing clearly Li Moying’s identity jade token in her hand, she realised that she had guessed correctly.","For a moment, she was extremely flustered!","She saw with her own eyes that Huang Yueli was wrapped in a cloud of black air, and then fell into a strange teleportation array.","Li Moying hadn’t woken up after absorbing the black energy, so Li Leyun tacitly agreed that Huang Yueli didn’t know where she died.","But I don’t know, a month later, Li Moying is still in a coma, but this dead girl doesn’t know why, not only didn’t die, but also appeared here intact...","“Young Miss, you... know this Young Master? He... is he really the Young Master’s friend?”","The captain guarding the gate and the two confronted each other tit for tat. They didn’t know what to do for a while, so they could only ask cautiously.","Huang Yueli came back to her senses, and hurriedly said: “Of course, Moying and I...”","“Of course not! How could he be Brother Moying’s friend!” Huang Yueli had just started when she was interrupted by Li Leyun.","Li Leyun said unceremoniously: “This person is not only not a friend of Brother Moying, but also murdered Brother Moying time and time again. He is a perfidious villain! You must not let him in!”","“What??” The guards all changed their expressions in shock.","Huang Yueli’s complexion also changed, “Li Leyun! Do you know what you are talking about? It doesn’t matter if you are dissatisfied with me, but I am here this time to save Moying’s life! Don’t you admire him? Don’t you? Want to kill him for your own selfish desire? You are crazy! Take me to see Li Moying!”","Li Leyun looked at her and sneered: “Do you think I’m a fool? Just rely on you? Your spiritual armament skills are indeed very superb, but you don’t know any healing at all! You just want to stick to Brother Moying and you’re just making an excuse, don’t think I don’t know!”","Huang Yueli frowned, “Li Leyun, let me tell you again, I have a way to save my husband’s life, this is not a joke, let me in!”"]},{"number":3591,"title":"Chapter 3591 What Kind Of Strength Is This? (2)","paragraphs":["3591 What Kind Of Strength Is This? (2)","Li Leyun didn’t believe that Huang Yueli could have such abilities, so she denied without any hesitation: “Impossible!”","She looked at Huang Yueli with disdain, “In order to be able to see Brother Moying, you really dare to say anything, even this kind of unbelievable lie! Let me tell you, no one here will Believe your nonsense, you better get out!”","After hearing this, Huang Yueli not only did not leave as promised, but also did not move a step at all.","She said with a half-smile: “Young Miss Li, you are so nervous, you are so anxious to drive me away, it is not so much that I am lying, it is better to say that you are afraid of letting me see Moying? However, you really should be afraid, if you let Moying know what you did to me, what do you think will happen to you?”","These words just hit Li Leyun’s sore spot.","Hearing this, her face suddenly turned livid.","However, she will not show any weakness in front of Huang Yueli.","Li Leyun sneered, and said, “What do I have to be afraid of? If you want to sue Brother Moying, you have to meet him first! And do you think... I will let you see him?”","Huang Yueli frowned slightly. Although she was very confident in her own strength, she was not blindly confident.","Now that she is on the territory of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, with Li Leyun’s status in the Cloudy Qilin Clan, trying to prevent her from seeing Li Moying was definitely not just empty talk.","Of course, she can also choose to make a big fuss in front of the Amethyst Paramount Palace, making things bigger and telling the truth.","It’s just that doing so may not be of any benefit to her.","After all, Li Yuntao and the others have made it clear that the Cloudy Qilin Clan does not want the future Patriarch to have a wife from the lower realm, and her status was far worse than that, she was from the Holy Phoenix Clan!","With the current relationship between the two clans, if the Patriarchs of the Cloudy Qilin Clan knew her true identity, they would tear her apart!","Huang Yueli’s eyes darkened, but she still wanted to make the last effort.","“Li Leyun, I’m not joking, I can really save him!”","Hearing her repeated emphasis, Li Leyun also knew that she was also poisoned before, but now she was standing here alive and kicking, so she couldn’t help feeling suspicious.","Could it be that this damn girl really had a way to save him?","Li Leyun glanced at Huang Yueli suspiciously, then changed the subject, “What can you do to save Brother Moying? Tell me first and listen! If there is some truth to it, then for Brother Moying, I can consider letting you meet.”","What she said sounds like she made a concession and gave Huang Yueli a chance.","However, Huang Yueli just smiled coldly, not being tempted by these conditions at all.","“Young Miss Li, do you think I’m a fool? I’ll tell you how to save people, and if you use this method to save people, then you will transform into Moying’s saviour, and then secretly kill me, you will be able to avoid future troubles forever, right?”","Li Leyun’s face froze for a moment.","This damn girl was so smart! She actually said her plan exactly!","She gritted her teeth and refused to admit it, “What are you talking about? How could I do such a thing?”","Huang Yueli raised the corners of her mouth mockingly, “Whether it’s true or not, you know in your heart, but you don’t have to daydream anymore, I must do it myself to save Moying, no one else can do it!”"]},{"number":3592,"title":"Chapter 3592 What Kind Of Strength Is This? (3)","paragraphs":["3592 What Kind Of Strength Is This? (3)","There was not a single lie in what Huang Yueli said .","Although she has the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual” in her hand, it was impossible for this kind of thing to be handed over to others casually. She also swore in front of the spirit body of Saint Iniquitous Shadow that she would never let the cultivation method spread to the outside world.","What’s more, if you want to really cure Li Moying and raise his cultivation base to a higher level, you can only do it through double cultivation. This was not something that anyone could do. The one who met such a series of harsh conditions was only her!","However, Li Leyun obviously did not believe in such a thing.","Seeing that Huang Yueli refused to tell the way to save people, she gradually became angry and she couldn’t pretend to be innocent anymore.","“After talking for a long time, you are lying to me! There is no way you can save brother Moying, you just want to see him!”","Huang Yueli said indifferently: “He is my husband, I want to see him, so there is nothing strange about it.”","As soon as the words fell, before Li Leyun had time to react, a gasp came from behind the two of them.","When Huang Yueli was arguing with Li Leyun, the guards of Amethyst Paramount Palace were not far away and could hear their conversation. They also had a lot of guesses about Huang Yueli’s identity.","Unexpectedly, she suddenly said, “Li Moying is my husband!”","In their eyes, Huang Yueli is a man!","Could it be that the reason why their wise and mighty Young Master was not close to women, and is indifferent to the pursuit of so many proud girls of heaven, is not because he is devoted to cultivation, but because... he liked men?","But, the kid in front of him doesn’t look very good, does he? At most, it can only be called normal, and it is definitely not stunning! The Young Master’s aesthetic is really fascinating!","At this moment, Li Leyun said, “Stop being so sentimental! Brother Moying will never marry you!”","The guards nodded after hearing this.","That is, their Young Master doesn’t like men! He will not marry a man!","However, before everyone breathed out their long breath, Li Leyun said again: “Even if Brother Moying likes you, what’s the use? What is the status of our Cloudy Qilin Clan? It is absolutely impossible to accept your low birth.” My young lady! To tell you the truth, brother Moying and I are officially engaged!”","After hearing this, the guards almost fainted!","Could it be that their Young Master really likes... the man in front of him?","How could such a thing happen?","But, even Young Miss Leyun said so...","For a moment, everyone glared at Huang Yueli. When Li Leyun mentioned the marriage contract, the guards all cheered.","“That’s right, our young lady is already engaged to the Young Master! Thanks to the young lady who saved the Young Master this time, with this credit, even the daughters of other elders in the clan can’t make money with Young Miss Leyun, you Let alone a man!”","“What are you? How dare you miss our Young Master!”","After hearing these words, Huang Yueli couldn’t help frowning.","However, she understood a little bit in her heart.","It seems that after Li Leyun rescued Li Moying near Forest Shade Town, she made a contribution to the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Originally, she had already been removed from the competition of “Future Young Lady”, but because of this, thanks to her credit, she stood out and became the best candidate for Li Moying’s “fiancée”.","Even though she knew that Li Moying had been in a coma, it was impossible to do anything."]},{"number":3593,"title":"Chapter 3593 What Kind Of Strength Is This? (4)","paragraphs":["3593 What Kind Of Strength Is This? (4)","However, whenever Huang Yueli thought of her husband being entangled by this savage and willful young lady for no reason, Huang Yueli would feel uncomfortable in her stomach.","She looked at Li Leyun mockingly, “Engaged? Are you sure? Moying has clearly not woken up, how did you get engaged to him? Or did you have a daydream, dreaming that you were engaged to him?”","Li Leyun’s face froze.","Huang Yueli said again: “Furthermore, his real wife is still alive. You are so eager to marry in because you want to make a fool of my husband? Have you asked me what this real wife means?”","“What kind of wife are you? The lower realm...”","Li Leyun was about to say something, when suddenly, she found that the guards at the gate of Amethyst Paramount Palace were all looking at them in surprise.","She was startled suddenly, and only then did she realize that she was so angry that she quarreled with Huang Yueli regardless of the occasion.","All the words they said were heard by the guards at the door!","Although the guards were clearly thinking wrong, if they continued to quarrel, there was no guarantee that Huang Yueli would reveal something. If word got to the ears of the Patriarch or elders, her marriage with Li Moying would fall through again!","Thinking of this, an icy glint flashed in Li Leyun’s eyes.","Keeping Huang Yueli here is always a disaster. As long as she stays in the Cloudy Qilin Clan for a day, she will have to bear a huge risk. Why not...","Li Leyun yelled sharply: “Bold lunatic! How dare you say such a thing in Amethyst Paramount Palace, you are clearly slandering our Young Master, destroying the Young Master’s reputation, with ulterior motives! I suspect that you are a spy sent by the Holy Phoenix clan! Come, take this person down quickly, and this lady will personally interrogate him severely!”","As she said that, she didn’t wait for the guards to do anything, she slapped Huang Yueli first!","Powerful thunder attribute energy swept towards Huang Yueli’s chest!","Whether it’s speed or strength, it’s better than when the two fought in Medial Arch City.","When the guards saw this, they all cheered, “Young Miss is strong and diligent, so amazing! She is indeed a genius second only to the Young Master in the clan!”","A trace of surprise also flashed across Huang Yueli’s eyes.","Li Leyun’s strength is indeed much stronger. The last time she fought against each other, she could only say that she had just stepped into the Heart Profound Realm, and her cultivation base was not yet stable, but now, it is obvious that her moves were more smooth!","The interval between the two fights was less than a month, and Li Leyun has been working very hard recently to make such progress!","Seeing the expression on Huang Yueli’s face, Li Leyun couldn’t help but feel even more proud.","“You are looking for death yourself, you can’t blame me! Now let you see how good I am!”","The last time the two of them hadn’t really fought, they were interrupted by Li Tianyi and the others. Li Leyun had always regretted not letting Huang Yueli see her true strength!","She always believed that as long as Huang Yueli could clearly see the difference in talent between the two, she could completely suppress Huang Yueli and make the other party unable to hold her head up.","Now, she finally got this opportunity!","In the blink of an eye, Li Leyun’s profound energy had already hit Huang Yueli’s chest.","Huang Yueli didn’t dodge at all, and there was a faint smile on her face.","Li Leyun was startled, she was dying, and this little girl was still laughing? Wouldn’t it be frightening?","But the next moment, she realised that she was completely wrong!","A huge force suddenly erupted from Huang Yueli’s body!","Li Leyun didn’t even get a piece of her clothes, and her body flew back."]},{"number":3594,"title":"Chapter 3594 What Kind Of Strength Is This? (5)","paragraphs":["3594 What Kind Of Strength Is This? (5)","Li Leyun didn’t realise that she had missed at first, and when she was in mid-air, she still maintained an overjoyed expression on her face.","It wasn’t until her back hit the ground heavily that she suddenly realised what had happened.","However, she was so stunned that she couldn’t do anything except stare blankly at Huang Yueli.","The surrounding guards also had dull expressions on their faces. They all opened their mouths wide and stared blankly at the scene in front of them!","This was so amazing that she never thought that she should go up to help Li Leyun.","After all, Li Leyun is one of the top genius cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and her cultivation has improved a lot recently. Even Li Zijun is no match for her now. Only Li Moying was left.","But now, what did they see?","The young man who knocked Li Leyun away just now seems to be about the same age as her, right?","Facing Li Leyun, actually has an overwhelming advantage in strength?","At this moment, Li Leyun finally regained consciousness. She was staring at Huang Yueli with a dazed look on her face, shaking her head desperately, “No...impossible! How is this possible? You...you’re not...”","Li Leyun had seen Huang Yueli’s true face, and knew that she was much younger than herself.","Moreover, the last time the two fought briefly, Huang Yueli’s strength was not as good as hers at that time.","However, just over a month has passed now...","In front of this little girl, she couldn’t even... not even catch a move!","“Impossible! This can’t be true! What method did you use? Did you poison me? Or did you use some hidden weapon?” Li Leyun opened her mouth and began to guess wildly.","Huang Yueli chuckled lightly, and said calmly: “Your skills are not as good as others, and you still refuse to admit it, insisting on finding some reason... It’s ridiculous to say that you are a genius!”","Li Leyun’s face turned red when she heard her mocking her, “It’s clear that you used indecent methods! Don’t think I can’t see it! How can you, a lowly human from the lower realm, cultivate so quickly? Moreover, I just underestimated the enemy and missed just now!”","“Missed for a while?” Huang Yueli looked at her with a half-smile, “Then I’ll give you another chance. Get up and let’s compete again.”","A gleam of joy flashed in Li Leyun’s eyes, and she was about to jump up from the ground.","However, Huang Yueli went on to say: “However, this time I can’t compete in vain. If I win, you must promise to take me into the Amethyst Paramount Palace and meet my husband. Of course, if you win, I will leave right away and I will never come to Amethyst Paramount Palace again in the future!”","Li Leyun originally thought that this was a good opportunity to avenge her shame, but when she heard what Huang Yueli said, she suddenly hesitated again and didn’t speak for a long time.","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows, “What? Don’t you dare?”","Li Leyun really didn’t dare.","Even though she thought from the bottom of her heart that Huang Yueli was from a humble background and could not be stronger than a God Clan daughter like her, but for some reason, when she saw Huang Yueli’s calm and composed expression, a trace of fear arose in her heart for no reason.","“Who...who said I dare not?” Li Leyun was uneasy in her heart, but she refused to admit defeat.","Huang Yueli took the opportunity to force her and said, “So, you agreed!”","“I...I...” Li Leyun struggled for a while before saying, “I promise you, but...”"]},{"number":3595,"title":"Chapter 3595 What Kind Of Strength Is This? (6)","paragraphs":["3595 What Kind Of Strength Is This? (6)","When Li Leyun said this, she suddenly stopped.","Huang Yueli was a little surprised and frowned slightly, not understanding why Li Leyun didn’t continue talking.","She is still waiting for Li Leyun’s words!","After thinking about it, it is not so easy to sneak into the Amethyst Paramount Palace, it would be better to go in openly, anyway, Li Leyun is also a no-brainer, if she can agree to this bet, it will save her time and effort Go lie to those guards.","Huang Yueli was also sure that Li Leyun would agree.","After all, no one would have imagined that in such a short period of time, she had advanced from the middle stage of the Dream Profound Realm to the early stage of the Heart Profound Realm, and her current cultivation level was already the same as that of Li Leyun’s.","But who knows, Li Leyun stopped at this juncture...","Huang Yueli took another look in surprise, and found that Li Leyun was looking somewhere behind her.","She quickly looked back, and found that another carriage was coming from the end of the street.","After the carriage stopped, a middle-aged man got down from it.","This person looks a little familiar...","“Li Yunhai!”","Huang Yueli recognized the person immediately, and the person who came was actually Li Yunhai who had embarrassed her several times in Medial Arch City.","It turned out that Li Leyun stopped suddenly when she saw him...","A bad premonition suddenly rose in Huang Yueli’s heart.","Sure enough, seeing Li Yunhai approaching, Li Leyun immediately yelled loudly, “Elder Hai, there is a thief here who wants to sneak into the Amethyst Paramount Palace, and he also stole the jade token of the Young Master’s identity, he’s probably from the Holy Phoenix clan! Please help take her down!”","Huang Yueli had a premonition for a long time. When Li Leyun made a sound, she quickly turned around, spotted a narrow street, and fled in that direction!","With her current strength, she was still close to dealing with Li Yunhai.","Moreover, even though she just had a quick glance just now, she could clearly see that there was another similar carriage coming towards Li Yunhai’s carriage.","If I’m not mistaken, the person sitting inside was probably Li Yuntao!","If she faced these two brothers at the same time, she would have no choice but to catch her without a fight. At that time, it would be unrealistic to even run away.","And it was absolutely impossible for these two generals to be friendly to her.","Earlier at the entrance to the secret realm of Saint Iniquitous Shadow, the two generals had clearly seen her lying beside Li Moying, seriously injured, but they didn’t take any action to save her, they just took Li Moying away.","Later, although it was Li Leyun who attacked her, it was impossible for the two Divine Generals not to guess what Li Leyun would do to her!","But in the end, no one pursued Li Leyun’s responsibility. In fact, Li Leyun returned to the position and became the most preferred young lady candidate of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Here, the two Divine Generals definitely played a big role.","They also hope that Huang Yueli will die!","Huang Yueli’s heart was clear for a long time, so when she saw the two Divine Generals, she ran away without hesitation.","Facts have proved that her reaction was correct and quick enough.","After Li Yunhai heard Li Leyun’s shout, he was taken aback for a moment, but he was also a smart person, and soon understood Li Leyun’s code words.","It was not easy for the Young Master to get rid of this damn girl, but she unexpectedly appeared again!","How can this work?","Li Yunhai immediately chased after her!","Huang Yueli heard the sound of footsteps behind her, and immediately used all her strength to run away."]},{"number":3596,"title":"Chapter 3596 What Kind Of Strength Is This? (7)","paragraphs":["3596 What Kind Of Strength Is This? (7)","Not only that, she also looked for those particularly narrow or crowded roads.","Huang Yueli has a petite figure, and the profound skills she uses follow the light and agile route. Her figure was elegant and she can move around in a small space very flexibly.","Li Yunhai didn’t have this ability.","In terms of speed alone, he was of course much faster than Huang Yueli.","!!","However, with so many people, no matter how fast he is, he can’t show much.","Not only that, but because he was too eager to catch up with people, Li Yunhai accidentally bumped into several passers-by, as well as a stall on the side of the road, which almost aroused public outrage.","“Hey! Who is it? You just left without apologizing for bumping into someone?”","“Hush! Keep your voice down, if I’m not mistaken, he’s from the Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","“What happened to the Cloudy Qilin Clan? Can the ancient gods be so arrogant and domineering, bullying others?”","Hearing the indistinct yelling and cursing from behind, Li Yunhai was so angry that he couldn’t wait to go back and beat up those humans who dared to scold him!","With such a flash of divine effort, Huang Yueli didn’t know which street she turned to, and her figure disappeared from his eyes.","Li Yunhai was startled, and cursed viciously, “Damn it!”","He looked left, right, and looked in all directions, but he couldn’t find Huang Yueli.","But he felt unwilling to go back like this.","After thinking for a while, Li Yunhai came up with a way and began to shout: “Young Miss Li, Young Miss Li! Where are you? Come out, come out quickly! What do you mean you are running? Is it a misunderstanding? We have been looking for you for a long time, it is the Young Master who wants to see you! He is still calling your name in a coma, hurry up and go see him with me!”","Huang Yueli was hiding in a small alley not far away.","Li Yunhai’s cry was sent out with thick profound energy, and it could be heard for several miles, so she could hear it clearly.","Hearing Li Yunhai’s remarks, she secretly cursed insidiously, and at the same time felt a little ridiculous.","Not to mention that she had already learned about the real situation in Amethyst Paramount Palace from Li Leyun’s attitude just now, even if she hadn’t seen Li Leyun yet, she knew it was a lie.","And “kept calling your name in a coma”, so how could Li Yunhai not know her name?","Huang Yueli stayed motionless in the corner, listening to Li Yunhai repeat those words several times, and walked back and forth on the surrounding streets several times.","Finally, the cry disappeared, and the footsteps gradually faded away.","However, Huang Yueli did not feel relieved.","When looking for someone, she has seen a lot of this kind of drama where she pretends to stay away and actually hides secretly to observe.","Huang Yueli took out a new set of robes from her space and put it on. At the same time, she quickly changed her face again.","This time, instead of painting herself as a man, she turned into a woman! A woman who was quite beautiful, but not quite similar to her.","Huang Yueli herself has big watery eyes, red lips and fair skin, and looks very pure and bright.","But the woman she puts on has a pair of slightly raised phoenix eyes, and she was full of charm. With such a look, walking in the crowd was also very attractive to others.","However, this is what she wanted.","After finishing her makeup, Huang Yueli sneaked out of the alley."]},{"number":3597,"title":"Chapter 3597 What Kind Of Strength Is This? (8)","paragraphs":["3597 What Kind Of Strength Is This? (8)","After walking a few steps, she saw Li Yunhai.","Moreover, not only was he the only one, but Li Yuntao also came with seven or eight guards.","Several people occupied the necessary entrances and exits on the street, scanning the crowd sharply, and strictly scrutinised everyone passing by.","The passers-by who came and went were monitored in this way, and occasionally some people would be stopped for questioning. Naturally, everyone was very dissatisfied.","!!","However, facing so many masters of the ancient God Clan, everyone dared not speak out, so they could only pass by with their heads down.","When Huang Yueli saw this scene, she didn’t panic at all, and walked over one of the streets in a swaggering manner.","The person in charge of guarding this exit was a young Cloudy Qilin Clan guard.","Seeing a petite woman who was similar to Li Yunhai’s description passing by, he immediately raised his voice and shouted: “Who is it? The girl in the red dress in front, turn around!”","Huang Yueli paused at her feet, pretending to be very scared, but turned around as she said.","She raised her eyes and glanced at the young guard, “This... this young man, are you calling me?”","The young guard took a closer look, and after seeing the woman’s face clearly, he couldn’t help but lose his mind.","This woman was not very old. Although she looks timid, her eyes seem to be charming and indescribably charming.","Such a woman is full of temptations for young men who have not yet married. It’s no wonder that the young guard was in a daze.","Li Yunhai stood in the middle of the road and kept watching from side to side, for fear that any fish would slip through the net.","As a result, when he looked this way, he saw the young guard staring intently at a beautiful woman, and he couldn’t even bother to check the pedestrians around him.","Li Yunhai was so angry that he immediately yelled loudly: “Li Dongpeng, what are you looking at? Do things well for me, don’t be ashamed of being like a kid who has never seen the world! If you can’t find that little girl surnamed Li, Let’s see how I will deal with you when I go back!”","The young guard shuddered all over, not daring to stare at Huang Yueli anymore, he quickly waved his hand to signal Huang Yueli to leave.","That way, it’s like treating Huang Yueli like a fly and avoiding it.","However, this was completely within Huang Yueli’s calculations.","Just like that, Huang Yueli still swaggered away from the street safely under the eyes of everyone. From the beginning to the end, Li Yunhai and Li Yuntao did not arouse the slightest suspicion.","It wasn’t until she walked a certain distance and reached a safe place that Huang Yueli breathed a sigh of relief.","“It’s alright, it’s alright, fortunately, before I went to Amethyst Paramount Palace, I made lots of preparations and checked the surrounding streets in advance, and figured out how to escape in case of danger, otherwise, I’m afraid I will have been caught today! A Divine General, he really went with Li Leyun.”","Huang Yueli did not return to the inn where she lived before.","Her identity has been exposed, Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai can’t find her, and they will definitely check the status of the guests in the major inns. With the power of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, it is not difficult to check them one by one, and the way she dresses when she checks in is not difficult. Li Leyun has already seen it, so it will be easy to find out.","Huang Yueli thought for a while, continued to maintain her female attire, and went to stay in another inn.","She did this by taking advantage of the blind spots in people’s thinking.","Everyone knows that she likes to pretend to be an unattractive man to hide her identity, but this time, she will do the opposite!"]},{"number":3598,"title":"Chapter 3598 When There Is No Other Way (1)","paragraphs":["3598 When There Is No Other Way (1)","Moreover, this time, she deliberately dressed up as such an outstanding woman.","Although it seems that doing this makes her more attractive, but because of the special eye-catching, after others take a look at her, it is easy to judge that she is not the person they are looking for, and there will be no doubt at all.","The fact that she escaped from under Li Yunhai’s nose just now just proved this point.","Sure enough, not long after Huang Yueli checked in at the new inn, there was a burst of noise outside, mixed with banging on the door.","!!","Huang Yueli knew what she knew, but she still pretended to be woken up, opened the door and went to the corridor, while looking downstairs, she complained: “What’s going on? It’s so late, why? Still so noisy? What I want is a clean upper room, what is going on here?”","It wasn’t her. The guests in other rooms were also startled out, complaining one after another.","The shopkeeper could only run up in a hurry, nodding and bowing to everyone and apologising.","“I’m sorry, guest officers, it’s not that I don’t want to entertain you well, but... the Cloudy Qilin Clan is looking for a thief who committed crimes in Arcane City, and they are searching every inn! Please help me. ”","The faces of the guests who stayed at the hotel were all ugly, but they didn’t dare to continue to complain.","Because, the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan have already walked up the stairs, stopping people and questioning them one by one. They are on the territory of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Who would dare to offend such a high-ranking ancient god clan?","No matter how unhappy she was, she could only accept the examination humbly.","Huang Yueli is no exception.","Her behaviour was strictly consistent with the others, she complained when it was time to complain, and now, when it was time for her to bow her head, she also bowed her head obediently.","Several tall cultivators walked up to her, “The woman in front...”","When the two sides met face to face, the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan were stunned, because although the woman Huang Yueli dressed up was not as beautiful as herself, but for ordinary people, it could already be regarded as a rare beauty, so striking that they’ve only seen such a beauty once in their lifetime.","After seeing the beauty, the cultivator who was still fierce just now couldn’t help but lower his voice a bit.","“Uh, girl, we are guards of Arcane City, and I have a few questions for you.”","Huang Yueli glanced at them, with a bit of displeasure on her face when she was disturbed, but she still said as she said, “Just ask.”","“Excuse me, girl, what’s your name, where did you come from, when did you enter the city? How long have you lived here?”","Huang Yueli said casually: “My name is Xia Wan’er, a human race, I used to live in Veracious Wyvern Continent, and I’ve been cultivating nearby. Today I entered Arcane City, and I want to buy something at the auction house. I only checked into these inns two hours ago.”","The cultivators listened and nodded.","Although they asked, none of them listened carefully. Their eyes all fell on her charming face.","Because, the mission Li Yunhai entrusted to them was to find an unattractive young man with a portrait in their hands.","And the appearance of Huang Yueli’s disguise doesn’t match the picture at all, and even the gender was wrong. Everyone has already preconceived it and decided that it couldn’t be her.","The reason why I insisted on asking these questions was that on the one hand, it was a matter of routine, and on the other hand, I just wanted to say a few more words to the beauty."]},{"number":3599,"title":"Chapter 3599 When There Is No Other Way (2)","paragraphs":["3599 When There Is No Other Way (2)","After Huang Yueli finished speaking, she looked at the cultivators in front of her, “Alright, is there anything else you want to ask?”","The cultivator froze for a moment, then remembered his purpose of coming here, and then asked, “Then... is there anyone else accompanying you?”","Huang Yueli shook her head, “No, there’s no one else.”","The cultivator stared at the door behind her, and said, “Can you let us go in and have a look?”","!!","Huang Yueli didn’t have any ghosts in her heart, so she nodded readily and opened the door for them.","A few cultivators went in and took a look. The room was empty, even Huang Yueli’s package was still on the table before opening it, not to mention there was nowhere to hide someone.","Soon, they withdrew and bowed their hands towards Huang Yueli.","“Excuse us, Young Miss Xia. We’ll take our leave now.”","“It’s alright, you’re busy.”","Huang Yueli waved her hand, watched several people leave before returning to her room.","Of course, things didn’t end so easily. Huang Yueli lived in the inn for a few days, and went out to go shopping during the day. Apart from visiting the auction house occasionally, she spent most of her time drinking tea in teahouses, because there were people coming and going. The easiest way to get all kinds of gossip.","In order not to expose her identity, she didn’t even dare to go to the Sky Gem Glass Chamber, for fear of being bumped into by a Spiritual Armament Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, which would arouse Li Leyun’s suspicion.","After a few days like this, Huang Yueli found out that Li Leyun and the others really persevered.","Not only did the cultivators in charge of interrogation on the street not decrease, but there were more and more.","Not only that, even though the inn she stayed in had already been interrogated, from time to time someone would come to check her twice or thrice.","“Li Leyun really wants to let me die! I’m in trouble now, what should I do to see Moying?” Huang Yueli frowned, and couldn’t think of too much for a while. good way.","Judging from what she heard in the teahouse these days, Li Moying’s health seems to be getting worse.","It seems that the middle-aged man said that he was very likely to be in danger. It seems that he was not lying.","Although, according to Saint Iniquitous Shadow, Li Moying’s physique should be very suitable for cultivating evil qi, and he has also performed the soul splitting technique. Although these evil qi invaded his body, although he would be weak and be in a coma, but it was not life-threatening.","But, then again, this was only in the case of the clan doing nothing.","Seeing Li Moying still in a coma, the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan were at their wits end. They had been frightened by Li Moying’s symptoms, and must have thought of many ways to wake him up.","If they ventured along this line of thoughts, it might be self-defeating and it might hurt Li Moying even more.","“No, this is not the way, I still have to sneak into the Amethyst Paramount Palace as soon as possible! But, it is impossible to deceive the guards at the door now, and it is not realistic to sneak in. It is best to have some chance, to have a large number of outsiders enter the Amethyst Paramount Palace, then I can take the opportunity to sneak in...”","Just as Huang Yueli was thinking, suddenly, on the street below the teahouse, someone ran over yelling.","“Something has happened, something has happened! Do you know that the Cloudy Qilin Clan posted a notice at the entrance of Amethyst Paramount Palace just now!”","Upon hearing this, the passers-by became excited and surrounded them one after another.","“What notice? What notice?”","“Let’s go, let’s go take a look too!”"]},{"number":3600,"title":"Chapter 3600 When There Is No Other Way (3)","paragraphs":["3600 When There Is No Other Way (3)","Amethyst Paramount Palace.","At the door of Li Moying’s room, Li Shihong, the Patriarch of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, was frowning, with his hands behind his back and anxiously pacing back and forth along the corridor.","Not long after, an old man came out of the room.","Li Shihong hurried up and asked anxiously: “Doctor Lin, how is it going? How is Moying’s injury?”","!!","Doctor Lin sighed slightly, and shook his head.","Although Li Shihong had expected such a result, but when he really saw the other party showing such an expression, he couldn’t accept it.","“Doctor Lin, what do you mean? Even you can’t cure Moying? How...how is this possible? You are the Supreme Elder of the Heaven Elixir Pagoda! In the God Realm, your medical skills can surpass that of of those old men. There are only a handful of them, you...you can’t do anything?”","Li Shihong was devastated by the news.","This Miracle Doctor Lin is said to be one of the top doctors in the God Realm. He has retired for many years. He once owed a favour and had hence come to Cloudy Qilin Clan to treat Li Moying.","Li Shihong was finally relieved to be able to invite a genius doctor of this level.","But who knows, the results obtained seem to be no different from before.","Seeing Li Shihong’s disappointment, Doctor Lin felt very guilty.","“Patriarch Li, this time I’m not good at learning, and I’m really ashamed for not being able to cure Young Master Li. However, this old man has seen some clues...”","“What’s the clue, please tell me quickly!” Li Shihong seemed to be a little hopeful, so he immediately asked.","Doctor Lin didn’t answer right away, but frowned and thought for a while before slowly opening his mouth, “To be honest, the result of the old man’s pulse just now seems... Apart from his own profound energy, Young Master Li has another source of energy.” A powerful energy, and a conflict occurred during the fusion of the two energies, which made the Young Master unconscious...”","“Powerful energy? What energy?” Li Shihong was taken aback.","He never expected that Miracle Doctor Lin would say that.","Previously, the famous doctors invited by the Cloudy Qilin Clan to treat Li Moying, there were eighty if not a hundred, and no one had ever raised such a point of view.","However, it was the famous doctor Lin who said this, so Li Shihong had to pay attention to it.","Doctor Lin said: “This is what makes this old man feel strange the most. The energy in the young nobleman’s body feels like it has been invaded by evil qi.”","“What? Evil qi!!!”","When Li Shihong heard the words, he almost screamed out!","“How could it be evil? It’s impossible! Doctor Lin, have you really diagnosed it?!”","Li Shihong felt that his heart almost stopped beating, and a heart rose to his throat.","For cultivators in the God Realm, evil qi are very taboo. Because, there have been rumours since ancient times that once a cultivator is infected with evil qi, no matter whether he actively chooses to become an evil cultivator or is accidentally invaded by evil qi, the result will be the same.","Under the influence of evil qi, a cultivator’s temperament will begin to undergo drastic changes. People will gradually become irritable, bloodthirsty, and ruthless, until they commit murder and arson.","In the end, they will even lose their self-awareness, know nothing except improving their cultivation and killing people, and become even more terrifying than the demons!"]}]);
